for LCD and DLP resin 3D printers operating at 405 nm, this upgraded resin delivers exceptional print quality while simplifying post-processing with water instead of alcohol.<br><br><img src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/imgi_238_ELEGOO-Water-Washable-V2.0-3D-Printer-Resin-PC.jpeg\" alt=\"ELEGOO Water-Washable Resin V2.0\" width=\"428\" height=\"218\"></span><br></p>\n<h3>Key Features of ELEGOO Water-Washable Resin V2.0</h3>\n<p><strong>1. Water-Washable Formula</strong><span> </span>No more chemical hassles. This resin can be easily rinsed with ordinary tap water, making post-processing safer and more convenient. Ideal for homes, schools, and office setups.</p>\n<p><strong>2. High Print Precision</strong><span> </span>The low viscosity and refined chemical composition of ELEGOO Water-Washable Resin V2.0 enable the printing of extremely fine details. Your miniatures, engineering models, and design prototypes come out with sharp features and minimal distortion.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Fast UV Curing</strong><span> </span>Designed for use with 405nm UV light, the resin cures quickly and efficiently, improving production time without sacrificing quality. A great option for batch printing and time-sensitive projects.</p>\n<p><strong>4. Low Odor and Safer for Indoor Use</strong><span> </span>Unlike conventional resins that emit strong chemical smells, ELEGOO’s upgraded formula ensures a more pleasant printing experience, even in enclosed workspaces.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Broad Compatibility</strong><span> </span>ELEGOO Water-Washable Resin V2.0 is compatible with a wide range of 3D printers, including:<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mars, Saturn, Jupiter Series,<span> </span></strong><strong>Anycubic Photon Mono, M3, M5 Series,<span> </span></strong><strong>Phrozen Series,<span> </span></strong><strong>Creality Series and<span> </span></strong><strong>Other LCD, MSLA, and DLP printers using 405nm UV wavelength<br></strong><br></p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCo