ht bar &amp; 4.3-inch color touchscreen for intuitive control</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>300°C nozzle temperature &amp; 110°C heated bed with Sprite direct drive extruder<br><br></p>\n<div class=\"accordion-title\" data-bs-target=\"#specification\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"specification\" role=\"button\">\n<span>Specifications</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</div>\n<div id=\"specification\" class=\"collapse show\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-material\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>Printing Technology :</b><span> </span>FDM (Fused Filament Fabrication)</li>\n<li>\n<b>Build Volume :</b><span> </span>260 × 260 × 255 mm</li>\n<li>\n<b>Printer Size :</b><span> </span>470 × 423 × 456 mm</li>\n<li>\n<b>Weight :</b><span> </span>9.12 kg</li>\n<li>\n<b>Display :</b><span> </span>2.85-inch color touchscreen</li>\n<li>\n<b>Max Printing Speed :</b><span> </span>≤ 500 mm/s</li>\n<li>\n<b>Acceleration :</b><span> </span>≤ 10,000 mm/s²</li>\n<li>\n<b>Layer Height :</b><span> </span>0.05 – 0.3 mm</li>\n<li>\n<b>Printing Accuracy :</b><span> </span>±0.1 mm (approx.)</li>\n<li>\n<b>Nozzle Temp :</b><span> </span>Up to 300°C</li>\n<li>\n<b>Bed Temp :</b><span> </span>Up to 100°C</li>\n<li>\n<b>Supported Filaments :</b><span> </span>PLA / PLA-Silk,PETG,TPU,PLA-CF</li>\n<li>\n<b>Extruder Type :</b><span> </span>Direct Drive</li>\n<li>\n<b>Nozzle :</b><span> </span>0.4 mm (supports 0.2 / 0.6 / 0.8 mm)</li>\n<li>\n<b>Build Plate :</b><span> </span>Dual-sided textured PEI</li>\n<li>\n<b>Quick-Swap Hotend :</b><span> </span>Yes (tool-free)</li>\n<li>\n<b>Leveling :</b><span> </span>Full Auto Bed Leveling</li>\n<li>\n<b>AI Camera :</b><span> </span>720p with lighting</li>\n<li>\n<b>AI Detection :</b><span> </span>Spaghetti detection, Air printing detection, Filament issues monitoring</li>\n<li>\n<b>Pressure Advance :</b><span> </span>Yes (better corners &amp; finish)</li>\n<li>\n<b>Input Shaping :</b><span> </span>Yes (reduces vibration artifacts)</li>\n<li>\n<b>RGB Status Light :</b><span> </span>Customizable</li>\n<li>\n<b>Connectivity :</b><span> </span>Wi-Fi / USB Drive</li>\n<li>\n<b>File Formats :</b><span> </span>G-code / 3MF</li>\n<li>\n<b>Storage :</b><span> </span>8GB eMMC</li>\n<li>\n<b>Slicer :</b><span> </span>Creality Print 6.3+</li>\n<li>\n<b>Firmware :</b><span> </span>Creality OS<br><br><img src=\"https://www.3idea.in/assets/images/products/6169-Product-Image2.jpg\" alt=\"Creality SPARKX i7 3D Printer\" width=\"424\" height=\"406\"><br><img src=\"https://www.3idea.in/assets/images/products/6169-Product-Image3.jpg\" alt=\"Creality SPARKX i7 3D Printer\" width=\"425\" height=\"383\"><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443884318-31649931.png"]},{"id":"893bf275-5e43-4196-9000-92373bd3786d","mrp":1399,"sku":"hotend-kit-for-bambu-lab-p1-x1-p1p-x1c-p1s","name":"Hotend Kit for Bambu Lab P1 X1 P1P X1C P1S","slug":"hotend-kit-for-bambu-lab-p1-x1-p1p-x1c-p1s","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","stock":6,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443885613-241121846.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"d405ed61-dcc2-456c-a063-f168836c0a7b","sku":"hotend-kit-for-bambu-lab-p1-x1-p1p-x1c-p1s-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"1399","stock":6,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443885613-241121846.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"200","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:11.898Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"893bf275-5e43-4196-9000-92373bd3786d","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:11.89