delivers excellent print quality and stable operation for everyday and professional 3D printing applications.</p>\n<p data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"608\">Compatible with Bambu Lab P1P, P1S, X1, X1C, A1, and A1 Mini models (depending on selected version), this hotend kit features durable construction, efficient heat dissipation, and easy installation. Ideal for replacing worn-out hotends or upgrading your printer for improved reliability and precision.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19zqy0x\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"622\">Features</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"968\">\n<li data-section-id=\"d0idym\" data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"660\">Fast and stable heating performance</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1tehzac\" data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"703\">Smooth and consistent filament extrusion</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1i4zobc\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"753\">Durable metal construction for long-lasting use</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1vp865y\" data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"801\">Efficient cooling and heat dissipation design</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"kzmy6n\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"837\">Easy installation and replacement</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"fizb7u\" data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"886\">Suitable for high-speed and precision printing</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1118rfe\" data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"968\">Compatible with multiple filament types including PLA, PETG, ABS, TPU, and more</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yl5694\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"988\">Specifications</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1201\">\n<li data-section-id=\"zncdhi\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1034\">Product Type: Hotend Kit / Hot End Assembly</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"7r04rd\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1103\">Material: Aluminum Alloy + Stainless Steel + Electronic Components</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1vsure5\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1158\">Application: 3D Printer Hotend Replacement &amp; Upgrade</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"tn4gdg\" data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1201\">Compatibility: Bambu Lab Series Printers</li>\n</ul>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443885613-241121846.png"]},{"id":"a7475ce7-b899-4a92-a8c4-9ec9a198ce5b","mrp":105999,"sku":"elegoo-jupiter-2-3d-printer-ai-monitoring-auto-leveling-ultra-smooth-printing","name":"ELEGOO Jupiter 2 3D Printer – AI Monitoring, Auto Leveling & Ultra Smooth Printing","slug":"elegoo-jupiter-2-3d-printer-ai-monitoring-auto-leveling-ultra-smooth-printing","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886431-388951663.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886429-390984445.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"0999f797-e290-449f-94bb-fc7cd79c1c05","sku":"elegoo-jupiter-2-3d-printer-ai-monitoring-auto-leveling-ultra-smooth-printing-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"105999","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886431-388951663.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"25000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:16.423Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"a7475ce7-b899-4a92-a8c4-9ec9a198ce5b","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:16.423Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886431-388951663.webp","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886431-388951663.webp"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886431-388951663.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886431-388951663.webp"}],"salePrice":105999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886431-388951663.webp","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":105999,"description":"<p><span>The world of large-format resin 3D printing is entering a new era, and the launch of </span><strong data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"788\">Elegoo Debuts Jupiter 2 Large-Format Resin 3D Printer for Bigger Ideas and Smarter Engineering at RAPID+TCT 2025</strong><span> marks a significant step forward for both professionals and passionate creators<br>The <strong data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1318\">Elegoo Debuts Jupiter 2 Large-Format Resin 3D Printer for Bigger Ideas and Smarter Engineering at RAPID+TCT 2025</strong> introduces an entirely upgraded approach to high-volume resin printing. This model is more than an incremental improvement—it reflects a new design philosophy focused on accessibility, consistency, and smarter engineering. Built for users who require a large build area, precision detailing, and reliable long-term performance, the Jupiter 2 stands as Elegoo’s most advanced resin printer to date.</span><br></p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1771\"><strong data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1771\">A New Benchmark in Large-Format Resin Printing</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"2349\">Unveiled at the prestigious Rapid + TCT 2025 event in Detroit, the<span> </span><strong data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1956\">Elegoo Debuts Jupiter 2 Large-Format Resin 3D Printer for Bigger Ideas and Smarter Engineering at RAPID+TCT 2025</strong><span> </span>instantly captured the attention of engineers, product designers, prop makers, and manufacturing professionals. With a massive<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2112\">302.40 × 161.98 × 300 mm</strong><span> </span>build volume, it is now the largest resin printer in the entire Elegoo lineup—ideal for large prototypes, medical models, engineering components, hobby builds, and intricate display pieces that demand size without compromising accuracy.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2646\">The system features an ultra-high-resolution<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2426\">14-inch 16K monochrome LCD</strong>, delivering crisp details with an impressive<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2500\">20 × 26 µm XY resolution</strong>. The result? Razor-sharp models with beautifully smooth surfaces, making the printer suitable for applications where precision is non-negotiable.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2934\">Elegoo has also introduced a<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2708\">fully enclosed light engine</strong>, designed to deliver evenly distributed curing, reducing model defects and enhancing layer uniformity. Whether you’re printing functional parts or artistic creations, the Jupiter 2 ensures premium output right out of the box.<br></p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-61e25991 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"61e25991\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-405efc8f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"405efc8f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u0ybrq\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1517\">Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"846b68\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1556\">\n<strong>Ultra-High 16K Printing Precision:</strong><span> </span>The 14-inch 16K LCD screen delivers ultra-high resolution and exceptional detail. As a result, users can produce highly detailed models with smooth surfaces, which makes the printer ideal for professional applications.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"co316l\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1822\">\n<strong>Massive Large-Format Build Volume</strong>: The large 302.4 × 161.98 × 300 mm build area allows users to print large models effortlessly. Additionally, users can print multiple parts simultaneously, which significantly increases production efficiency.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"18qd9c9\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2073\">\n<strong>Auto-Leveling System:</strong><span> </span>The multi-point automatic bed leveling system calibrates the build plate accurately before printing. Therefore, it ensures consistent print quality and reliable results. Moreover, users can also perform manual leveling for precise adjustments when needed.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9nk85\" data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2388\">\n<strong>Smart Resin Tank with Temperature Control:</strong><span> </span>The intelligent resin tank preheats the resin and maintains an optimal temperature automatically. As a result, the printer delivers stable resin flow and consistent print quality even in varying environments.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qj697i\" data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2646\">\n<strong>Automatic Resin Feeding &amp; Recycling:</strong><span> </span>The smart resin management system automatically supplies resin during printing. Additionally, it recycles unused resin, which helps reduce material waste. Furthermore, the detachable resin box supports a 2KG resin bottle, making large print jobs more convenient.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1b5ed17\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2953\">\n<strong>Quick and Easy Maintenance:</strong><span> </span>The modular design allows users to replace the LCD screen in just 10 minutes. Consequently, this reduces downtime and ensures faster maintenance.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"hgahd8\" data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3144\">\n<strong>Ultra-Fast Release Film Replacement:</strong><span> </span>Users can replace the release film in only 10 seconds, which is up to 10× faster than traditional systems. Therefore, maintenance becomes quicker and more efficient.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"px5q9y\" data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3364\">\n<strong>Built-In Camera for Real-Time Monitoring:</strong><span> </span>The integrated camera allows users to monitor prints remotely in real time. In addition, the adaptive lighting system ensures clear visibility even in low-light environments.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5mh0r3\" data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3573\">\n<strong>User-Friendly Design:</strong><span> </span>The printer features a practical and user-friendly design for everyday operation. For instance, the double-door front allows easy access for removing prints, while the clear viewing window helps users monitor prints quickly. Moreover, rubberized corners provide additional protection, and the resin drip tray keeps the workspace clean.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xwcgeq\" data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"3960\">\n<strong>Compatible with Mars Mate:</strong><span> </span>The Elegoo Mars Mate Air Purifier works seamlessly with the Elegoo Jupiter 2 16K Resin 3D Printer. As a result, it helps reduce resin odors and creates a cleaner and more comfortable printing environment.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ce04ff e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"4ce04ff\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab89ddd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ab89ddd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"510\" height=\"209\" src=\"https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14134836/4.jpg-1.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-69537\" alt=\"Elegoo Jupiter 2\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b71043 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"1b71043\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2178526 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2178526\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-52c66bb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"52c66bb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"511\" height=\"383\" src=\"https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153558/jupiter-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-69549\" alt=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05e46ff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"05e46ff\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d571760 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d571760\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"509\" height=\"382\" src=\"https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153553/Untitled-design-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-69547\" alt=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-833b4ae e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"833b4ae\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff5af0e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ff5af0e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6480542 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6480542\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"511\" height=\"383\" src=\"https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153551/Untitled-design-2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-69546\" alt=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e969990 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e969990\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2084c4c elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2084c4c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"511\" height=\"383\" src=\"https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153548/Untitled-design.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-69545\" alt=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df0275e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"df0275e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-86a4354 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"86a4354\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-90ad624 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"90ad624\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"511\" height=\"383\" src=\"https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153546/5-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-69544\" alt=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-921e0f3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"921e0f3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34e5c9d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"34e5c9d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"511\" height=\"383\" src=\"https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153544/6.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-69543\" alt=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-51d8055 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"51d8055\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f43d16 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0f43d16\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9c8cd83 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"9c8cd83\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"511\" height=\"383\" src=\"https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153555/jupiter-2-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-69548\" alt=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0e9fef0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0e9fef0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35c4467 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"35c4467\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"511\" height=\"383\" src=\"https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153600/8.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-69550\" alt=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f0cc03 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"0f0cc03\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6685935 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6685935\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"510\" height=\"123\" src=\"https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14155124/last-image-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-69553\" alt=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886431-388951663.webp","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886431-388951663.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886429-390984445.webp"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886431-388951663.webp"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443886429-390984445.webp","shortDescription":"<p><span>The world of large-format resin 3D printing is entering a new era, and the launch of </span><strong data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"788\">Elegoo Debuts Jupiter 2 Large-Format Resin 3D Printer for Bigger Ideas and Smarter Engineering at RAPID+TCT 2025</strong><span> marks a significant step forward for both professionals and passionate creators<br>The <strong data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1318\">Elegoo Debuts Jupiter 2 Large-Format Resin 3D Printer for Bigger Ideas and Smarter Engineering at RAPID+TCT 2025</strong> introduces an entirely upgraded approach to high-volume resin printing. This model is more than an incremental improvement—it reflects a new design philosophy focused on accessibility, consistency, and smarter engineering. Built for users who require a large build area, precision detailing, and reliable long-term performance, the Jupiter 2 stands as Elegoo’s most advanced resin printer to date.</span><br></p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1771\"><strong data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1771\">A New Benchmark in Large-Format Resin Printing</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"2349\">Unveiled at the prestigious Rapid + TCT 2025 event in Detroit, the<span> </span><strong data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1956\">Elegoo Debuts Jupiter 2 Large-Format Resin 3D Printer for Bigger Ideas and Smarter Engineering at RAPID+TCT 2025</strong><span> </span>instantly captured the attention of engineers, product designers, prop makers, and manufacturing professionals. With a massive<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2112\">302.40 × 161.98 × 300 mm</strong><span> </span>build volume, it is now the largest resin printer in the entire Elegoo lineup—ideal for large prototypes, medical models, engineering components, hobby builds, and intricate display pieces that demand size without compromising accuracy.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2646\">The system features an ultra-high-resolution<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2426\">14-inch 16K monochrome LCD</strong>, delivering crisp details with an impressive<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2500\">20 × 26 µm XY resolution</strong>. The result? Razor-sharp models with beautifully smooth surfaces, making the printer suitable for applications where precision is non-negotiable.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2934\">Elegoo has also introduced a<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2708\">fully enclosed light engine</strong>, designed to deliver evenly distributed curing, reducing model defects and enhancing layer uniformity. Whether you’re printing functional parts or artistic creations, the Jupiter 2 ensures premium output right out of the box.<br></p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-61e25991 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"61e25991\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-405efc8f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"405efc8f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u0ybrq\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1517\">Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"846b68\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1556\">\n<strong>Ultra-High 16K Printing Precision:</strong><span> </span>The 14-inch 16K LCD screen delivers ultra-high resolution and exceptional detail. As a result, users can produce highly detailed models with smooth surfaces, which makes the printer ideal for professional applications.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"co316l\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1822\">\n<strong>Massive Large-Format Build Volume</strong>: The large 302.4 × 161.98 × 300 mm build area allows users to print large models effortlessly. Additionally, users can print multiple parts simultaneously, which significantly increases production efficiency.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"18qd9c9\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2073\">\n<strong>Auto-Leveling System:</strong><span> </span>The multi-point automatic bed leveling system calibrates the build plate accurately before printing. Therefore, it ensures consistent print quality and reliable results. Moreover, users can also perform manual leveling for precise adjustments when needed.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9nk85\" data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2388\">\n<strong>Smart Resin Tank with Temperature Control:</strong><span> </span>The intelligent resin tank preheats the resin and maintains an optimal temperature automatically. As a result, the printer delivers stable resin flow and consistent print quality even in varying environments.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qj697i\" data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2646\">\n<strong>Automatic Resin Feeding &amp; Recycling:</strong><span> </span>The smart resin management system automatically supplies resin during printing. Additionally, it recycles unused resin, which helps reduce material waste. Furthermore, the detachable resin box supports a 2KG resin bottle, making large print jobs more convenient.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1b5ed17\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2953\">\n<strong>Quick and Easy Maintenance:</strong><span> </span>The modular design allows users to replace the LCD screen in just 10 minutes. Consequently, this reduces downtime and ensures faster maintenance.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"hgahd8\" data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3144\">\n<strong>Ultra-Fast Release Film Replacement:</strong><span> </span>Users can replace the release film in only 10 seconds, which is up to 10× faster than traditional systems. Therefore, maintenance becomes quicker and more efficient.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"px5q9y\" data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3364\">\n<strong>Built-In Camera for Real-Time Monitoring:</strong><span> </span>The integrated camera allows users to monitor prints remotely in real time. In addition, the adaptive lighting system ensures clear visibility even in low-light environments.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5mh0r3\" data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3573\">\n<strong>User-Friendly Design:</strong><span> </span>The printer features a practical and user-friendly design for everyday operation. For instance, the double-door front allows easy access for removing prints, while the clear viewing window helps users monitor prints quickly. Moreover, rubberized corners provide additional protection, and the resin drip tray keeps the workspace clean.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xwcgeq\" data-start=\"3931\" data-end=\"3960\">\n<strong>Compatible with Mars Mate:</strong><span> </span>The Elegoo Mars Mate Air Purifier works seamlessly with the Elegoo Jupiter 2 16K Resin 3D Printer. As a result, it helps reduce resin odors and creates a cleaner and more comfortable printing environment.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ce04ff e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"4ce04ff\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab89ddd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ab89ddd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"510\" height=\"209\" src=\"https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14134836/4.jpg-1.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-69537\" alt=\"Elegoo Jupiter 2\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b71043 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"1b71043\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2178526 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2178526\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-52c66bb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"52c66bb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"511\" height=\"383\" src=\"https://wol3d.blr1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/14153558/jupiter-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-69549\" alt=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05e46ff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"05e46ff\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d571760 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d571760\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widg