" data-end=\"883\">Fast Curing:</strong> Optimized for efficient printing with shorter exposure times.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1034\">\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1034\"><strong data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"973\">Wide Compatibility:</strong> Works seamlessly with most LCD/DLP 3D printers (405nm UV).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1060\"><strong data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1058\">Applications:</strong></h4>\n<ul data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1229\">\n<li data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1102\">\n<p data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1102\">Engineering and functional prototypes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1140\">\n<p data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1140\">Miniatures, models, and figurines</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1191\">\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1191\">Durable parts requiring strength and precision</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1229\">\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1229\">Educational and research projects</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1250\"><strong data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1248\">Caution:</strong></h4>\n<ul data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1425\">\n<li data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1277\">\n<p data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1277\">Shake well before use.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1320\">\n<p data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1320\">Wear gloves and a mask while handling.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1378\">\n<p data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1378\">Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1425\">\n<p data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1425\">Post-cure under UV light for best results.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443954250-933876380.png"]},{"id":"a12db046-1afc-461d-a3e2-01def4c3f039","mrp":46999,"sku":"creality-sparkx-i7-combo-3d-printer","name":"Creality SPARKX i7 Combo 3D Printer","slug":"creality-sparkx-i7-combo-3d-printer","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443890530-419247617.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889867-552990252.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889669-478859701.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889633-190488225.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"273917f1-5b35-4b3b-8c71-1fdf41e77202","sku":"creality-sparkx-i7-combo-3d-printer-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"46999","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443890530-419247617.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"20000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:25.251Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"a12db046-1afc-461d-a3e2-01def4c3f039","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:25.251Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443890530-419247617.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443890530-419247617.jpg"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443890530-419247617.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443890530-419247617.jpg"}],"salePrice":46999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443890530-419247617.jpg","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":46999,"description":"<h6 class=\"text-main fw-small\">Product Features</h6>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>AI Photo-to-3D: One-tap photo to print, no modeling required.</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>50% Less-Waste Multicolor: Richer colors, less filament waste.</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>45 dB Night Mode: Runs as softly as turning a page. Fits seamlessly in any home, office, or studio—even overnight.</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>Custom RGB Lighting: Print status visible at a glance.</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>Beginner-Friendly: Easy setup, from box to first print in under 5 minutes.</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>Quick-Swap Parts: Tool-free part replacement for easy maintenance and minimal downtime.<br><br></p>\n<p>Creality SPARKX i7 3D Printer – Smart AI Desktop Multicolor 3D Printer</p>\n<p>The Creality SPARKX i7 3D Printer is a next-generation smart AI desktop 3D printer designed for effortless, high-precision 3D printing. Built with advanced features such as AI-powered print monitoring, automatic bed leveling, and quick-swap maintenance components, the SPARKX i7 ensures reliable performance and professional-quality prints.</p>\n<p>With a large 260 × 260 × 255 mm build volume, this Creality 3D printer is capable of printing everything from detailed miniatures, figurines, prototypes, and gaming accessories to large functional models. The printer also supports multicolor 3D printing with up to 4 colors, helping creators produce vibrant and complex models while reducing filament waste.</p>\n<p>The built-in AI camera monitoring system detects common printing issues such as spaghetti failure, filament tangling, air printing, and build plate errors in real time, improving overall print success rates. The programmable RGB status lighting system visually indicates the printing status, keeping users informed throughout the printing process.</p>\n<p>With ultra-quiet 30 dB night mode operation, automatic calibration, and a fast 5-minute setup, the SPARKX i7 provides a seamless and user-friendly 3D printing experience. Whether you are a beginner, hobbyist, designer, educator, or professional maker, this smart Creality 3D printer makes creating high-quality models easier than ever.<br><br></p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4897b4db e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"4897b4db\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3272e9a2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3272e9a2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:09bb7efe-8f99-4536-b19f-e706352d7a34-49\" data-test