443890530-419247617.jpg"]},{"id":"3401a9c8-c20f-4d5e-8415-23f8754e030a","mrp":66999,"sku":"anycubic-kobra-x-combo-7-colors-large-format-3d-printer","name":"Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors) Large-Format 3D Printer","slug":"anycubic-kobra-x-combo-7-colors-large-format-3d-printer","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","stock":2,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889748-957392332.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889783-532682298.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889501-585024043.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443890187-96190385.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891468-546584425.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"cc1ed5e0-3a62-4c46-a564-2cef339aa44e","sku":"anycubic-kobra-x-combo-7-colors-large-format-3d-printer-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"66999","stock":2,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889748-957392332.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"20000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:27.093Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"3401a9c8-c20f-4d5e-8415-23f8754e030a","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:27.093Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889748-957392332.webp","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889748-957392332.webp"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889748-957392332.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889748-957392332.webp"}],"salePrice":66999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889748-957392332.webp","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":66999,"description":"<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>is a high-performance<span> </span><strong>large-format FDM 3D printer</strong><span> </span>designed for creators, engineers, educators, and businesses that require<span> </span><strong>large build size, stable printing, material flexibility, and reliable automation</strong>. This combo edition is bundled with<span> </span><strong>7 filament colors</strong>, making it an ideal all-in-one solution for<span> </span><strong>prototyping, education, design validation, and creative production</strong>.</p>\n<p data-end=\"569\" data-start=\"485\">Powered by intelligent features and robust mechanical design from<span> </span><strong>Anycubic</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>delivers professional-grade output while remaining accessible for beginners.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"1178\"><br></h2>\n<h2 data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"1178\">Built Bigger for Bigger Ideas</h2>\n<p>One of the biggest strengths of the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>is its massive<span> </span><strong>300 × 300 × 400 mm build volume</strong>. This allows users to print<span> </span><strong>large models in one piece</strong><span> </span>or produce<span> </span><strong>multiple components simultaneously</strong>, significantly improving workflow efficiency.</p>\n<p><strong>Ideal applications include:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Functional and mechanical prototypes</li>\n<li>Jigs, fixtures, and tooling</li>\n<li>Architectural and engineering models</li>\n<li>Educational demonstrations and lab projects</li>\n<li>Cosplay props, helmets, and enclosures</li>\n<li>Small-batch production and custom parts</li>\n</ul>\n<p>With the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong>, you no longer need to compromise on model size or split designs into multiple sections.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"1749\" data-start=\"1699\"><br></h2>\n<h2 data-end=\"1749\" data-start=\"1699\"> Auto Bed Leveling – Print with Confidence</h2>\n<p>Bed leveling is often the most frustrating part of 3D printing. The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>eliminates this issue using<span> </span><strong>LeviQ intelligent auto bed leveling</strong><span> </span>technology.</p>\n<p>This system automatically measures the print bed at multiple points and compensates for uneven surfaces, ensuring:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Excellent first-layer adhesion</li>\n<li>Reduced print failures</li>\n<li>Faster setup and calibration</li>\n<li>Stress-free operation for beginners</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Thanks to LeviQ, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>is one of the most beginner-friendly large-format 3D printers available.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"2312\" data-start=\"2261\"><br></h2>\n<h2 data-end=\"2312\" data-start=\"2261\">Direct Drive Extruder for Accuracy &amp; Flexibility</h2>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>direct drive extruder</strong><span> </span>places the extrusion motor close to the nozzle, giving the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>precise filament control and smooth material flow. This setup is especially beneficial for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Flexible filaments like<span> </span><strong>TPU</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Detailed models with frequent retractions</li>\n<li>Functional mechanical parts</li>\n<li>Long and continuous print jobs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Paired with an<span> </span><strong>all-metal hotend</strong>, the printer supports higher temperatures and consistent extrusion even during extended production runs.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"2802\" data-start=\"2761\"><br></h2>\n<h2 data-end=\"2802\" data-start=\"2761\">Stability, and Silent Operation</h2>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>offers an excellent balance between speed and precision, supporting print speeds of up to<span> </span><strong>100 mm/s</strong><span> </span>without compromising surface quality.</p>\n<p>Key structural advantages include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Dual Z-axis system</strong><span> </span>for tall, stable prints</li>\n<li>Reinforced metal frame to reduce vibration and wobble</li>\n<li>Silent motherboard and optimized stepper drivers</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This makes the printer suitable for<span> </span><strong>homes, offices, classrooms, labs, and professional workspaces</strong>.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"3298\" data-start=\"3268\"><br></h2>\n<h2 data-end=\"3298\" data-start=\"3268\">Material Compatibility</h2>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>supports a wide range of commonly used filaments:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>PLA</strong><span> </span>– easy and beginner-friendly</li>\n<li>\n<strong>ABS</strong><span> </span>– strong and heat-resistant</li>\n<li>\n<strong>PETG</strong><span> </span>– durable and slightly flexible</li>\n<li>\n<strong>TPU</strong><span> </span>– elastic and impact-resistant</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The included<span> </span><strong>7 filament colors</strong><span> </span>enable<span> </span><strong>multi-color prototyping, visual part identification, teaching demonstrations, and creative design work</strong>, right out of the box.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"3745\" data-start=\"3693\"><br></h2>\n<h2 data-end=\"3745\" data-start=\"3693\">Trusted by Professionals.</h2>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>is designed for reliability and long prints, featuring:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Filament run-out detection</li>\n<li>Power-loss recovery (resume printing)</li>\n<li>Responsive touchscreen interface</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These features protect long print jobs, reduce material waste, and make the printer dependable for<span> </span><strong>business, institutional, and educational environments</strong>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img height=\"482\" width=\"482\" src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-7_668a6f1d-1d33-4402-b6c3-9b0da25c036f.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\"></p>\n<p><img height=\"481\" width=\"481\" src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-5.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\"></p>\n<p><img height=\"484\" width=\"484\" src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-6.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\"></p>\n<p><img height=\"484\" width=\"484\" src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-8.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\"></p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889748-957392332.webp","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889748-957392332.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889783-532682298.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889501-585024043.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443890187-96190385.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891468-546584425.webp"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889748-957392332.webp"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889783-532682298.webp","shortDescription":"<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>is a high-performance<span> </span><strong>large-format FDM 3D printer</strong><span> </span>designed for creators, engineers, educators, and businesses that require<span> </span><strong>large build size, stable printing, material flexibility, and reliable automation</strong>. This combo edition is bundled with<span> </span><strong>7 filament colors</strong>, making it an ideal all-in-one solution for<span> </span><strong>prototyping, education, design validation, and creative production</strong>.</p>\n<p data-end=\"569\" data-start=\"485\">Powered by intelligent features and robust mechanical design from<span> </span><strong>Anycubic</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>delivers professional-grade output while remaining accessible for beginners.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"1178\"><br></h2>\n<h2 data-end=\"1210\" data-start=\"1178\">Built Bigger for Bigger Ideas</h2>\n<p>One of the biggest strengths of the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>is its massive<span> </span><strong>300 × 300 × 400 mm build volume</strong>. This allows users to print<span> </span><strong>large models in one piece</strong><span> </span>or produce<span> </span><strong>multiple components simultaneously</strong>, significantly improving workflow efficiency.</p>\n<p><strong>Ideal applications include:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Functional and mechanical prototypes</li>\n<li>Jigs, fixtures, and tooling</li>\n<li>Architectural and engineering models</li>\n<li>Educational demonstrations and lab projects</li>\n<li>Cosplay props, helmets, and enclosures</li>\n<li>Small-batch production and custom parts</li>\n</ul>\n<p>With the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong>, you no longer need to compromise on model size or split designs into multiple sections.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"1749\" data-start=\"1699\"><br></h2>\n<h2 data-end=\"1749\" data-start=\"1699\"> Auto Bed Leveling – Print with Confidence</h2>\n<p>Bed leveling is often the most frustrating part of 3D printing. The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>eliminates this issue using<span> </span><strong>LeviQ intelligent auto bed leveling</strong><span> </span>technology.</p>\n<p>This system automatically measures the print bed at multiple points and compensates for uneven surfaces, ensuring:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Excellent first-layer adhesion</li>\n<li>Reduced print failures</li>\n<li>Faster setup and calibration</li>\n<li>Stress-free operation for beginners</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Thanks to LeviQ, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>is one of the most beginner-friendly large-format 3D printers available.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"2312\" data-start=\"2261\"><br></h2>\n<h2 data-end=\"2312\" data-start=\"2261\">Direct Drive Extruder for Accuracy &amp; Flexibility</h2>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>direct drive extruder</strong><span> </span>places the extrusion motor close to the nozzle, giving the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>precise filament control and smooth material flow. This setup is especially beneficial for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Flexible filaments like<span> </span><strong>TPU</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Detailed models with frequent retractions</li>\n<li>Functional mechanical parts</li>\n<li>Long and continuous print jobs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Paired with an<span> </span><strong>all-metal hotend</strong>, the printer supports higher temperatures and consistent extrusion even during extended production runs.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"2802\" data-start=\"2761\"><br></h2>\n<h2 data-end=\"2802\" data-start=\"2761\">Stability, and Silent Operation</h2>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>offers an excellent balance between speed and precision, supporting print speeds of up to<span> </span><strong>100 mm/s</strong><span> </span>without compromising surface quality.</p>\n<p>Key structural advantages include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Dual Z-axis system</strong><span> </span>for tall, stable prints</li>\n<li>Reinforced metal frame to reduce vibration and wobble</li>\n<li>Silent motherboard and optimized stepper drivers</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This makes the printer suitable for<span> </span><strong>homes, offices, classrooms, labs, and professional workspaces</strong>.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"3298\" data-start=\"3268\"><br></h2>\n<h2 data-end=\"3298\" data-start=\"3268\">Material Compatibility</h2>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>supports a wide range of commonly used filaments:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>PLA</strong><span> </span>– easy and beginner-friendly</li>\n<li>\n<strong>ABS</strong><span> </span>– strong and heat-resistant</li>\n<li>\n<strong>PETG</strong><span> </span>– durable and slightly flexible</li>\n<li>\n<strong>TPU</strong><span> </span>– elastic and impact-resistant</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The included<span> </span><strong>7 filament colors</strong><span> </span>enable<span> </span><strong>multi-color prototyping, visual part identification, teaching demonstrations, and creative design work</strong>, right out of the box.</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"3745\" data-start=\"3693\"><br></h2>\n<h2 data-end=\"3745\" data-start=\"3693\">Trusted by Professionals.</h2>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra X Combo (7 Colors)</strong><span> </span>is designed for reliability and long prints, featuring:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Filament run-out detection</li>\n<li>Power-loss recovery (resume printing)</li>\n<li>Responsive touchscreen interface</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These features protect long print jobs, reduce material waste, and make the printer dependable for<span> </span><strong>business, institutional, and educational environments</strong>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img height=\"482\" width=\"482\" src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-7_668a6f1d-1d33-4402-b6c3-9b0da25c036f.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\"></p>\n<p><img height=\"481\" width=\"481\" src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-5.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\"></p>\n<p><img height=\"484\" width=\"484\" src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-6.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\"></p>\n<p><img height=\"484\" width=\"484\" src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-8.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\"></p>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889748-957392332.webp"]},{"id":"31285619-6c72-4c77-b631-c2a30f98de75","mrp":40999,"sku":"anycubic-kobra-x-3d-printer","name":"Anycubic Kobra X 3D Printer","slug":"anycubic-kobra-x-3d-printer","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889791-570155096.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889793-958549371.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889865-56333190.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443890157-980423507.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"314587ce-2d53-49f8-9b79-4b384c902e41","sku":"anycubic-kobra-x-3d-printer-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"40999","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889791-570155096.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"20000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:29.008Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"31285619-6c72-4c77-b631-c2a30f98de75","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:29.008Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889791-570155096.webp","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889791-570155096.webp"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889791-570155096.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889791-570155096.webp"}],"salePrice":40999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889791-570155096.webp","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":40999,"description":"<p>The <strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"606\">Anycubic Kobra X 3D Printer</strong> is a powerful large-format FDM 3D printer engineered for creators who need <strong data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"718\">size, precision, and reliability</strong> in one complete package. Designed to support everyone from <strong data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"815\">first-time users to professionals</strong>, the Kobra X combines intelligent automation, robust mechanics, and a generous build volume to unlock serious production potential.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1210\"> Bigger Ideas</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1411\">With a <strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1262\">massive 260 × 260 ×260 mm build volume</strong>, the Anycubic Kobra X allows you to print <strong data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1339\">large models in a single piece</strong> or produce multiple parts simultaneously. This capability is ideal for:</p>\n<p data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1438\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Functional prototypes</p>\n<p data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1460\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Jigs and fixtures</p>\n<p data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1501\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Architectural and engineering models</p>\n<p data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1526\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Educational projects</p>\n<p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1559\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Cosplay props and enclosures</p>\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1592\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Small-batch production parts</p>\n<p data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1692\">No more splitting models or compromising on design size—print what you imagine, as you imagine it.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1749\"> Leveling – Print with Confidence</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"2019\">Manual bed leveling is one of the biggest pain points in 3D printing. The Kobra X solves this with <strong data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1907\">Anycubic’s LeviQ intelligent auto bed leveling system</strong>.<br data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1911\">Using precise multi-point detection, the printer automatically compensates for bed irregularities, ensuring:</p>\n<p data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2053\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Perfect first-layer adhesion</p>\n<p data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2080\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Reduced print failures</p>\n<p data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2102\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Faster setup time</p>\n<p data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2142\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Stress-free operation for beginners</p>\n<p data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2254\">This feature alone makes the Kobra X one of the most <strong data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2243\">beginner-friendly large-format 3D printers</strong> available.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2312\">Direct Drive Extruder for Accuracy &amp; Flexibility</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2504\">The <strong data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2343\">direct drive extruder</strong> places the motor closer to the nozzle, giving you precise filament control and smoother extrusion. This design significantly improves performance when printing:</p>\n<p data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2539\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Flexible materials like <strong data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2539\">TPU</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2574\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Detailed models with retractions</p>\n<p data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2604\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Functional mechanical parts</p>\n<p data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2754\">Paired with an <strong data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2641\">all-metal hotend</strong>, the printer supports high-temperature operation and maintains consistent extrusion even during long print jobs.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2802\"> Stability, and Silent Operation</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2964\">The Anycubic Kobra X achieves an excellent balance between <strong data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2886\">speed and precision</strong>, with print speeds of up to <strong data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2927\">100 mm/s</strong> without sacrificing surface quality.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"3112\">Its <strong data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"2992\">dual Z-axis system</strong> and reinforced frame enhance vertical stability, reducing wobble and layer shifts—especially important for tall prints.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3261\">A <strong data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3168\">silent motherboard and optimized stepper drivers</strong> keep noise levels low, making the printer suitable for homes, offices, labs, and classrooms.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3298\">Material Compatibility</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3374\">This printer supports a broad range of commonly used filaments, including:</p>\n<p data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3420\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3385\">PLA</strong> – easy, beginner-friendly prints</p>\n<p data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3463\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3430\">ABS</strong> – strong, heat-resistant parts</p>\n<p data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3510\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3474\">PETG</strong> – durable and flexible components</p>\n<p data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3558\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3520\">TPU</strong> – flexible and elastic applications</p>\n<p data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3686\">From rigid engineering parts to flexible functional components, the Kobra X adapts to diverse professional and creative needs.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3745\">Designed for Beginners. Trusted by Professionals.</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3863\">The Kobra X ships with <strong data-start=\"3770\" data-end=\"3787\">easy assembly</strong>, a <strong data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"3827\">responsive touchscreen interface</strong>, and smart safety features such as:</p>\n<p data-start=\"3867\" data-end=\"3895\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Filament run-out detection</p>\n<p data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3932\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Resume printing after power loss</p>\n<p data-start=\"3934\" data-end=\"4067\">These features protect long prints, reduce material waste, and make the printer dependable for business and educational environments.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-5.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\" width=\"459\" height=\"459\"><br><br><br><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-6.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\" width=\"458\" height=\"458\"></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-7_1d0acaf7-d82b-4f47-83e5-47bcb7710d39.jpg?v=1773401754&amp;width=1946\" width=\"458\" height=\"458\"></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-8.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\" width=\"454\" height=\"454\"></p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889791-570155096.webp","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889791-570155096.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889793-958549371.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889865-56333190.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443890157-980423507.webp"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889791-570155096.webp"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889793-958549371.webp","shortDescription":"<p>The <strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"606\">Anycubic Kobra X 3D Printer</strong> is a powerful large-format FDM 3D printer engineered for creators who need <strong data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"718\">size, precision, and reliability</strong> in one complete package. Designed to support everyone from <strong data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"815\">first-time users to professionals</strong>, the Kobra X combines intelligent automation, robust mechanics, and a generous build volume to unlock serious production potential.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1210\"> Bigger Ideas</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1411\">With a <strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1262\">massive 260 × 260 ×260 mm build volume</strong>, the Anycubic Kobra X allows you to print <strong data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1339\">large models in a single piece</strong> or produce multiple parts simultaneously. This capability is ideal for:</p>\n<p data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1438\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Functional prototypes</p>\n<p data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1460\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Jigs and fixtures</p>\n<p data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1501\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Architectural and engineering models</p>\n<p data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1526\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Educational projects</p>\n<p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1559\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Cosplay props and enclosures</p>\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1592\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Small-batch production parts</p>\n<p data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1692\">No more splitting models or compromising on design size—print what you imagine, as you imagine it.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1749\"> Leveling – Print with Confidence</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"2019\">Manual bed leveling is one of the biggest pain points in 3D printing. The Kobra X solves this with <strong data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1907\">Anycubic’s LeviQ intelligent auto bed leveling system</strong>.<br data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1911\">Using precise multi-point detection, the printer automatically compensates for bed irregularities, ensuring:</p>\n<p data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2053\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Perfect first-layer adhesion</p>\n<p data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2080\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Reduced print failures</p>\n<p data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2102\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Faster setup time</p>\n<p data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2142\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Stress-free operation for beginners</p>\n<p data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2254\">This feature alone makes the Kobra X one of the most <strong data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2243\">beginner-friendly large-format 3D printers</strong> available.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2312\">Direct Drive Extruder for Accuracy &amp; Flexibility</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2504\">The <strong data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2343\">direct drive extruder</strong> places the motor closer to the nozzle, giving you precise filament control and smoother extrusion. This design significantly improves performance when printing:</p>\n<p data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2539\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Flexible materials like <strong data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2539\">TPU</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2574\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Detailed models with retractions</p>\n<p data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2604\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Functional mechanical parts</p>\n<p data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2754\">Paired with an <strong data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2641\">all-metal hotend</strong>, the printer supports high-temperature operation and maintains consistent extrusion even during long print jobs.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2802\"> Stability, and Silent Operation</h2>\n<p data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2964\">The Anycubic Kobra X achieves an excellent balance between <strong data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2886\">speed and precision</strong>, with print speeds of up to <strong data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2927\">100 mm/s</strong> without sacrificing surface quality.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"3112\">Its <strong data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"2992\">dual Z-axis system</strong> and reinforced frame enhance vertical stability, reducing wobble and layer shifts—especially important for tall prints.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3261\">A <strong data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3168\">silent motherboard and optimized stepper drivers</strong> keep noise levels low, making the printer suitable for homes, offices, labs, and classrooms.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3298\">Material Compatibility</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3300\" data-end=\"3374\">This printer supports a broad range of commonly used filaments, including:</p>\n<p data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3420\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3385\">PLA</strong> – easy, beginner-friendly prints</p>\n<p data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3463\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3430\">ABS</strong> – strong, heat-resistant parts</p>\n<p data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3510\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3474\">PETG</strong> – durable and flexible components</p>\n<p data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3558\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong data-start=\"3513\" data-end=\"3520\">TPU</strong> – flexible and elastic applications</p>\n<p data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3686\">From rigid engineering parts to flexible functional components, the Kobra X adapts to diverse professional and creative needs.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3745\">Designed for Beginners. Trusted by Professionals.</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3863\">The Kobra X ships with <strong data-start=\"3770\" data-end=\"3787\">easy assembly</strong>, a <strong data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"3827\">responsive touchscreen interface</strong>, and smart safety features such as:</p>\n<p data-start=\"3867\" data-end=\"3895\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Filament run-out detection</p>\n<p data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3932\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">        </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Resume printing after power loss</p>\n<p data-start=\"3934\" data-end=\"4067\">These features protect long prints, reduce material waste, and make the printer dependable for business and educational environments.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-5.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\" width=\"459\" height=\"459\"><br><br><br><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-6.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\" width=\"458\" height=\"458\"></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-7_1d0acaf7-d82b-4f47-83e5-47bcb7710d39.jpg?v=1773401754&amp;width=1946\" width=\"458\" height=\"458\"></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/en-8.jpg?v=1773902209&amp;width=1946\" width=\"454\" height=\"454\"></p>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443889791-570155096.webp"]},{"id":"4643720b-55fc-4868-9d8b-924a03ad6b97","mrp":46000,"sku":"bambu-lab-p1p-3d-printer","name":"Bambu Lab P1P 3D Printer","slug":"bambu-lab-p1p-3d-printer","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","stock":0,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891870-551034978.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443892052-910178401.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443892035-562943900.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891896-663380943.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443894161-45929166.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443894108-149466084.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443894125-909188002.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"c3dc8327-7bfc-48be-a60b-8bb5eb51f80c","sku":"bambu-lab-p1p-3d-printer-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"46000","stock":0,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891870-551034978.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"20000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:30.793Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"4643720b-55fc-4868-9d8b-924a03ad6b97","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:30.793Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891870-551034978.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891870-551034978.jpg"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891870-551034978.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891870-551034978.jpg"}],"salePrice":46000,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891870-551034978.jpg","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":46000,"description":"<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e360568 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"e360568\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-988220b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"988220b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<p>The Bambu Lab P1P inherits the proven kinematics and motion control system of the Bambu Lab Flagship printer. High-speed 3D printing with up to 20000 m/s² acceleration ·</p>\n<p>“Almost every 3D printing maker started with a fantasy of printing amazing things. With the new Bambu Lab P1P, it has never been easier to 3D print your dream and customize your own 3D printer.”</p>\n<p class=\"title\">Made by Bambu Lab Created by You</p>\n<p class=\"desc\">Customize and 3D print the side panels of P1P with your magic touch. Select a Modplate template to print or design your one-of-a-kind side panels.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8021c93 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8021c93\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Main Features</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8d2b08c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8d2b08c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<ul>\n<li>Right out of the box</li>\n<li>Multi-color capability</li>\n<li>CoreXY up to 20000 mm/s² Acceleration</li>\n<li>Vibration Compensation &amp; Pressure Advance</li>\n<li>Direct-drive Extruder</li>\n<li>Succeed with a Perfect First Layer</li>\n<li>All-metal Hotend</li>\n<li>Filament Run-out Sensor</li>\n<li>Power Loss Recovery</li>\n<li>Semi-automatic Belt Tensioning</li>\n<li>Fans with Speed Feedback</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a04d5f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a04d5f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Tech Specs</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8917295 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8917295\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Item</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Specification</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Printing Technology</strong></td>\n<td>Fused Deposition Modeling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><strong>Body</strong></td>\n<td>Build Volume(W×D×H)</td>\n<td>256*256*256 mm³</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chassis</td>\n<td>Steel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shell</td>\n<td>Printable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"8\"><strong>Tool Head</strong></td>\n<td>Hot End</td>\n<td>All-Metal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Extruder Gears</td>\n<td>Steel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nozzle</td>\n<td>Stainless Steel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Max Hot End Temperature</td>\n<td>300 ℃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nozzle Diameter (Included)</td>\n<td>0.4 mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nozzle Diameter (Optional)</td>\n<td>0.2 mm, 0.6 mm, 0.8 mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filament Cutter</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filament Diameter</td>\n<td>1.75 mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><strong>Hot bed</strong></td>\n<td>Build Plate (Included)</td>\n<td>Bambu Dual-Sided Textured PEI Plate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Build Plate (Optional)</td>\n<td>Bambu Cool Plate<br>Bambu Engineering Plate<br>Bambu High Temperature Plate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Max Build Plate Temperature</td>\n<td>100℃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><strong>Speed</strong></td>\n<td>Max Speed of Tool Head</td>\n<td>500 mm/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Max Acceleration of Tool Head</td>\n<td>20 m/s²</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Max Hot End Flow</td>\n<td>32 mm³/s @ABS(Model: 150*150mm single wall; Material: Bambu ABS; Temperature: 280℃)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><strong>Cooling</strong></td>\n<td>Part Cooling Fan</td>\n<td>Closed Loop Control</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hot End Fan</td>\n<td>Closed Loop Control</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Auxiliary Part Cooling Fan</td>\n<td>Optional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><strong>Supported Filament</strong></td>\n<td>PLA, PETG, TPU, PVA, PET</td>\n<td>Ideal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PA, PC, ABS, ASA</td>\n<td>Capable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carbon/Glass Fiber Reinforced Polymer</td>\n<td>Not Recommended</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><strong>Sensors</strong></td>\n<td>Chamber Monitoring Camera</td>\n<td>Low Rate Camera 1280 x 720 / 0.5fps (Optional)<br>Timelapse Supported</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filament Run Out Sensor</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filament Odometry</td>\n<td>Optional with AMS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power Loss Recover</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td>\n<td>Dimensions(W×D×H)</td>\n<td>386*389*458 mm³</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Net Weight</td>\n<td>9.65kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><strong>Electrical Parameters</strong></td>\n<td>Input Voltage</td>\n<td>100-240 VAC， 50/60 Hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Max Power</td>\n<td>1000W@220V， 350W@110V</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USB Output Power</td>\n<td>5V/1.5A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"5\"><strong>Electronics</strong></td>\n<td>Display</td>\n<td>2.7-inch 192×64 Screen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Connectivity</td>\n<td>Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Bambu-Bus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storage</td>\n<td>Micro SD Card</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Control Interface</td>\n<td>Button, APP, PC Application</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Motion Controller</td>\n<td>Dual-Core Cortex M4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><strong>Software</strong></td>\n<td>Slicer</td>\n<td>Bambu Studio<br>Support third party slicers which export standard G-code such as Superslicer, Prusaslicer and Cura, but certain advanced features may not be supported.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slicer Supported OS</td>\n<td>MacOS, Windows</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5d64bea e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"5d64bea\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3bcb01b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3bcb01b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"> </div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd5a087 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"fd5a087\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"> </div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36301d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"36301d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d15ea24 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d15ea24\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<p class=\"title\"><strong>CoreXY up to 20000 mm/s² Acceleration</strong></p>\n<div class=\"desc\">The Bambu Lab P1P inherits the proven kinematics and motion control system of the Bambu Lab Flagship printer. It prints with a top speed of 500 mm/s, the acceleration from zero to 500 mm/s takes just 0.025 seconds.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"title\"><strong>Vibration Compensation &amp; Pressure Advance</strong></div>\n<div class=\"desc\">The active vibration compensation (XY) algorithm and pressure advance guarantees extra smoothness and gets you good prints.</div>\n<div> </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"title\"><strong>Direct-drive Extruder</strong></div>\n<div class=\"desc\">With the design that the motor is directly connected to the extruder, P1P has better control on the extrusion and retraction of flexible filaments. Precise and consistent extrusion for smooth and no-blur prints.</div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"title\"><strong>Succeed with a Perfect First Layer</strong></div>\n<div class=\"desc\">The automatic bed leveling(ABL) sensor calibrates and levels the bed properly, making you a perfect first layer for every 3D print.<br><br><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eddc6dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"eddc6dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891870-551034978.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891870-551034978.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443892052-910178401.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443892035-562943900.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891896-663380943.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443894161-45929166.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443894108-149466084.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443894125-909188002.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891870-551034978.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443892052-910178401.jpg","shortDescription":"<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e360568 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"e360568\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-988220b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"988220b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<p>The Bambu Lab P1P inherits the proven kinematics and motion control system of the Bambu Lab Flagship printer. High-speed 3D printing with up to 20000 m/s² acceleration ·</p>\n<p>“Almost every 3D printing maker started with a fantasy of printing amazing things. With the new Bambu Lab P1P, it has never been easier to 3D print your dream and customize your own 3D printer.”</p>\n<p class=\"title\">Made by Bambu Lab Created by You</p>\n<p class=\"desc\">Customize and 3D print the side panels of P1P with your magic touch. Select a Modplate template to print or design your one-of-a-kind side panels.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8021c93 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8021c93\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Main Features</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8d2b08c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8d2b08c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<ul>\n<li>Right out of the box</li>\n<li>Multi-color capability</li>\n<li>CoreXY up to 20000 mm/s² Acceleration</li>\n<li>Vibration Compensation &amp; Pressure Advance</li>\n<li>Direct-drive Extruder</li>\n<li>Succeed with a Perfect First Layer</li>\n<li>All-metal Hotend</li>\n<li>Filament Run-out Sensor</li>\n<li>Power Loss Recovery</li>\n<li>Semi-automatic Belt Tensioning</li>\n<li>Fans with Speed Feedback</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a04d5f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a04d5f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Tech Specs</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8917295 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8917295\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Item</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Specification</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td cols