ommended</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><strong>Sensors</strong></td>\n<td>Chamber Monitoring Camera</td>\n<td>Low Rate Camera 1280 x 720 / 0.5fps (Optional)<br>Timelapse Supported</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filament Run Out Sensor</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filament Odometry</td>\n<td>Optional with AMS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Power Loss Recover</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><strong>Physical Dimensions</strong></td>\n<td>Dimensions(W×D×H)</td>\n<td>386*389*458 mm³</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Net Weight</td>\n<td>9.65kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><strong>Electrical Parameters</strong></td>\n<td>Input Voltage</td>\n<td>100-240 VAC， 50/60 Hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Max Power</td>\n<td>1000W@220V， 350W@110V</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USB Output Power</td>\n<td>5V/1.5A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"5\"><strong>Electronics</strong></td>\n<td>Display</td>\n<td>2.7-inch 192×64 Screen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Connectivity</td>\n<td>Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Bambu-Bus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storage</td>\n<td>Micro SD Card</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Control Interface</td>\n<td>Button, APP, PC Application</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Motion Controller</td>\n<td>Dual-Core Cortex M4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><strong>Software</strong></td>\n<td>Slicer</td>\n<td>Bambu Studio<br>Support third party slicers which export standard G-code such as Superslicer, Prusaslicer and Cura, but certain advanced features may not be supported.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slicer Supported OS</td>\n<td>MacOS, Windows</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5d64bea e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"5d64bea\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3bcb01b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3bcb01b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"> </div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd5a087 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"fd5a087\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"> </div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36301d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"36301d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d15ea24 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d15ea24\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<p class=\"title\"><strong>CoreXY up to 20000 mm/s² Acceleration</strong></p>\n<div class=\"desc\">The Bambu Lab P1P inherits the proven kinematics and motion control system of the Bambu Lab Flagship printer. It prints with a top speed of 500 mm/s, the acceleration from zero to 500 mm/s takes just 0.025 seconds.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"title\"><strong>Vibration Compensation &amp; Pressure Advance</strong></div>\n<div class=\"desc\">The active vibration compensation (XY) algorithm and pressure advance guarantees extra smoothness and gets you good prints.</div>\n<div> </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"title\"><strong>Direct-drive Extruder</strong></div>\n<div class=\"desc\">With the design that the motor is directly connected to the extruder, P1P has better control on the extrusion and retraction of flexible filaments. Precise and consistent extrusion for smooth and no-blur prints.</div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"title\"><strong>Succeed with a Perfect First Layer</strong></div>\n<div class=\"desc\">The automatic bed leveling(ABL) sensor calibrates and levels the bed properly, making you a perfect first layer for every 3D print.<br><br><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eddc6dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"eddc6dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443891870-551034978.jpg"]},{"id":"71e1a3e6-e985-4a37-bad2-e264d0234b0b","mrp":41999,"sku":"anycubic-kobra-3-combo-3d-printer","name":"Anycubic Kobra 3 Combo 3D Printer","slug":"anycubic-kobra-3-combo-3d-printer","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443900222-299591522.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443900350-748568325.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443900205-804789227.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443899995-340299691.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443902841-116134627.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"6b11a8f3-9364-4f61-a155-cef497b22fa7","sku":"anycubic-kobra-3-combo-3d-printer-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"41999","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443900222-299591522.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"20000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:49.333Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"71e1a3e6-e985-4a37-bad2-e264d0234b0b","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:49.333Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443900222-299591522.png","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443900222-299591522.png"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443900222-299591522.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443900222-299591522.png"}],"salePrice":41999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443900222-299591522.png","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":41999,"description":"<h6 class=\"text-main fw-small\">Product Features</h6>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>The Anycubic Kobra 3 3D Printer Combo is a cutting-edge, user-friendly machine that combines precision, speed, and versatility, making it ideal for both beginners and advanced users.</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>It boasts a spacious build volume for creating larger models or multiple prints simultaneously, and a direct drive extruder for accurate filament feeding, particularly useful for flexible filaments.</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>The high-precision auto-leveling system ensures a consistently level print bed, enhancing overall print quality. Additionally, the printer features a flexible magnetic build plate, making print removal easy and reducing the risk of damage.</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>Whats in the Box:</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>• Anycubic Kobra 3 Combo 3D Printer</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>• Power Supply and Cables</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>• Tool Kit</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>• User Manual</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>• Does not include Filaments<br><br></p>\n<main id=\"MainContent\" class=\"content-for-layout focus-none\" role=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div id=\"shopify-section-template--18231269687458__image_with_text_te4wGb\" class=\"shopify-section section\">\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\">\n<div id=\"ImageWithText--template--18231269687458__image_with_text_te4wGb\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--radius image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient\">\n<h2 class=\"image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_te4wGb-heading_M7nQrt appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__heading h3 color-foreground image-with-text__heading--bold break done\">Smart Multi-Color Printing</h2>\n<div class=\"image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_te4wGb-text_WPNTKD appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__text text-sm rte body color-foreground done\">\n<ul>\n<li>Unleash 4-Color Printing</li>\n<li>Print up to 8*① Stunning Colors.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj\" cl