n Filament Sync</span></summary>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div id=\"shopify-section-template--18231269687458__image_with_text_qjw3Er\" class=\"shopify-section section\">\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div class=\"image-with-text__media-item image-with-text__media-item--medium image-with-text__media-item--top grid__item\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=1500\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"//store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=165 165w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=360 360w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=535 535w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=700 700w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=875 875w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=1070 1070w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=1500 1500w\" width=\"483\" height=\"290\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1440px) 1100px, (min-width: 750px) calc(100vw * 0.67), 100vw\"></div>\n<div class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\">\n<div id=\"ImageWithText--template--18231269687458__image_with_text_qjw3Er\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--radius image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient\">\n<h2 class=\"image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_qjw3Er-heading_iWxpbL appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__heading h3 color-foreground image-with-text__heading--bold break done\">Max 600mm/s, Printing at the Pace of Though</h2>\n<div class=\"image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_qjw3Er-text_39rMJW appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__text text-sm rte body color-foreground done\">\n<ul>\n<li>Optimized configuration, bolstered computational, and superior cooling system</li>\n<li>Complete Benchy in 11min 30s</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"shopify-section-template--18231269687458__image_with_text_hQ68qL\" class=\"shopify-section section\">\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div class=\"image-with-text__media-item image-with-text__media-item--medium image-with-text__media-item--top grid__item\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=1500\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"//store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=165 165w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=360 360w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=535 535w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=700 700w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=875 875w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=1070 1070w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=1500 1500w\" width=\"483\" height=\"290\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1440px) 1100px, (min-width: 750px) calc(100vw * 0.67), 100vw\"></div>\n<div class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\">\n<div id=\"ImageWithText--template--18231269687458__image_with_text_hQ68qL\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--radius image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient\">\n<h2 class=\"image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_hQ68qL-heading_WEbtTr appear-animate-item-in-list