uration, bolstered computational, and superior cooling system</li>\n<li>Complete Benchy in 11min 30s</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"shopify-section-template--18253132267682__image_with_text_qjw3Er\" class=\"shopify-section section\">\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div class=\"image-with-text__media-item image-with-text__media-item--medium image-with-text__media-item--top grid__item\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=1500\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"//store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=165 165w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=360 360w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=535 535w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=700 700w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=875 875w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=1070 1070w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_3.jpg?v=1753270899&amp;width=1500 1500w\" width=\"483\" height=\"290\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1440px) 1100px, (min-width: 750px) calc(100vw * 0.67), 100vw\"></div>\n<div class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\">\n<div id=\"ImageWithText--template--18253132267682__image_with_text_qjw3Er\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--radius image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient\">\n<h2 class=\"image-with-text__template--18253132267682__image_with_text_qjw3Er-heading_iWxpbL appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__heading h3 color-foreground image-with-text__heading--bold break done\">250*250*260mm Expansive Printing Space</h2>\n<div class=\"image-with-text__template--18253132267682__image_with_text_qjw3Er-text_39rMJW appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__text text-sm rte body color-foreground done\">\n<p>The Kobra 3 features printing sizes up to 250 x 250 x 260mm, with a maximum printing volume of 4.29 gal (16.25L), increased by a whopping 34% compared to previous 3D printers.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--18253132267682__yg_image_text_cMfCtj\" class=\"shopify-section yg-image-text\">\n<div class=\"section-template--18253132267682__yg_image_text_cMfCtj-padding color- gradient isolate\">\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div class=\"yg-heading\">\n<div class=\"yg-section-title h3\">Start. Print. Relax. Ready for All-Skill Levels</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yg-section-content\">\n<div class=\"yg-section-image hide-mobile\">\n<div class=\"block-image-container\" data-block-id=\"item_47dbgd\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-details_-en_1.jpg?v=1753700477\" alt=\"ANYCUBIC-STORE\" width=\"483\" height=\"290\" class=\"hide-mobile yg-image\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yg-question-box grid grid--1-col collapsible-content__grid\">\n<div class=\"grid__item\">\n<details id=\"Details-item_47dbgd-template--18253132267682__yg_image_text_cMfCtj\" data-accordion-id=\"item_47dbgd\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por\" id=\"Summary-item_47dbgd-template--18253132267682__yg_image_text_cMfCtj\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_47dbgd-template--18253132267682__yg_image_text_cMfCtj\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">Resonance Compensation &amp; Flow Correction</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id=\"Details-item_ctVb3T-template--18253132267682__yg_image_text_cMfCtj\" data-accordion-id=\"item_ctVb3T\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-ho