ss=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">SG15 Bearings and Dual-axis Core and Dual-Z-axis</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id=\"Details-item_YKF4Vk-template--18253132267682__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" data-accordion-id=\"item_YKF4Vk\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por\" id=\"Summary-item_YKF4Vk-template--18253132267682__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_YKF4Vk-template--18253132267682__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">300℃ Quick-release Hotend</span></summary>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--18253132267682__yg_download_grid_rchDq9\" class=\"shopify-section section\">\n<div class=\"section-template--18253132267682__yg_download_grid_rchDq9-padding color-background-1 gradient isolate\">\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"flex  center justify-center  w100 align-center title__gap por\">\n<h2 class=\"title__heading h3 font-heading-extra-bold margin0 lh1 title__heading--before-line\"><br></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443902098-311657470.jpg"]},{"id":"b69ba8af-c238-44e1-8843-305347b7aa8e","mrp":2100,"sku":"elegoo-carbon-centauri-hotend-kit","name":"Hotend Kit for Elegoo Centauri Carbon Hardened Steel Brass Nozzle Extruder Kit","slug":"elegoo-carbon-centauri-hotend-kit","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","stock":0,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443903741-683625887.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443903669-118881622.webp","isPrimar