the-dark filaments. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1176\">\n<p data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"1176\"><strong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"955\">High Temperature Performance:</strong> With excellent thermal durability, it supports high nozzle temperatures (often up to ~500 °C with quality variants), ensuring consistent extrusion and stability during long prints. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1351\">\n<p data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1351\"><strong data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1210\">Compatible with A1/A1 Mini:</strong> Designed to fit the hotend of Bambu Lab A1 and A1 Mini printers, ensuring a secure and reliable fit. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1492\">\n<p data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1492\"><strong data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1383\">1.75 mm Filament Support:</strong> Works with standard 1.75 mm filament formats used in these printers. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1672\">\n<p data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1672\"><strong data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1516\">Easy Replacement:</strong> User-friendly installation lets you swap nozzles quickly to adapt to different filament types or replace worn tips. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1830\">\n<p data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1830\"><strong data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1712\">Versatile Material Compatibility:</strong> Ideal for PLA, ABS, PETG, TPU, Nylon, PP, and other high-performance materials. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"2171\"><strong data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1862\">Why Choose Hardened Steel:</strong><br data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1865\">Standard brass or stainless steel nozzles wear out rapidly when printing abrasive composites. Hardened steel significantly prolongs nozzle life, reduces frequent replacements, and maintains high print quality over time — especially when using abrasive filament blends. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443907030-620024743.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443907030-620024743.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443907014-551317064.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443907030-620024743.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443907014-551317064.jpg","shortDescription":"<h3 data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"229\"><strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"229\">Product Description — Hardened Steel Nozzle for Bambu Lab A1/A1 Mini</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"637\">The <strong data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"260\">Hardened Steel Nozzle</strong> is a durable, wear-resistant replacement nozzle designed specifically for the <strong data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"367\">Bambu Lab A1 and A1 Mini</strong> 3D printers. Unlike standard brass or stainless steel nozzles, this hardened steel version is built to withstand abrasion from tough and composite filaments, making it ideal for extended printing projects and challenging materials. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"656\"><strong data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"656\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"1830\">\n<li data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"919\">\n<p data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"919\"><strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"700\">Premium Hardened Steel Construction:</strong> Built for longevity