711ea-3f62-443b-9b00-dc8d361e5cac","dealerPrice":45999,"description":"<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-433b737 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"433b737\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2536d73 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2536d73\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Bambu Lab AMS 2 Pro</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec490fc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"ec490fc\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f2a0d3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4f2a0d3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Dry Filament Quickly and Intelligently</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-58fcdcc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"58fcdcc\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f834c8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3f834c8\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0fc3017 elementor-widget elementor-widget-video\" data-id=\"0fc3017\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings='{\"video_type\":\"hosted\",\"controls\":\"yes\"}' data-widget_type=\"video.default\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ecbc771 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ecbc771\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d9e9a0f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d9e9a0f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4><span class=\"text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Electro-Magnetic Air Vent</span></h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Automated venting facilitates dehumidification during drying and ensures airtight sealing for weeks of high-quality printing.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a51a58 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"3a51a58\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42a98a2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"42a98a2\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce9c494 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ce9c494\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4>Auto-rotate Drying</h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">During the drying process, the filament spools rotate automatically to ensure more even drying </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a48d473 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"a48d473\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5052820 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5052820\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5af033e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5af033e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4><span class=\"text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">RFID Sync</span></h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">AMS 2 Pro uses RFID to auto-match drying settings for Bambu official filaments, no manual input needed.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05599d9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"05599d9\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c98ca6d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c98ca6d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Speed Up! Faster Multi-material Printing!</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf83587 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"bf83587\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c899b84 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c899b84\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f61e89e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"f61e89e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-440b61e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"440b61e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Evolved, Polished Design Detail </h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ad5dbe e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"2ad5dbe\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-08a4b8f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"08a4b8f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b7c57b3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b7c57b3\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb6d573 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bb6d573\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4><span class=\"text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Tool-Free Filament Tubes Access</span></h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Removing snapped filament from the first-gen AMS requires extracting all spools and disassembling the shell with two screws, taking 3-5 minutes. In contrast, the AMS 2 Pro offers direct, tool-free access to filament tubes from the top.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5694515 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"5694515\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a5eb20a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a5eb20a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c285c26 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c285c26\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4185de2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4185de2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4><span class=\"text-