\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#specification\" class=\"accordion-title\">\n<span>Specifications</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"collapse show\" id=\"specification\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-material\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>Dimensions :</b><span> </span>372*280*226 mm³</li>\n<li>\n<b>Net Weight :</b><span> </span>2.5 kg</li>\n<li>\n<b>Housing Material :</b><span> </span>ABS/PC</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Supported :</b><span> </span>PLA, PETG, Support for PLA/PETG, ABS*, ASA*, PET*, PA*, PC*, PVA*, BVOH *, PP, POM*, HIPS*, Bambu PLA-CF*/ PAHT-CF*/ PETG-CF*, and TPU for AMS*</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Not Supported :</b><span> </span>TPE, generic TPU, PVA (damp), BVOH (damp),Bambu PET-CF/TPU 95A, and other filament that contains carbon fiber or glass fiber</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Diameter :</b><span> </span>1.75 mm</li>\n<li>\n<b>Spool Dimension :</b><span> </span>Width</li>\n<li>\n<b>RFID Identification :</b><span> </span>Supported</li>\n<li>\n<b>Highest Temperature :</b><span> </span>65 °C</li>\n<li>\n<b>Active Moisture Discharge :</b><span> </span>Supported</li>\n<li>\n<b>Sealed :</b><span> </span>Storage Supported</li>\n<li>\n<b>Temperature &amp; Humidity Detection :</b><span> </span>Supported. Real-time temperature and humidity can be displayed on the screen, Bambu Studio, and Bambu Handy.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Input :</b><span> </span>24 V 4 A</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br></figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443911169-879132475.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443911169-879132475.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443911184-51306912.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.goo