i data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"993\">\n<p data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"993\">Ideal for large models, batch production, or multi-part prints.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1028\"><strong data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1028\">Intelligent Auto-Leveling</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1163\">\n<li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1091\">\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1091\">Equipped with <strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1081\">LeviQ 3.0 automatic bed leveling</strong> system.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1163\">\n<p data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1163\">Delivers accurate first layers and reduces manual calibration effort.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1196\"><strong data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1196\">User-Friendly Operation</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1302\">\n<li data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1245\">\n<p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1245\">Features a <strong data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1242\">modern touchscreen interface</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1302\">\n<p data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1302\">Simple navigation for beginners and experienced users.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1330\"><strong data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1330\">Smart Connectivity</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1421\">\n<li data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1421\">\n<p data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1421\">Supports <strong data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1393\">Wi-Fi printing, mobile monitoring, USB printing</strong>, and cloud-based workflows.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1426\">\n<h2 data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1483\"><strong data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1483\">🧵 ACE Pro – Advanced Filament Management System</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1589\">The <strong data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1505\">ACE Pro unit</strong> transforms the Kobra 3 into a fully capable multi-color and multi-material printer.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1620\"><strong data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1620\">Key ACE Pro Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1957\">\n<li data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1678\">\n<p data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1678\">Prints using <strong data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1657\">up to 4 filaments</strong> in a single model.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1755\">\n<p data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1755\">Active <strong data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1714\">filament drying system</strong> keeps material dry during long prints.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1830\">\n<p data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1830\">Intelligent <strong data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1800\">auto-feeding and unloading</strong> for seamless color changes.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1898\">\n<p data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1898\">Built-in sensors to detect filament runout and nozzle clogging.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1957\">\n<p data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1957\">Improves overall reliability and reduces print failures.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1962\">\n<h2 data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1996\"><strong data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1996\">🧩 Material Compatibility</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2196\">\n<li data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2025\">\n<p data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2025\">Standard: PLA, PETG, TPU</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2084\">\n<p data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2084\">With ACE Pro: ABS, ASA, PET, PA, PC, PP, HIPS and more</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2196\">\n<p data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2196\">Suitable for functional prototypes, decorative models, engineering parts, art pieces, and multi-color prints.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2201\">\n<h2 data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2221\"><strong data-start=\"2206\" data-