784443916676-985203019.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443917861-282770172.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443913843-285048106.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443914461-295992871.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443914690-873736841.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443914354-308677470.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443914461-295992871.jpg","shortDescription":"<h1 data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"201\"><strong data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"201\">Bambu Lab H2D – Product Description </strong></h1>\n<p data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"563\">The <strong data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"224\">Bambu Lab H2D</strong> is an advanced all-in-one manufacturing workstation designed for creators, engineers, makers and small businesses. Available exclusively on <strong data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"378\">3D Galaxy</strong>, the H2D brings together high-speed 3D printing, laser engraving/cutting, digital cutting/blade work, and pen-plotting capabilities — all in one powerful and compact desktop machine.</p>\n<p data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"748\">With a large build volume, dual-nozzle system, precision motion calibration and multiple toolhead options, the H2D is built for both professional prototyping and creative fabrication.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"753\">\n<h2 data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"776\"><strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"776\">✨ Key Features</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"1296\">\n<li data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"831\">\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"831\">High-speed, high-precision 3D printing performance</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"910\">\n<p data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"910\">Dual-nozzle independent system for multi-material and multi-color printing</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"994\">\n<p data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"994\">Fully enclosed chamber with temperature control for engineering-grade materials</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1062\">\n<p data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1062\">Large build size suitable for big projects and batch production</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1141\">\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1141\">Smart monitoring: nozzle camera, filament detection, real-time diagnostics</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1220\">\n<p data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1220\">Multi-function capability: 3D printing, laser work, blade cutting, drawing</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1296\">\n<p data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1296\">Expandable system with versatile toolheads for different workflow needs</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1301\">\n<h1 data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1340\"><strong data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1340\">Available Variants at 3D Galaxy</strong></h1>\n<hr data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1345\">\n<h2 data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1377\"><strong data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1377\">1️⃣ Bambu Lab H2D Combo</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1593\">The standard H2D Combo includes the full 3D printing setup along with the multi-material system. This variant is ideal for users who require <strong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1559\">high-quality dual-nozzle 3D printing</strong> with wide filament compatibility.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1612\"><strong data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1612\">Includes:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1821\">\n<li data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1657\">\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1657\">Dual-nozzle high-temp 3D printing system</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1691\">\n<p data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1691\">Fully enclosed heated chamber</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1730\">\n<p data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1730\">Multi-material handling capability</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1768\">\n<p data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1768\">Large build volume for big models</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1821\">\n<p data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1821\">Precision motion system with optical calibration</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1842\"><strong data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1840\">Best For:</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1943\">Product designers, engineers, prototyping, model making, multi-color prints and high-strength parts.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1948\">\n<h2 data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"2000\"><strong data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"2000\">2️⃣ Bambu Lab H2D Combo – 10W Laser Version</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2194\">This variant includes everything from the standard combo, plus a <strong data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2106\">10W laser engraving &amp; cutting module</strong>, adding the ability to create personalised designs, engravings and light cutting tasks.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2232\"><strong data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2232\">Features of 10W Laser Combo:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2545\">\n<li data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2270\">\n<p data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2270\">10-watt blue-light laser toolhead</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2363\">\n<p data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2363\">Suitable for engraving on wood, leather, rubber, cardboard, acrylic, coated metals, etc.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2405\">\n<p data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2405\">Cuts thin plywood and craft materials</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2467\">\n<p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2467\">High precision laser control with safety-enclosed chamber</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2545\">\n<p data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2545\">Switchable toolheads for quick transition between printing and laser work</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2566\"><strong data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2564\">Best For:</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2662\">Craft makers, gift customization, light cutting jobs, branding/engraving, workshops, hobbyists.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2667\">\n<h2 data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2719\"><strong data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2719\">3️⃣ Bambu Lab H2D Combo – 40W Laser Version</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2898\">The most powerful and complete variant. The <strong data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2783\">40W laser combo</strong> adds industrial-grade cutting performance to the H2D, enabling deeper, faster and more robust material processing.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2936\"><strong data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2936\">Features of 40W Laser Combo:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"3295\">\n<li data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2972\">\n<p data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2972\">High-power 40-watt laser module</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3052\">\n<p data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3052\">Capable of cutting thick plywood, MDF, acrylic and other stronger materials</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3106\">\n<p data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3106\">High-speed engraving suitable for production work</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3205\">\n<p data-start=\"3109\" data-end=\"3205\">Advanced safety design: enclosed chamber, protective window, air-assist, fire and door sensors</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3295\">\n<p data-start=\"3208\" data-end=\"3295\">Full multi-tool workstation for 3D printing + laser cutting + blade cutting + drawing</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3316\"><strong data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3314\">Best For:</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3426\">Small businesses, fabrication units, workshops, signage creators, woodworking, high-volume engraving/cutting.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"3428\" data-end=\"3431\">\n<h1 data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3462\"><strong data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3462\">Why Buy from 3D Galaxy?</strong></h1>\n<ul data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3602\">\n<li data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3489\">\n<p data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3489\">100% Original Products</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3526\">\n<p data-start=\"3492\" data-end=\"3526\">Fast Dispatch &amp; Secure Packaging</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3527\" data-end=\"3562\">\n<p data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"3562\">Professional Support &amp; Guidance</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3563\" data-end=\"3602\">\n<p data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3602\">Easy Parts &amp; Accessory Availability</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443913843-285048106.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443914461-295992871.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443914690-873736841.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443914354-308677470.jpg"]},{"id":"dcbaa670-6b8e-42fd-997d-bc94b4c133c6","mrp":71999,"sku":"bambu-lab-p2s-3d-printer","name":"Bambu Lab P2S 3D Printer","slug":"bambu-lab-p2s-3d-printer","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":4,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443922162-874202052.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443921988-465637645.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"c283aafe-6a8b-4b10-a491-17c624a6c1ab","sku":"bambu-lab-p2s-3d-printer-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"71999","stock":4,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443922162-874202052.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"25000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:56:51.190Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"dcbaa670-6b8e-42fd-997d-bc94b4c133c6","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:56:51.190Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443922162-874202052.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443922162-874202052.jpg"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443922162-874202052.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443922162-874202052.jpg"}],"salePrice":71999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443922162-874202052.jpg","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":71999,"description":"<h1 data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"239\"><strong data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"239\">P2S 3D Printer – Full Features &amp; Details</strong></h1>\n<h2 data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"264\"><strong data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"264\">Product Overview</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"573\">The P2S is a high-performance, enclosed CoreXY 3D printer built for speed, accuracy, and consistent results. Designed for users who need reliable printing with engineering materials, it features a powerful extrusion system, stable chamber temperature, and advanced automation for smooth day-to-day operation.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"578\">\n<h2 data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"599\"><strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"599\">Key Features</strong></h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"635\"><strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"635\">• High-Speed CoreXY System</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"852\">\n<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"696\">\n<p data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"696\">Fast print speeds up to 600 mm/s with high acceleration.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"785\">\n<p data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"785\">Precise motion system ensures clean details, sharp edges, and smooth surface finish.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"852\">\n<p data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"852\">Ideal for both rapid prototyping and functional part production.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"886\"><strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"886\">• Fully Enclosed Chamber</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"1100\">\n<li data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"951\">\n<p data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"951\">Enclosure stabilizes temperature for improved print quality.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1028\">\n<p data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1028\">Suitable for materials that require controlled environmental conditions.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1100\">\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1100\">Built-in air filtration helps reduce fumes and odors during printing.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1137\"><strong data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1137\">• Powerful Extrusion System</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1358\">\n<li data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1208\">\n<p data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1208\">High-torque extruder provides strong and consistent filament flow.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1268\">\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1268\">Optimized for standard and engineering-grade materials.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1358\">\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1358\">Intelligent monitoring detects feed resistance, clogs, or filament issues in real time.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1398\"><strong data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1398\">• Smart Flow &amp; Quality Control</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1614\">\n<li data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1482\">\n<p data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1482\">Advanced flow monitoring adjusts extrusion automatically for consistent layers.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1551\">\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1551\">Adaptive part cooling ensures better overhangs and fine details.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1614\">\n<p data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1614\">Maintains chamber stability to minimize warping and defects.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1664\"><strong data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1664\">• Heated Bed with Multi-Material Support</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1927\">\n<li data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1732\">\n<p data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1732\">Heated build plate reaches high temperatures for firm adhesion.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1927\">\n<p data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1779\">Compatible with a wide range of filaments:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1927\">\n<li data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1789\">\n<p data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1789\">PLA</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1799\">\n<p data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1799\">ABS</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1810\">\n<p data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1810\">PETG</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1820\">\n<p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1820\">ASA</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1829\">\n<p data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1829\">PC</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1839\">\n<p data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1839\">TPU</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1851\">\n<p data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1851\">Nylon</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1895\">\n<p data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1895\">Carbon-fiber / glass-fiber composites</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1927\">\n<p data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1927\">Other engineering materials</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1964\"><strong data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1964\">• Medium-Large Build Volume</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2112\">\n<li data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2003\">\n<p data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2003\">Build size: <strong data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2001\">256 × 256 × 256 mm</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2112\">\n<p data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2112\">Suitable for medium-sized models, functional prototypes, mechanical parts, and multi-component assemblies.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2149\"><strong data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2149\">• Smart Monitoring &amp; Safety</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2363\">\n<li data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2205\">\n<p data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2205\">Intelligent error detection reduces print failures.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2287\">\n<p data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2287\">Automatic pause for filament runout, nozzle blockage, or spaghetti detection.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2363\">\n<p data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2363\">Stable design supports long printing sessions without manual supervision.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2403\"><strong data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2403\">• Easy Operation &amp; Maintenance</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2609\">\n<li data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2456\">\n<p data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2456\">5-inch touchscreen with user-friendly interface.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2500\">\n<p data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2500\">Quick-swap hotend for fast maintenance.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2567\">\n<p data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2567\">Built-in camera for remote monitoring and timelapse recording.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2609\">\n<p data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2609\">Supports wireless and offline printing.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2614\">\n<h2 data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2638\"><strong data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2638\">What’s Included</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2786\">\n<li data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2657\">\n<p data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2657\">P2S 3D Printer</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2680\">\n<p data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2680\">Heated Build Plate</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2717\">\n<p data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2717\">Spare Nozzle / Maintenance Tools</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2752\">\n<p data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2752\">Filament Buffer / Spool Holder</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2768\">\n<p data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2768\">Power Cable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2786\">\n<p data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2786\">Accessory Kit</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2791\">\n<h2 data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2818\"><strong data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2818\">Why Choose the P2S</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"3107\">\n<li data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2866\">\n<p data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2866\">High-speed printing with consistent results</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2933\">\n<p data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2933\">Enclosed and filtered chamber for professional-grade materials</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"2984\">\n<p data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"2984\">Strong extrusion system for advanced filaments</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3042\">\n<p data-start=\"2987\" data-end=\"3042\">Reliable performance with minimal manual intervention</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3107\">\n<p data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3107\">Ideal for studios, workshops, and semi-professional production</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443922162-874202052.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443922162-874202052.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443921988-465637645.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443922162-874202052.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443921988-465637645.jpg","shortDescription":"<h1 data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"239\"><strong data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"239\">P2S 3D Printer – Full Features &amp; Details</strong></h1>\n<h2 data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"264\"><strong data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"264\">Product Overview</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"573\">The P2S is a high-performance, enclosed CoreXY 3D printer built for speed, accuracy, and consistent results. Designed for users who need reliable printing with engineering materials, it features a powerful extrusion system, stable chamber temperature, and advanced automation for smooth day-to-day operation.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"578\">\n<h2 data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"599\"><strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"599\">Key Features</strong></h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"635\"><strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"635\">• High-Speed CoreXY System</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"852\">\n<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"696\">\n<p data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"696\">Fast print speeds up to 600 mm/s with high acceleration.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"785\">\n<p data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"785\">Precise motion system ensures clean details, sharp edges, and smooth surface finish.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"852\">\n<p data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"852\">Ideal for both rapid prototyping and functional part production.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"886\"><strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"886\">• Fully Enclosed Chamber</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"1100\">\n<li data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"951\">\n<p data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"951\">Enclosure stabilizes temperature for improved print quality.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1028\">\n<p data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1028\">Suitable for materials that require controlled environmental conditions.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1100\">\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1100\">Built-in air filtration helps reduce fumes and odors during printing.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1137\"><strong data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1137\">• Powerful Extrusion System</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1358\">\n<li data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1208\">\n<p data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1208\">High-torque extruder provides strong and consistent filament flow.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1268\">\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1268\">Optimized for standard and engineering-grade materials.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1358\">\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1358\">Intelligent monitoring detects feed resistance, clogs, or filament issues in real time.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1398\"><strong data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1398\">• Smart Flow &amp; Quality Control</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1614\">\n<li data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1482\">\n<p data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1482\">Advanced flow monitoring adjusts extrusion automatically for consistent layers.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1551\">\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1551\">Adaptive part cooling ensures better overhangs and fine details.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1614\">\n<p data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1614\">Maintains chamber stability to minimize warping and defects.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1664\"><strong data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1664\">• Heated Bed with Multi-Material Support</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1927\">\n<li data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1732\">\n<p data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1732\">Heated build plate reaches high temperatures for firm adhesion.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1927\">\n<p data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1779\">Compatible with a wide range of filaments:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1927\">\n<li data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1789\">\n<p data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1789\">PLA</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1799\">\n<p data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1799\">ABS</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1810\">\n<p data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1810\">PETG</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1820\">\n<p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1820\">ASA</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1829\">\n<p data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1829\">PC</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1839\">\n<p data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1839\">TPU</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1851\">\n<p data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1851\">Nylon</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1895\">\n<p data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1895\">Carbon-fiber / glass-fiber composites</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1927\">\n<p data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1927\">Other engineering materials</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1964\"><strong data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1964\">• Medium-Large Build Volume</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2112\">\n<li data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2003\">\n<p data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2003\">Build size: <strong data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2001\">256 × 256 × 256 mm</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2112\">\n<p data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2112\">Suitable for medium-sized models, functional prototypes, mechanical parts, and multi-component assemblies.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2149\"><strong data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2149\">• Smart Monitoring &amp; Safety</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2363\">\n<li data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2205\">\n<p data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2205\">Intelligent error detection reduces print failures.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2287\">\n<p data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2287\">Automatic pause for filament runout, nozzle blockage, or spaghetti detection.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2363\">\n<p data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2363\">Stable design supports long printing sessions without manual supervision.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2403\"><strong data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2403\">• Easy Operation &amp; Maintenance</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2609\">\n<li data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2456\">\n<p data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2456\">5-inch touchscreen with user-friendly interface.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2500\">\n<p data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2500\">Quick-swap hotend for fast maintenance.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2567\">\n<p data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2567\">Built-in camera for remote monitoring and timelapse recording.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2609\">\n<p data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2609\">Supports wireless and offline printing.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2614\">\n<h2 data-start=\"2616\" da