ages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443923027-818056874.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443923022-495539494.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443924188-959135112.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443923200-294374692.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443923027-818056874.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443923022-495539494.jpg","shortDescription":"<h1 data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"251\"><strong data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"251\">P2S Combo – Full Features &amp; Details</strong></h1>\n<h2 data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"276\"><strong data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"276\">Product Overview</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"605\">The P2S Combo is a high-performance, fully enclosed CoreXY 3D printer designed for precision, speed, and multi-material printing. It comes equipped with an advanced automatic material system, fast printing capability, and reliable engineering-grade construction. Ideal for professionals, production units, and serious hobbyists.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"610\">\n<h2 data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"631\"><strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"631\">Key Features</strong></h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"684\"><strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"684\">• Multi-Material Printing System (Included)</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"976\">\n<li data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"793\">\n<p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"793\">Comes with an automatic multi-filament system enabling seamless multi-color and multi-material printing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"897\">\n<p data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"897\">Integrated filament drying function ensures stable extrusion and reduces moisture-related failures.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"976\">\n<p data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"976\">Automatic spool switching for continuous prints without manual intervention.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1015\"><strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1015\">• High-Power Extrusion System</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1292\">\n<li data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1118\">\n<p data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1118\">Uses a high-torque servo extruder delivering strong extrusion force for stable high-flow printing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1224\">\n<p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1224\">Real-time monitoring detects filament resistance, feeding issues, or clogs to prevent print failures.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1292\">\n<p data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1292\">Designed to handle both standard and engineering-grade filaments.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1345\"><strong data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1345\">• Smart Flow Control &amp; Precision Management</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1629\">\n<li data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1437\">\n<p data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1437\">Built-in flow sensors adjust extrusion output dynamically for consistent layer quality.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1525\">\n<p data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1525\">Adaptive cooling system draws in fresh air for improved overhangs and fine details.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1629\">\n<p data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1629\">Maintains a controlled chamber environment for improved results with temperature-sensitive materials.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1677\"><strong data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1677\">• Enclosed Chamber with Air Filtration</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1884\">\n<li data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1740\">\n<p data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1740\">Fully enclosed structure for stable printing temperatures.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1813\">\n<p data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1813\">Integrated carbon filtration system to reduce fumes during printing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1884\">\n<p data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1884\">Heated bed supports high-temperature printing and minimizes warping.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1926\"><strong data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1926\">• High-Speed CoreXY Architecture</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"2151\">\n<li data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"2000\">\n<p data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"2000\">Maximum print speed up to 600 mm/s with high acceleration capability.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2071\">\n<p data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2071\">Delivers smooth motion and accurate detailing even at fast speeds.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2151\">\n<p data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2151\">Balanced design ensures reliable performance for both large and small models.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2184\"><strong data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2184\">• Generous Build Volume</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2319\">\n<li data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2223\">\n<p data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2223\">Print area: <strong data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2221\">256 × 256 × 256 mm</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2319\">\n<p data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2319\">Suitable for prototypes, functional parts, multi-component assemblies, and decorative models.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2360\"><strong data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2360\">• User-Friendly Touch Interface</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2554\">\n<li data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2411\">\n<p data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2411\">5-inch touchscreen with intuitive menu layout.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2476\">\n<p data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2476\">Simple nozzle/hotend quick-swap design for easy maintenance.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2554\">\n<p data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2554\">Supports remote monitoring and timelapse recording through built-in camera.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2591\"><strong data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2591\">• Smart Safety &amp; Monitoring</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2830\">\n<li data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2696\">\n<p data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2696\">Automatic error detection identifies issues like spaghetti failure, nozzle blockage, or print shift.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2758\">\n<p data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2758\">Prints can pause automatically to prevent material waste.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2830\">\n<p data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2830\">Advanced stability controls enhance reliability for long-hour prints.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2869\"><strong data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2869\">• Wide Material Compatibility</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2922\">Compatible with a wide range of materials including:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"3072\">\n<li data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2930\">\n<p data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2930\">PLA</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2939\">\n<p data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2939\">PETG</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"2947\">\n<p data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"2947\">ABS</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2955\">\n<p data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2955\">ASA</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2962\">\n<p data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"2962\">PC</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"2970\">\n<p data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"2970\">TPU</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2980\">\n<p data-start=\"2973\" data-