 daily-use printing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3652\">\n<p data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3652\">Reliable, stable, and easy to maintain with intelligent safety features.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443923027-818056874.jpg"]},{"id":"4006cf7c-0c5a-425c-b7d5-42f54c37edc7","mrp":40,"sku":"wooden-moon-stand","name":"Wooden Moon Stand","slug":"wooden-moon-stand","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":84,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443927268-277725208.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443926774-428285950.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443927337-852982559.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"13ad9b01-7f6a-49e5-93c3-b2b4f66a89c1","sku":"wooden-moon-stand-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"40","stock":84,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443927268-277725208.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"100","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:56:56.960Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"4006cf7c-0c5a-425c-b7d5-42f54c37edc7","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:56:56.960Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443927268-277725208.png","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443927268-277725208.png"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/pr