tic Material System (AMS) is a smart multi-filament feeder designed to enhance 3D printing efficiency and creativity. It automatically manages up to <strong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"478\">four filament spools</strong>, allowing seamless multi-color or multi-material printing without manual swapping.</p>\n<p data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"876\">The AMS features a <strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"625\">sealed, humidity-controlled enclosure</strong> that keeps filaments dry and protected from dust, ensuring consistent printing quality. Intelligent filament detection and automatic switching prevent run-out errors, while smooth feeding mechanisms reduce tangles and jams for reliable performance.</p>\n<p data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"1106\">Its transparent cover and modular design provide clear visibility and easy access to each spool. Multiple AMS units can be connected to expand filament capacity, supporting up to <strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1073\">16 materials</strong> for complex printing projects.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1111\">\n<h3 data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1133\"><strong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1133\">Key Features</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1549\">\n<li data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1184\">\n<p data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1184\">Holds up to <strong data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1169\">4 filament spools</strong> per AMS unit</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1262\">\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1262\"><strong data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1219\">Automatic material switching</strong> for multi-color or multi-material prints</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1327\">\n<p data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1327\"><strong data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1294\">Smart filament management</strong> with jam and run-out detection</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1392\">\n<p data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1392\"><strong data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1355\">Sealed storage system</strong> to protect filaments from moisture</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1466\">\n<p data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1466\"><strong data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1416\">Expandable system</strong> – connect up to 4 AMS units for 16 spools total</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1549\">\n<p data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1549\">Compatible with multiple filament types: <strong data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1537\">PLA, PETG, ABS, ASA, PC</strong>, and more</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1554\">\n<h3 data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1577\"><strong data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1577\">Compatibility</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1647\">The AMS system is compatible with the following Bambu Lab printers:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1800\">\n<li data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1691\">\n<p data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1691\"><strong data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1689\">Bambu Lab X1 Series (X1, X1 Carbon)</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1734\">\n<p data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1734\"><strong data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1732\">Bambu Lab P1 Series (P1, P1S, P1P)</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1800\">\n<p data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1800\"><strong data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1760\">Bambu Lab A1 Series</strong> (when used with the AMS Lite version)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1805\">\n<h3 data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1829\"><strong data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1829\">Specifications</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"2099\">\n<li data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1874\">\n<p data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1874\"><strong data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1854\">Filament Capacity:</strong> 4 spools per unit</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1909\">\n<p data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1909\"><strong data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1899\">Filament Diameter:</strong> 1.75 mm</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1957\">\n<p data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1957\"><strong data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1933\">Humidity Control:</strong> Active sealed chamber</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2022\">\n<p data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"2022\"><strong data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1985\">Connection Interface:</strong> CAN bus communication with printer</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2069\">\n<p data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2069\"><strong data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2040\">Dimensions:</strong> Approx. 430 × 325 × 165 mm</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2099\">\n<p data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2099\"><strong data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2083\">Weight:</strong> Around 2.5 kg</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2104\">\n<h3 data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2124\"><strong data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2124\">In the Box</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2236\">\n<li data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2137\">\n<p data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2137\">AMS Unit</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2178\">\n<p data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2178\">Filament Buffer and Connection Tubes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2204\">\n<p data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2204\">Power and Data Cables</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2236\">\n<p data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2236\">Setup Guide and User Manual</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443928088-490024406.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443928088-490024406.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443928070-6227328.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443931645-260729314.png","h