">\n<p data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"880\">🧱 <strong data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"809\">Stable Temperature Control:</strong> Reduces heat loss and ensures more consistent extrusion performance.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"989\">\n<p data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"989\">🧼 <strong data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"914\">Clean &amp; Low Maintenance:</strong> Prevents filament buildup on the heater block and makes cleaning easier.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1084\">\n<p data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1084\">♻️ <strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1018\">Durable &amp; Reusable:</strong> Made from long-lasting, high-quality silicone for extended use.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1174\">\n<p data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1174\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1104\">Pack of 3:</strong> Convenient set of three socks for easy replacement and maintenance.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1227\"><strong data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1197\">Package Includes:</strong><br data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1200\">3 × Silicone Hotend Socks</p>\n<p data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1249\"><strong data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1247\">Compatibility:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1321\">\n<li data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1270\">\n<p data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1270\">Elegoo Neptune 4</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1296\">\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1296\">Elegoo Neptune 4 Plus</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1321\">\n<p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1321\">Elegoo Neptune 4 Max</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443930659-273986634.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443930659-273986634.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasest