xtrusion.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1081\">\n<p data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"1081\">⚖️ <strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"920\">Weight Note</strong> – Net weight of each spool is <strong data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"958\">1kg</strong>. For<strong> Multi</strong>-colour spools, the <strong data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1034\">distribution of the colours is not fixed</strong>, but the <strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1078\">total weight always equals 1kg</strong>.<br><br><strong>NOTE - <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Colour can be 2 or max 3 colour in one spool. There is no choice of colours, any mix spools are sent on availability. These are spool made in between colour changing in Filament Line. (No Colour Choice)</span></strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936854-637306588.png","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936854-637306588.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936304-188799734.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936608-574900140.png"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936854-637306588.png"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936304-188799734.png","shortDescription":"<p data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"434\">Experience vibrant and dynamic 3D prints with our <strong>Mix-</strong><strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"203\">Colour PLA Filament</strong>, featuring <strong>Mix </strong><strong data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"255\">colours in a single spool</strong>. Each print can reveal unique gradients, shifts, or mixed tones depending on the angle and design—perfect for a