.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443939509-580836930.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936477-290994164.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936683-241067516.jpg","shortDescription":"<h3 data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"140\"><strong data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"140\">Creality Hi Combo – High-Speed Multi-Color 3D Printer</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"425\">The <strong data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"166\">Creality Hi Combo</strong> is a next-generation CoreXZ 3D printer designed for speed, precision, and versatility. With a <strong data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"292\">260×260×300 mm build volume</strong>, blazing print speeds up to <strong data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"333\">500 mm/s</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"368\">12,000 mm/s² acceleration</strong>, it delivers large and detailed prints in record time.</p>\n<p data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"796\">Equipped with the <strong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"479\">CFS (Creality Filament System)</strong>, it supports <strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"536\">multi-color and multi-material printing</strong> with expandable capacity (up to 16 spools), automatic filament loading, RFID recognition, and built-in filament drying. The <strong data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"681\">all-metal hotend</strong> reaches <strong data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"699\">300°C</strong>, paired with a 100°C heated bed for reliable performance across PLA, PETG, ABS, ASA, and more.</p>\n<p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"1134\">Smart features include <strong data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"838\">auto-leveling</strong>, a <strong data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"877\">flexible PEI-coated build plate</strong>, <strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"903\">AI camera monitoring</strong>, and an intuitive <strong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"946\">3.2-inch t