668\">Low shrinkage &amp; deformation</p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"693\">Easy post-processing</p>\n<p data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"809\"><strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"712\">Applications:</strong><br data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"715\">Ideal for <strong data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"806\">prototypes, figurines, dental models, engineering parts, and artistic designs</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"834\"><strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"832\">Storage &amp; Safety:</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"885\">Store in a cool, dry place away from sunlight.</p>\n<p data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"912\">Shake well before use.</p>\n<p data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"951\">Wear gloves &amp; mask while handling.</p>\n<p data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1006\">Wash prints with isopropyl alcohol after printing.</p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443951454-482655673.png","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443951454-482655673.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443955809-805625772.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443958188-28081959.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443957445-851809965.png"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443951454-482655673.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443955809-805625772.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443958188-28081959.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443957445-851809965.png"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.fireb