y for Bambu Lab printers</p>\n<p data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1699\"><strong data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1627\">Compatibility:</strong> Bambu Lab A1 / X1 / X1C / P1 / P1P / P1S<br data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1671\"><strong data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1686\">Dimensions:</strong> 256 x 256 mm</p>\n<p data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1875\">Whether you're working with advanced engineering materials or everyday PLA, this dual-texture plate brings out the best in your 3D prints—functional, aesthetic, and reliable</p>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443963718-701578548.jpg"]},{"id":"ae406d8b-59f8-45e7-b778-4eb695d15819","mrp":1299,"sku":"anycubic-kobra-3-hotend-kit","name":"anycubic kobra 3 hotend kit","slug":"anycubic-kobra-3-hotend-kit","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":36,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443966522-651528194.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443966579-153672616.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"9249099c-6f6a-4c4e-9562-7ba172a95487","sku":"anycubic-kobra-3-hotend-kit-0.4mm","name":"0.4mm","price":"1299","stock":36,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443966522-651528194.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"200","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:57:42.836Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"ae406d8b-59f8-45e7-b778-4eb695d15819","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:57:42.836Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Size":"0.4mm"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443966522-651528194.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.co