er block and high-precision thermistor for accurate temperature management</p>\n<p data-end=\"1305\" data-start=\"1216\"><strong data-end=\"1235\" data-start=\"1216\">Pre-Calibrated:</strong> Factory-calibrated for extrusion accuracy—no additional tuning needed</p>\n<p data-end=\"1429\" data-start=\"1308\"><strong data-end=\"1335\" data-start=\"1308\">Hardened Nozzle Option:</strong> Suitable for abrasive filaments like carbon fiber or glow-in-the-dark (varies by nozzle type)</p>\n<hr data-end=\"1434\" data-start=\"1431\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1464\" data-start=\"1436\">🧰 <strong data-end=\"1464\" data-start=\"1443\">Package Includes:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"1532\" data-start=\"1468\">1× Complete Hotend Assembly (Nozzle + Heat Break + Heater Block)</p>\n<p data-end=\"1661\" data-start=\"1601\">1× Heat Sink or Retention Clip (depending on design variant)</p>\n<p data-end=\"1708\" data-start=\"1664\">1× PTFE tube (optional depending on version)</p>\n<p data-end=\"1737\" data-start=\"1711\">1× User/Installation Guide</p>\n<hr data-end=\"1742\" data-start=\"1739\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1778\" data-start=\"1744\">🧵 <strong data-end=\"1778\" data-start=\"1751\">Filament Compatibility:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"1825\" data-start=\"1782\"><strong data-end=\"1805\" data-start=\"1782\">Standard Materials:</strong> PLA, ABS, PETG, TPU</p>\n<p data-end=\"1901\" data-start=\"1828\"><strong data-end=\"1851\" data-start=\"1828\">Advanced Materials:</strong> PA, PC, PA-CF (only with hardened nozzle variant)</p>\n<hr data-end=\"1906\" data-start=\"1903\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1963\" data-start=\"1908\">⚙️ <strong data-end=\"1963\" data-start=\"1915\">Why Choose this A1 And A1 Mini Hotend Kit?</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"2022\" data-start=\"1967\">Hassle-free replacement for worn-out or clogged nozzles</p>\n<p data-end=\"2081\" data-start=\"2025\">Restores printing performance to factory-fresh condition</p>\n<p data-end=\"2081\" data-start=\"2025\">Allows material upgrades with harde