">\n<h3 data-end=\"1588\" data-start=\"1565\">🧵 <strong data-end=\"1588\" data-start=\"1572\">Application:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"1811\" data-start=\"1590\">Ideal for printing with <strong data-end=\"1637\" data-start=\"1614\">PLA, ABS, PETG, TPU</strong>, and other common filaments. If upgraded with an all-metal throat and high-temp thermistor, it can handle <strong data-end=\"1772\" data-start=\"1744\">temperatures up to 260°C</strong>, suitable for more advanced materials.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"1816\" data-start=\"1813\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1841\" data-start=\"1818\">💡 <strong data-end=\"1841\" data-start=\"1825\">Why Upgrade?</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"1884\" data-start=\"1843\">Replacing or upgrading your hotend helps:</p>\n<p data-end=\"1927\" data-start=\"1887\">Fix under-extrusion or heat creep issues</p>\n<p data-end=\"1970\" data-start=\"1930\">Enhance print quality and layer adhesion</p>\n<p data-end=\"2013\" data-start=\"1973\">Improve heat dissipation and consistency</p>\n<p data-end=\"2065\" data-start=\"2016\">Enable smoother, faster, and more reliable print</p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443970669-594950035.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443970669-594950035.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443970669-594950035.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443970669-594950035.jpg","shortDescription":"<h3 data-end=\"168\" data-start=\"121\">🔧 <strong data-end=\"168\" data-start=\"128\">Hotend Upgrade Kit for Ender 3 V3 SE</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"486\" data-start=\"170\">Upgrade your 3D printing experience with this premium <strong data-end=\"238\" data-start=\"224\">Hotend Kit</strong>, specifically designed f