byist or a professional, our <strong>Silk multi-color 3D printer filament</strong> ensures precision, quality, and stunning aesthetic appeal.</p>\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Triple-Color Transition for Unique Visual Appeal:</strong> This <strong>Filamont</strong> <strong>Silk tri-color PLA filament</strong> combines Emerald green, purple and yellow into one strand, producing a mesmerizing color shift throughout the printed model. Ideal for both artistic and decorative prints, it’s the best choice for creative designs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Silky Smooth and Glossy Finish:</strong><span> </span>The<span> </span><strong>Filamont Silk Tri Color Gold, Blue, Purple 3D Printer Filament<span> </span></strong>silky texture delivers a polished, professional look straight off the printer, eliminating the need for post-processing or polishing. Its quality as a<span> </span><strong>3D printing filament</strong> ensures a premium finish.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High Dimensional Accuracy and Reliable Printing:</strong> With a 1.75mm diameter 3d printer filament and a tolerance of +/- 0.03mm, this <strong>3D printer filament</strong> ensures consistent, high-precision printing. It’s perfect for intricate designs and maintains accuracy for a range of <strong>3D printing materials</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tangle-Free and Bubble-Free Experience:</strong> Designed with high-quality spools to prevent tangling and bubbles, this <strong>Silk multi-color 3D printer filament</strong> ensures a smooth and hassle-free printing experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Compatible with Most FDM Printers:</strong> The <strong>Filamont Silk Tri Color Gold, Blue, Purple 3D Printer Filament</strong> is compatible with the majority of FDM printers, making it suitable for hobbyists, professionals, and everyone in between.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optimized Printing Parameters:</strong> Best results are achieved with a printing temperature between 190°C and 220°C and a heated bed temperature of 60-70°C. Adjust print speeds between 30-100mm/s for reliable and consistent prints using this <strong>3D printer filament</strong>.</li>\n</ul>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443972385-387241541.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443972385-387241541.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443972400-128567996.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443982730-785739960.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443972386-775130633.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443975755-807517404.png"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443972385-387241541.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443972400-128567996.jpg","shortDescription":"<p>The<span> </span><strong>Filamont Silk Tri Color Gold, Blue, Purple 3D Printer Filament<span> </span></strong>is the perfect solution for anyone looking to achieve a glossy, silky finish with a dynamic color-changing appearance. This high-quality<span> </span><strong>3D printer filament</strong><span> </span>smoothly transitions between three vibrant colors<span> </span><strong>Gold, Blue and Purple<span> </span></strong>making your 3D models truly stand out. Designed for seamless use with most FDM printers, this <strong>3D printing material</strong> is ideal for artistic, decorative, and functional 3D printing projects.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re a hobbyist or a professional, our <strong>Silk multi-color 3D printer filament</strong> ensures precision, quality, and stunning aesthetic appeal.</p>\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Triple-Color Transition for Unique Visual Appeal:</strong> This <strong>Filamont</strong> <strong>Silk tri-color PLA filament</strong> combines Emerald green, purple and yellow into one strand, producing a mesmerizing color shift throughout the printed model. Ideal for both artistic and decorative prints, it’s the best choice for creative designs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Silky Smooth and Glossy Finish:</strong><span> </span>The<span> </span><strong>Filamont Silk Tri Color Gold, Blue, Purple 3D Printer Filament<span> </span></strong>silky texture delivers a polished, professional look straight off the printer, eliminating the need for post-processing or polishing. Its quality as a<span> </span><strong>3D printing filament</strong> ensures a premium finish.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High Dimensional Accuracy and Reliable Printing:</strong> With a 1.75mm diameter 3d printer filament and a tolerance of +/- 0.03mm, this <strong>3D printer filament</strong> ensures consistent, high-precision printing. It’s perfect for intricate designs and maintains accuracy for a range of <strong>3D printing materials</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tangle-Free and Bubble-Free Experience:</strong> Designed with high-quality spools to prevent tangling and bubbles, this <strong>Silk multi-color 3D printer filament</strong> ensures a smooth and hassle-free printing experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Compatible with Most FDM Printers:</strong> The <strong>Filamont Silk Tri Color Gold, Blue, Purple 3D Printer Filament</strong> is compatible with the majority of FDM printers, making it suitable for hobbyists, professionals, and everyone in between.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optimized Printing Parameters:</strong> Best results are achieved with a printing temperature between 190°C and 220°C and a heated bed temperature of 60-70°C. Adjust print speeds between 30-100mm/s for reliable and consistent prints using this <strong>3D printer filament</strong>.</li>\n</ul>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443972385-387241541.jpg"]},{"id":"c6090851-6165-4390-a3d4-297cbedb3e86","mrp":53999,"sku":"anycubic-kobra-3-max","name":"Anycubic Kobra 3 Max","slug":"anycubic-kobra-3-max","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973093-977807297.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973577-689485963.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973567-198528160.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973833-24359526.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"ab47e7d2-ac3e-4ba8-a6d0-1144155fb5b1","sku":"anycubic-kobra-3-max-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"53999","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973093-977807297.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"30000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:14.216Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"c6090851-6165-4390-a3d4-297cbedb3e86","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:14.216Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973093-977807297.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973093-977807297.jpg"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973093-977807297.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973093-977807297.jpg"}],"salePrice":53999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973093-977807297.jpg","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":53999,"description":"<p class=\"\" data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"447\">The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"136\">Anycubic Kobra 3 Max</strong><span> </span>is a next-generation<span> </span><strong data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"176\">FDM 3D printer</strong><span> </span>engineered for<span> </span><strong data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"243\">large-scale, high-speed, and precision printing</strong>. Designed with a<span> </span><strong data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"304\">massive 420 × 420 × 500 mm build volume</strong>, this printer enables users to create ultra-large models in a single print, significantly reducing assembly requirements and material waste.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"719\">With a<span> </span><strong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"490\">maximum print speed of 600mm/s</strong>,<span> </span><strong data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"519\">LeviQ 3.0 Auto-Leveling</strong>, and<span> </span><strong data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"556\">AI-powered print monitoring</strong>, the Anycubic Kobra 3 Max is an<span> </span><strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"652\">ideal choice for professionals, businesses, and enthusiasts</strong><span> </span>who demand efficiency, reliability, and cutting-edge technology.</p>\n<h2 class=\"\" data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"747\"><strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"745\">Key Features</strong></h2>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"810\"><strong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"808\">1. Ultra-Large Print Volume for High-Scale Printing</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"915\"><strong data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"855\">Massive 420 × 420 × 500 mm³ build area</strong>, allowing for the creation of large, single-piece models.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1055\">The print space is equivalent to<span> </span><strong data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"977\">two carry-on suitcases</strong>, ideal for<span> </span><strong data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1052\">functional prototypes, cosplay, and industrial applications</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1139\"><strong data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1084\">Reduced filament waste</strong><span> </span>by minimizing the need for assembling smaller parts.</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1202\"><strong data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1200\">2. High-Speed Printing with Advanced Motion Control</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1275\"><strong data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1229\">Maximum Print Speed:</strong><span> </span><strong data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1241\">600mm/s</strong>, ensuring<span> </span><strong data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1272\">rapid production</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1310\"><strong data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1308\">Enhanced Motion Stability:</strong></p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1399\"><strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1336\">Dual-Y-axis motor</strong><span> </span>eliminates<span> </span><strong data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1370\">layer misalignment</strong><span> </span>for higher print accuracy.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1489\"><strong data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1448\">Anti-Skip Semi-Automatic Belt Tensioning</strong><span> </span>maintains consistent motion precision.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1562\"><strong data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1528\">One-Click Resonance Compensation</strong><span> </span>eliminates unwanted vibrations.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1657\"><strong data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1594\">Dynamic Flow Compensation</strong><span> </span>ensures consistent extrusion for smooth and detailed prints.</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1717\"><strong data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1715\">3. Advanced Auto-Leveling and Z-Axis Calibration</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1810\"><strong data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1747\">LeviQ 3.0 Auto-Leveling</strong><span> </span>automatically calibrates the print bed for optimal adhesion.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1882\"><strong data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1841\">Z-Axis Offset Adjustment</strong><span> </span>allows fine-tuning of the first layer.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1973\"><strong data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1912\">Precise Layer Alignment</strong><span> </span>enhances overall<span> </span><strong data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1970\">print consistency and surface finish</strong>.</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2020\"><strong data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2018\">4. Smart Filament Management System</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2128\"><strong data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2060\">Multi-Filament Intelligent Drying</strong><span> </span>ensures filament remains moisture-free for optimal print quality.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2213\"><strong data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2155\">Filament Auto-Refill</strong><span> </span>automatically loads new filament when a spool runs out.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2308\"><strong data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2253\">Filament Anti-Entanglement System</strong><span> </span>prevents printing failures caused by filament snags.</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2383\"><strong data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2381\">5. High-Temperature Hotend for Versatile Material Compatibility</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2478\"><strong data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2419\">300°C High-Temperature Hotend</strong>, supporting a wide range of engineering-grade materials.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2586\"><strong data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2530\">Aerospace-Grade Ceramic Composite Throat Tube</strong><span> </span>provides superior heat resistance and prevents clogs.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2672\"><strong data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2620\">Quick-Release Hotend Design</strong><span> </span>allows for<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2653\">fast nozzle swaps</strong><span> </span>and maintenance.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2744\"><strong data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2706\">Dual-Spring Nozzle Assembly</strong><span> </span>ensures precise filament extrusion.</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2805\"><strong data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2803\">6. AI-Powered Print Monitoring and Smart Features</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2899\"><strong data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2834\">AI Spaghetti Detection</strong><span> </span>identifies and pauses failed prints to prevent material waste.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"3021\"><strong data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"2927\">Skip Objects Function</strong><span> </span>automatically removes failed sections from prints, increasing efficiency and reducing cost.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3122\"><strong data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3045\">Power-Loss Resume</strong><span> </span>ensures the printer continues from the last position after a power outage.</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3186\"><strong data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3184\">7. Upgraded Software Ecosystem for Seamless Workflow</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3189\" data-end=\"3327\"><strong data-start=\"3189\" data-end=\"3213\">Anycubic Slicer Next</strong>, based on<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3224\" data-end=\"3240\">OrcaSlicer+,</strong><span> </span>provides<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3289\">LAN Mode and Multi-Plate Management</strong><span> </span>for<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3324\">remote slicing and control</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3431\"><strong data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3346\">Anycubic App</strong><span> </span>offers<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3428\">real-time monitoring, remote print control, and time-lapse photography</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3552\"><strong data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3449\">MakerOnline</strong><span> </span>features a<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3461\" data-end=\"3504\">vast library of pre-optimized 3D models</strong>, enabling<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3549\">one click slicing and printing</strong>.</p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973093-977807297.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973093-977807297.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973577-689485963.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973567-198528160.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973833-24359526.png"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973093-977807297.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443973577-689485963.png","shortDescription":"<p class=\"\" data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"447\">The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"136\