 choice for those wondering, “<strong>Which 3D printer is best for multicolor printing?</strong>”</p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979716-263802845.png","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979716-263802845.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443978771-821409673.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979716-263802845.png"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443978771-821409673.jpg","shortDescription":"<p>The<span> </span><strong>Creality K2 Plus Combo 3D Printer</strong><span> </span>is a high-performance, versatile machine designed for<span> </span><strong>multicolour 3D printing</strong><span> </span>and large-format models. Featuring a sturdy metal frame, dual Z-axes for stability, and advanced step-servo motors, it ensures smooth and precise prints. With the ability to print in<span> </span><strong>16 colors</strong><span> </span>using the<span> </span><strong>Creality Filament System (CFS)</strong>, this<span> </span><strong>3D Printer</strong><span> </span>eliminates the need for post-processing painting. Recognized as one of the<span> </span><strong>best FDM 3D printers</strong>, it is an excellent choice for professionals and hobbyists looking for a reliable,<span> </span><strong>high-speed FDM 3D printer</strong>.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-23473 size-full\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/edf64afec214e8f8f7eac9bdef3a1131.webp\" alt=\"Creality K2 Plus Combo 3D Printer\" width=\"1200\" height=\"500\" title=\"Creality K2 Plus Combo 3D Printer 1\" srcset=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/edf64af