sPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979983-734850144.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443980174-418575710.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443980161-328283174.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"886c773e-26fa-4229-a164-fe809c1ce642","sku":"anycubic-ace-pro-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"24715","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979972-202528791.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"20000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:24.587Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"d1de0859-b36f-4c24-9771-65241ea4691e","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:24.587Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979972-202528791.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979972-202528791.jpg"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979972-202528791.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979972-202528791.jpg"}],"salePrice":24715,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979972-202528791.jpg","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"55a711ea-3f62-443b-9b00-dc8d361e5cac","dealerPrice":24715,"description":"<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic ACE Pro</strong><span> </span>is a powerful, intelligent filament management and drying system designed to complement and elevate your<span> </span><strong>multi-color 3D printing experience</strong>. Whether you’re printing in<span> </span><strong>4 colors or up to 8</strong>, the ACE Pro works seamlessly with the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo</strong><span> </span>and other compatible printers to deliver vibrant, high-quality prints while keeping your filaments dry, tangle-free, and print-ready at all times.</p>\n<p>Equipped with<span> </span><strong>RFID synchronization</strong>,<span> </span><strong>active heating</strong>, and smart automation features like<span> </span><strong>filament backup</strong>,<span> </span><strong>nozzle clog detection</strong>, and<span> </span><strong>auto-refill</strong>, the Anycubic ACE Pro transforms your<span> </span><strong>FDM printing setup</strong><span> </span>into a professional-grade, multi-color 3D printing powerhouse.</p>\n<h3>Key Features of Anycubic ACE Pro</h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-24846 alignleft\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_7.webp\" alt=\"Anycubic ACE Pro – Intelligent Filament Drying &amp; Multi-Color Printing System\" width=\"419\" height=\"279\" title=\"Anycubic ACE Pro – Intelligent Filament Drying &amp; Multi-Color Printing System 1\" srcset=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_7.webp 1200w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_7-300x200.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_7-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_7-768x512.webp 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_7-150x100.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 419px) 100vw, 419px\"></p>\n<h4>1. Smart Multi-Color Printing (4 to 8 Colors)</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>ACE Pro</strong><span> </span>is your gateway to high-quality<span> </span><strong>multi-color printing</strong>, supporting<span> </span><strong>4-color printing by default</strong>, and<span> </span><strong>up to 8-color printing</strong><span> </span>with the full expansion kit. Whether you’re creating detailed models, artistic pieces, or product prototypes, this system lets you express every design with vibrant color transitions and seamless layering.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Supports<span> </span><strong>4 to 8-color printing</strong><span> </span>for creative possibilities.</li>\n<li>Automatically switches filaments based on slicing commands.</li>\n<li>Ideal for<span> </span><strong>art, branding, education, and professional prototyping</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-24847 alignright\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_1.webp\" alt=\"Anycubic ACE Pro – Intelligent Filament Drying &amp; Multi-Color Printing System\" width=\"431\" height=\"287\" title=\"Anycubic ACE Pro – Intelligent Filament Drying &amp; Multi-Color Printing System 2\" srcset=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_1.webp 1200w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_1-300x200.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_1-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_1-768x512.webp 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_1-150x100.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 431px) 100vw, 431px\"></p>\n<h4>2. RFID Sync for Intelligent Filament Management</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>built-in RFID synchronization technology</strong><span> </span>ensures accurate color matching, filament tracking, and real-time monitoring of filament status. RFID tags allow the ACE Pro to recognize each filament roll, keeping the printing process organized and reducing the risk of errors.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<strong>RFID-enabled filament recognition</strong><span> </span>for precise color switching.</li>\n<li>Automatically matches filament spools to your print file.</li>\n<li>Helps monitor filament usage and remaining volume.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3. Filament Drying While Printing</h4>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-24848\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_4.webp\" alt=\"Anycubic ACE Pro – Intelligent Filament Drying &amp; Multi-Color Printing System\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" title=\"Anycubic ACE Pro – Intelligent Filament Drying &amp; Multi-Color Printing System 3\" srcset=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_4.webp 1200w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_4-300x200.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_4-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_4-768x512.webp 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ACE_Pro_Features_4-150x100.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\"></p>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>ACE Pro features active drying</strong><span> </span>capabilities that work while you print. This ensures that every spool remains dry and free from moisture absorption, which can cause stringing, poor layer adhesion, and failed prints. With continuous<span> </span><strong>24-hour filament drying</strong>, you can print longer, smoother, and more reliably.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<strong>Active heating system</strong><span> </span>to maintain optimal filament condition.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Drying chamber functions while printing</strong><span> </span>to ensure quality.</li>\n<li>Eliminates common moisture-related defects like bubbling or weak layers.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4. Filament Backup and Auto Refill</h4>\n<p>No more interrupted prints due to filament depletion. The ACE Pro’s<span> </span><strong>filament backup system</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>auto-refill function</strong><span> </span>ensure uninterrupted printing by automatically switching to a backup spool when the primary runs out. This intelligent system maintains your workflow, even on long and complex prints.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Automatically detects empty spools and activates backup.</li>\n<li>Supports<span> </span><strong>continuous printing</strong><span> </span>for large, multi-part projects.</li>\n<li>Saves time and reduces waste.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5. Nozzle Clog Detection and Anti-Tangling</h4>\n<p>Clogs and tangled spools are two of the most frustrating issues in 3D printing. The ACE Pro actively<span> </span><strong>monitors filament movement</strong><span> </span>and detects when clogging or tangling may occur. When issues are identified, the system pauses printing or switches spools to prevent damage and print failure.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<strong>Nozzle clog detection</strong><span> </span>for smoother extrusion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tangle prevention system</strong><span> </span>ensures consistent filament flow.</li>\n<li>Reduces need for manual intervention.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>6. All-Day Filament Drying for Optimal Storage</h4>\n<p>Even when you’re not printing, the ACE Pro works as a<span> </span><strong>24-hour drying and storage unit</strong>. Filaments stored in the chamber remain dry and ready to use, reducing downtime between prints and improving overall print quality.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Keeps filaments in perfect condition between projects.</li>\n<li>Ideal for humidity-sensitive materials like TPU, PETG, and Nylon.</li>\n<li>Ensures consistent, reliable extrusion.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>A New Level of Multi-Color Creativity</h3>\n<p>Whether you’re a professional designer, product engineer, or hobbyist artist, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic ACE Pro</strong><span> </span>takes your 3D printing to the next level. With support for up to<span> </span><strong>8 distinct colors</strong>, your creations gain visual depth and complexity, turning standard prototypes into display-ready models.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Perfect for<span> </span><strong>branding, educational models, cosplay props, and product demos</strong>.</li>\n<li>Allows for detailed<span> </span><strong>gradient, pattern, and layer color customization</strong>.</li>\n<li>Enhances the visual appeal of every print.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Seamless Integration with the Anycubic Ecosystem</h3>\n<p>The ACE Pro is optimized for use with the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo</strong><span> </span>and other Anycubic multi-color setups. Together, they form a<span> </span><strong>high-speed, intelligent printing system</strong><span> </span>that combines CoreXY motion with advanced filament handling and smart automation features.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Designed for<span> </span><strong>plug-and-play integration</strong>.</li>\n<li>Works in harmony with Anycubic slicer software and the Anycubic app.</li>\n<li>Provides<span> </span><strong>full remote monitoring, time-lapse recording, and error detection</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Why Choose the Anycubic ACE Pro?</h3>\n<p>✔<span> </span><strong>Multi-color printing system</strong><span> </span>with support for 4 to 8 filament spools.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>RFID Sync</strong><span> </span>for precise filament recognition and color management.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Print while drying</strong>—active heating for reliable, high-quality extrusion.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>24-hour drying</strong><span> </span>to maintain filament integrity before, during, and after printing.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Auto filament backup and refill</strong><span> </span>for uninterrupted production.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Nozzle clog detection</strong><span> </span>and anti-tangling mechanism for smooth operation.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Seamless integration</strong><span> </span>with Anycubic Kobra S1 and ACE Pro Slicer.<br>✔<span> </span><strong>Easy to use, reliable, and built for professionals</strong><span> </span>and serious enthusiasts.</p>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic ACE Pro</strong><span> </span>is more than just a filament dryer—it’s a<span> </span><strong>smart multi-color filament management hub</strong><span> </span>built for the future of 3D printing. By combining<span> </span><strong>RFID-based filament sync</strong>,<span> </span><strong>active drying</strong>, and<span> </span><strong>intelligent automation</strong>, it empowers you to create<span> </span><strong>multi-color, high-precision models</strong><span> </span>with zero hassle. For anyone looking to<span> </span><strong>unlock the full potential of their 3D printer</strong>, the ACE Pro is a game-changing addition to your workspace.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re printing<span> </span><strong>functional parts</strong>,<span> </span><strong>colorful toys</strong>,<span> </span><strong>detailed miniatures</strong>, or<span> </span><strong>engineering prototypes</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic ACE Pro</strong><span> </span>ensures every spool stays dry, every transition stays smooth, and every print comes out just the way you imagined.</p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979972-202528791.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979972-202528791.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443979983-734850144.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443980174-418575710.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443980161-328283174.jpg"],"variantImages":["ht