lus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station</strong></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"selectable-text copyable-text\">The<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station</strong><span> </span>combines washing and curing functions for<span> </span><strong>3D resin prints</strong>, saving space and streamlining workflow. It offers upgrade protection with sealed washing and an anti-UV lid for safety. The TFT screen allows easy operation, while 16 UV LEDs ensure uniform curing. With flexible cleaning options and compatibility with various printers, it delivers professional results efficiently.</span></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15413\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station.webp\" alt=\"ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" title=\"ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station 1\" srcset=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station.webp 970w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-300x186.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-768x475.webp 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-150x93.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Key Features :</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Upgrade Protection Function:</strong><span> </span>In<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station<span> </span></strong>the sealed<span> </span><strong>washing</strong><span> </span>feature effectively prevents the volatilization of alcohol during the<span> </span><strong>cleaning</strong><span> </span>process, ensuring a safe and healthy environment. Additionally, the anti-UV lid blocks 99.95% of ultraviolet rays, safeguarding your eyes during the curing process.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Intelligent Curing and Washing:</strong><span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station<span> </span></strong>comes with the front TFT screen, setting the time and monitoring the remaining time is effortless. The intuitive operation allows for precise control. Equipped with 16 built-in 405nm UV LEDs and a 360-degree rotating turntable, the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station<span> </span></strong>ensures uniform curing of your models, bringing out their finest details.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Flexible Washing Mode:</strong><span> </span>Choose between two versatile washing methods. The cleaning basket allows for separate cleaning of models, preventing direct contact with uncured resin. Alternatively, mount the build plate with models on it for simultaneous cleaning. The height-adjustable platform bracket ensures a perfect fit for the liquid level in the bucket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Ideal Compatibility:</strong><span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station<span> </span></strong>Designed to work seamlessly with most LCD, DLP, and SLA 3D printers such as<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO</strong><span> </span>Mars, Mars Pro, Mars C, Photon, Photon S, and more. The<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station</strong><span> </span>provides exceptional support for washing and curing your 3D resin prints, making it an essential accessory for your printing setup.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Special Notes:</strong><span> </span>While the washing function is highly effective for most 3D models, it is not recommended for models printed with water washable resin. For such cases, we recommend using running water for optimal cleaning results.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"selectable-text copyable-text iq0m558w g0rxnol2\" dir=\"ltr\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15411\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity.webp\" alt=\"ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station ideal compatity\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" title=\"ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station 2\" srcset=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity.webp 970w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity-300x186.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity-768x475.webp 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity-150x93.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px\"></p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443982005-108021984.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443982005-108021984.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443981924-387727825.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443982288-317171832.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443982005-108021984.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443981924-387727825.jpg","shortDescription":"<p><span class=\"selectable-text copyable-text\"><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station</strong></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"selectable-text copyable-text\">The<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station</strong><span> </span>combines washing and curing functions for<span> </span><strong>3D resin prints</strong>, saving space and streamlining workflow. It offers upgrade protection with sealed washing and an anti-UV lid for safety. The TFT screen allows easy operation, while 16 UV LEDs ensure uniform curing. With flexible cleaning options and compatibility with various printers, it delivers professional results efficiently.</span></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15413\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station.webp\" alt=\"ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" title=\"ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station 1\" srcset=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station.webp 970w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-300x186.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-768x475.webp 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-150x93.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Key Features :</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Upgrade Protection Function:</strong><span> </span>In<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station<span> </span></strong>the sealed<span> </span><strong>washing</strong><span> </span>feature effectively prevents the volatilization of alcohol during the<span> </span><strong>cleaning</strong><span> </span>process, ensuring a safe and healthy environment. Additionally, the anti-UV lid blocks 99.95% of ultraviolet rays, safeguarding your eyes during the curing process.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Intelligent Curing and Washing:</strong><span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station<span> </span></strong>comes with the front TFT screen, setting the time and monitoring the remaining time is effortless. The intuitive operation allows for precise control. Equipped with 16 built-in 405nm UV LEDs and a 360-degree rotating turntable, the<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station<span> </span></strong>ensures uniform curing of your models, bringing out their finest details.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Flexible Washing Mode:</strong><span> </span>Choose between two versatile washing methods. The cleaning basket allows for separate cleaning of models, preventing direct contact with uncured resin. Alternatively, mount the build plate with models on it for simultaneous cleaning. The height-adjustable platform bracket ensures a perfect fit for the liquid level in the bucket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Ideal Compatibility:</strong><span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station<span> </span></strong>Designed to work seamlessly with most LCD, DLP, and SLA 3D printers such as<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO</strong><span> </span>Mars, Mars Pro, Mars C, Photon, Photon S, and more. The<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station</strong><span> </span>provides exceptional support for washing and curing your 3D resin prints, making it an essential accessory for your printing setup.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Special Notes:</strong><span> </span>While the washing function is highly effective for most 3D models, it is not recommended for models printed with water washable resin. For such cases, we recommend using running water for optimal cleaning results.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"selectable-text copyable-text iq0m558w g0rxnol2\" dir=\"ltr\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15411\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity.webp\" alt=\"ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station ideal compatity\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" title=\"ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station 2\" srcset=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity.webp 970w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity-300x186.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity-768x475.webp 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity-150x93.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px\"></p>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443982005-108021984.jpg"]},{"id":"c8d5d910-d7d7-43db-a333-422ddda51fae","mrp":19999,"sku":"anycubic-wash-cure-3-plus","name":"Anycubic Wash & Cure 3 Plus","slug":"anycubic-wash-cure-3-plus","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":4,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983411-914329068.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"ab2a4cc1-e2b1-4361-ba4c-2906a699ef8e","sku":"anycubic-wash-cure-3-plus-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"19999","stock":4,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"30000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:28.892Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"c8d5d910-d7d7-43db-a333-422ddda51fae","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:28.892Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg"}],"salePrice":19999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"55a711ea-3f62-443b-9b00-dc8d361e5cac","dealerPrice":19999,"description":"<p data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"942\">The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"436\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>is an advanced, all-in-one<span> </span><strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"500\">3D printer wash and cure station</strong><span> </span>engineered for high-performance resin post-processing. Designed to meet the needs of both hobbyists and professionals, this upgraded unit delivers increased washing volume, superior UV curing accuracy, and enhanced model compatibility. Whether you need a reliable<span> </span><strong data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"802\">UV curing station for 3D printing</strong><span> </span>or a space-efficient<span> </span><strong data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"860\">resin 3D printer post-processing</strong><span> </span>solution, the<span> </span><strong data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"906\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>is built to optimize your workflow.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"999\">Key Features of the Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1050\">Size Upgrade for Larger and Multiple Models</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1358\">The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1086\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>features a 7.6-liter washing capacity—a 13.4% increase compared to its predecessor. With a 12-liter total bucket volume, this unit is compatible with<span> </span><strong data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1258\">resin 3D printers</strong><span> </span>up to 10.6 inches, allowing users to wash and cure larger prints or multiple models simultaneously.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1415\">Dual-Layer Curing Platform for Maximum Efficiency</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1693\">This model introduces a brand-new<span> </span><strong data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1480\">dual-layer curing platform</strong>, increasing the number of models that can be cured per cycle. By optimizing curing space vertically, it enhances throughput and shortens production time, making it a truly<span> </span><strong data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1692\">high-capacity wash and cure station</strong>.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1738\">IPA-Saving Adjustable Cleaning Basket</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"2053\">Reduce alcohol usage while maintaining strong cleaning performance. The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1842\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>includes a dual-layer polypropylene (PP) basket with adjustable heights (150mm and 250mm). This allows for precise cleaning with minimal IPA consumption, compatible with build platforms from 7.6 to 10.6 inches.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2107\">Enhanced UV Curing with Gooseneck Light Design</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2411\">Featuring<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2151\">Flexicure gooseneck UV lights</strong>, the curing system reaches an energy intensity of 30,000 µW/cm² within a close range (1–3 cm). This design dramatically improves detail curing on complex areas such as figure skirts and top-facing surfaces, ensuring fine details are preserved and fully cured.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2456\">Uniform 360-Degree Curing Performance</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2681\">The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2492\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>utilizes a newly optimized LED lens array that increases overall curing uniformity by 20%. This results in even exposure and consistent quality across all model surfaces, from base to top.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2712\">Quiet, Sealed Operation</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2922\">A fully enclosed design combined with refined software control reduces operating noise significantly. This makes the unit suitable for home, office, and studio environments where quiet operation is a priority.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2957\">Simple, One-Touch Operation</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"3224\">Users can switch between<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3012\">cleaning and curing modes</strong><span> </span>with a single button. Time settings are adjustable from 1 to 30 minutes, allowing full customization based on model size and complexity. The gooseneck UV mode can also be toggled independently for added control.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3277\">Why Choose the Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus?</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3600\">The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3314\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>is a feature-rich, compact, and powerful solution for those seeking professional-grade<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3438\">resin 3D printer post-processing</strong>. It excels in both<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3484\">cleaning and UV curing</strong>, offering enhanced efficiency, improved safety, and superior results for hobbyists, engineers, and designers alike.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3918\">Its increased capacity, IPA-saving features, and powerful UV system make it one of the most advanced<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3740\">3D printer wash and cure stations</strong><span> </span>on the market today. Whether you’re printing detailed miniatures, prototypes, or production parts, this system ensures your prints are cleaned and cured with precision and care.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4451\">Enhance your<span> </span><strong data-start=\"4233\" data-end=\"4273\">3D printing post-processing workflow</strong>, the<span> </span><strong data-start=\"4279\" data-end=\"4310\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>delivers professional performance in a compact, efficient package. It is now available from leading 3D printing suppliers and online stores.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4619\">Invest in quality, reliability, and convenience with the<span> </span><strong data-start=\"4510\" data-end=\"4541\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong>—the ultimate<span> </span><strong data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4597\">resin 3D printer wash and cure station</strong><span> </span>for serious creators.</p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983411-914329068.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983411-914329068.jpg","shortDescription":"<p data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"942\">The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"405\" data-e