me, making it a truly<span> </span><strong data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1692\">high-capacity wash and cure station</strong>.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1738\">IPA-Saving Adjustable Cleaning Basket</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"2053\">Reduce alcohol usage while maintaining strong cleaning performance. The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1842\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>includes a dual-layer polypropylene (PP) basket with adjustable heights (150mm and 250mm). This allows for precise cleaning with minimal IPA consumption, compatible with build platforms from 7.6 to 10.6 inches.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2107\">Enhanced UV Curing with Gooseneck Light Design</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2411\">Featuring<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2151\">Flexicure gooseneck UV lights</strong>, the curing system reaches an energy intensity of 30,000 µW/cm² within a close range (1–3 cm). This design dramatically improves detail curing on complex areas such as figure skirts and top-facing surfaces, ensuring fine details are preserved and fully cured.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2456\">Uniform 360-Degree Curing Performance</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2681\">The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2492\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>utilizes a newly optimized LED lens array that increases overall curing uniformity by 20%. This results in even exposure and consistent quality across all model surfaces, from base to top.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2712\">Quiet, Sealed Operation</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2922\">A fully enclosed design combined with refined software control reduces operating noise significantly. This makes the unit suitable for home, office, and studio environments where quiet operation is a priority.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2957\">Simple, One-Touch Operation</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"3224\">Users can switch between<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3012\">cleaning and curing modes</strong><span> </span>with a single button. Time settings are adjustable from 1 to 30 minutes, allowing full customization based on model size and complexity. The gooseneck UV mode can also be toggled independently for added control.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3277\">Why Choose the Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus?</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3600\">The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3314\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>is a feature-rich, compact, and powerful solution for those seeking professional-grade<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3438\">resin 3D printer post-processing</strong>. It excels in both<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3484\">cleaning and UV curing</strong>, offering enhanced efficiency, improved safety, and superior results for hobbyists, engineers, and designers alike.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3918\">Its increased capacity, IPA-saving features, and powerful UV system make it one of the most advanced<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3740\">3D printer wash and cure stations</strong><span> </span>on the market today. Whether you’re printing detailed miniatures, prototypes, or production parts, this system ensures your prints are cleaned and cured with precision and care.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4451\">Enhance your<span> </span><strong data-start=\"4233\" data-end=\"4273\">3D printing post-processing workflow</strong>, the<span> </span><strong data-start=\"4279\" data-end=\"4310\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>delivers professional performance in a compact, efficient package. It is now available from leading 3D printing suppliers and online stores.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4619\">Invest in quality, reliability, and convenience with the<span> </span><strong data-start=\"4510\" data-end=\"4541\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong>—the ultimate<span> </span><strong data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4597\">resin 3D printer wash and cure station</strong><span> </span>for serious creators.</p>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg"]},{"id":"ecc21b7a-bc13-4309-852d-a1fea0333f0d","mrp":75999,"sku":"anycubic-kobra-3-max-combo-3d-printer","name":"Anycubic Kobra 3 Max Combo 3D Printer","slug":"anycubic-kobra-3-max-combo-3d-printer","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":2,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443984035-97368101.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983505-903025871.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983645-38906457.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983665-765939494.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443986367-668148892.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443986007-905972048.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"5d225390-e9d4-4d34-9637-68cee97e0b48","sku":"anycubic-kobra-3-max-combo-3d-printer-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"75999","stock":2,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443984035-97368101.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"20000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:31.162Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"ecc21b7a-bc13-4309-852d-a1fea0333f0d","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:31.162Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443984035-97368101.png","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443984035-97368101.png"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443984035-97368101.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443984035-97368101.png"}],"salePrice":75999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443984035-97368101.png","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":75999,"description":"<p data-end=\"1148\" data-start=\"691\" class=\"\">The<span> </span><strong data-end=\"725\" data-start=\"695\">Anycubic Kobra 3 Max Combo</strong><span> </span>is a next-generation high-performance FDM 3D printer engineered for professionals, designers, and advanced makers who require fast, precise, and large-format multicolor printing. Now officially available in India through<span> <strong>3D</strong> <strong>GALAXY</strong> </span>, this all-in-one printing solution includes the robust<span> </span><strong data-end=\"1044\" data-start=\"1029\">Kobra 3 Max</strong><span> </span>printer and the innovative<span> </span><strong data-end=\"1112\" data-start=\"1072\">ACE Pro Multi-Color Filament Dry Box</strong>, supporting up to 8-color printing.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1366\" data-start=\"1150\" class=\"\">Designed for demanding workflows—from industrial prototyping to artistic and cosplay creation—the Kobra 3 Max Combo brings together speed, intelligence, and material versatility to dramatically streamline production.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-caption alignnone\" id=\"attachment_25132\">\n<img sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2.png 1920w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2-300x138.png 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2-1024x469.png 1024w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2-768x352.png 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2-1536x704.png 1536w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2-1200x550.png 1200w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2-150x69.png 150w\" title=\"Anycubic Kobra 3 Max Combo – High-Speed, Ultra-Large FDM 3D Printing System with Integrated Multi-Color and Filament Drying Capabilities 1\" height=\"880\" width=\"1920\" alt=\"Experience ultra-fast, multi-color 3D printing with the Anycubic Kobra 3 Max Combo. Now available in India from Protomont Technologies.\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/5-2.png\" class=\"size-full wp-image-25132\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-25132\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<p class=\"wp-caption-text\" id=\"caption-attachment-25132\">Experience ultra-fast, multi-color 3D printing with the Anycubic Kobra 3 Max Combo. Now available in India from <span><strong>3D</strong> <strong>GALAXY.</strong></span> </p>\n</div>\n<h3 data-end=\"1408\" data-start=\"1373\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"1408\" data-start=\"1377\">Key Features and Advantages</strong></h3>\n<h4 data-end=\"1462\" data-start=\"1410\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"1462\" data-start=\"1415\">Massive Print Volume with High-Speed Output</strong></h4>\n<p data-end=\"1642\" data-start=\"1465\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"1486\" data-start=\"1465\">Print Dimensions:</strong><span> </span>420 × 420 × 500 mm – equivalent to over 88 liters, suitable for full-scale objects such as pet houses, architectural models, reliefs, and batch production.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1775\" data-start=\"1645\" class=\"\">Capable of printing multiple models in one batch, reducing print cycles, print time by up to 40% and filament waste by up to 60%.</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"1840\" data-start=\"1777\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"1840\" data-start=\"1782\">Professional-Grade Motion Architecture and Print Speed</strong></h4>\n<p data-end=\"1876\" data-start=\"1843\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"1867\" data-start=\"1843\">Maximum Print Speed:</strong><span> </span>600 mm/s</p>\n<p data-end=\"1948\" data-start=\"1879\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"1896\" data-start=\"1879\">Acceleration:</strong><span> </span>Up to 10,000 mm/s² for rapid yet stable performance</p>\n<p data-end=\"2046\" data-start=\"1951\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"1996\" data-start=\"1951\">Advanced Bearing &amp; Dual-Axis Core Design:</strong><span> </span>Ensures smooth, precise motion and surface finish </p>\n<p data-end=\"2046\" data-start=\"1951\" class=\"\">Complete 3D Benchy in as little as 18 minutes</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"2168\" data-start=\"2096\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"2168\" data-start=\"2101\">LeviQ 3.0 Automatic Leveling with Z-Axis and Motion Calibration</strong></h4>\n<p data-end=\"2230\" data-start=\"2171\" class=\"\">Fully automated bed leveling with precision Z-offset tuning</p>\n<p data-end=\"2230\" data-start=\"2171\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"2254\" data-start=\"2233\">Dual Y-axis motor</strong><span> </span>system improves platform stability, minimizes layer misalignment</p>\n<p data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2322\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"2356\" data-start=\"2322\">Semi-automatic belt tensioning</strong><span> </span>eliminates step loss, ensuring consistent multicolor alignment</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"2474\" data-start=\"2421\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"2474\" data-start=\"2426\">Multicolor Printing with ACE Pro Integration</strong></h4>\n<p data-end=\"2528\" data-start=\"2477\" class=\"\">Standard 4-color support with a single ACE Pro unit</p>\n<p data-end=\"2611\" data-start=\"2531\" class=\"\">Pairing two ACE Pro units enables up to<span> </span><strong data-end=\"2611\" data-start=\"2571\">8-color seamless multicolor printing</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"2694\" data-start=\"2614\" class=\"\">Fast color-switching design reduces head travel distance for enhanced efficiency</p>\n<p data-end=\"2782\" data-start=\"2697\" class=\"\">Organize filament spools by color series; automatic feeding eliminates manual changes</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"2842\" data-start=\"2784\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"2842\" data-start=\"2789\">Intelligent Drying and Filament Management System</strong></h4>\n<p data-end=\"2938\" data-start=\"2845\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"2873\" data-start=\"2845\">ACE Pro Filament Dry Box</strong><span> </span>actively dries filament using preset parameters for PLA and PETG</p>\n<p data-end=\"3014\" data-start=\"2941\" class=\"\">Supports<span> </span><strong data-end=\"2975\" data-start=\"2950\">drying while printing</strong><span> </span>for uninterrupted production readiness</p>\n<p data-end=\"3105\" data-start=\"3017\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"3041\" data-start=\"3017\">Auto filament refill</strong><span> </span>ensures continuous printing by switching spools without pausing</p>\n<p data-end=\"3179\" data-start=\"3108\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"3143\" data-start=\"3108\">Filament entanglement detection</strong><span> </span>with auto-pause and alert mechanism</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"3226\" data-start=\"3181\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"3226\" data-start=\"3186\">High-Temperature All-Material Hotend</strong></h4>\n<p data-end=\"3314\" data-start=\"3229\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"3255\" data-start=\"3229\">300°C High-Temp Nozzle</strong><span> </span>for compatibility with PLA, PETG, TPU, ABS, ASA, and Nylon <strong data-end=\"3366\" data-start=\"3317\">Aerospace-grade ceramic composite throat tube</strong><span> </span>prevents clogging and maintains extrusion stability</p>\n<p data-end=\"3490\" data-start=\"3421\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"3451\" data-start=\"3421\">Quick-swap nozzle assembly</strong><span> </span>for minimal maintenance and fast setup</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"3536\" data-start=\"3492\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"3536\" data-start=\"3497\">AI Monitoring and Recovery Features</strong></h4>\n<p data-end=\"3634\" data-start=\"3539\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"3565\" data-start=\"3539\">AI Spaghetti Detection</strong><span> </span>detects printing failures and pauses operations to conserve material</p>\n<p data-end=\"3787\" data-start=\"3637\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"3662\" data-start=\"3637\">Skip Objects Function</strong>—supported by the printer, slicing software, and app—removes failed print sections mid-job to prevent loss of remaining parts</p>\n<p data-end=\"3866\" data-start=\"3790\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"3811\" data-start=\"3790\">Power-loss resume</strong><span> </span>ensures the job continues from the last known position</p>\n<p data-end=\"3981\" data-start=\"3869\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"3900\" data-start=\"3869\">Real-time hotbed monitoring</strong><span> </span>with overload protection and fireproof V0-grade materials for operational safety</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"4031\" data-start=\"3983\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"4031\" data-start=\"3988\">Advanced Software and Cloud Integration</strong></h4>\n<p data-end=\"4144\" data-start=\"4034\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"4072\" data-start=\"4034\">Anycubic Slicer Next (OrcaSlicer+)</strong><span> </span>enables one-click slicing, multi-plate management, and batch processing</p>\n<p data-end=\"4218\" data-start=\"4147\" class=\"\">Supports multiple file formats: STL, STEP, OBJ, AMF, 3MF, PLY, and more</p>\n<p data-end=\"4294\" data-start=\"4221\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"4233\" data-start=\"4221\">LAN mode</strong><span> </span>for secure local network file transfer and privacy assurance</p>\n<p data-end=\"4394\" data-start=\"4297\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"4313\" data-start=\"4297\">Anycubic App</strong><span> </span>provides remote print monitoring, job control, slicing, and time-lapse recording</p>\n<p data-end=\"4394\" data-start=\"4297\" class=\"\">Compatible with smartphones and PCs for seamless multi-device control</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"4504\" data-start=\"4468\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"4504\" data-start=\"4473\">MakerOnline Model Ecosystem</strong></h4>\n<p data-end=\"4575\" data-start=\"4507\" class=\"\">Access a repository of over 3000 pre-tested models for free download</p>\n<p data-end=\"4668\" data-start=\"4578\" class=\"\">Participate in global model-sharing initiatives and connect with the 3D printing community</p>\n<p data-end=\"4714\" data-start=\"4671\" class=\"\">One-click slicing directly from the library</p>\n<h2 data-end=\"290\" data-start=\"200\" class=\"\"><strong data-end=\"290\" data-start=\"203\">Anycubic Kobra Series Comparison: Kobra 3 Max Combo vs Kobra 2 Max vs Kobra 3 Combo</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"group pointer-events-none relative flex justify-center *:pointer-events-auto\">\n<div class=\"tableContainer horzScrollShadows relative\">\n<table data-end=\"3611\" data-start=\"292\" class=\"min-w-full\">\n<thead data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"292\">\n<tr data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"292\">\n<th data-end=\"326\" data-start=\"292\"><strong data-end=\"305\" data-start=\"294\">FEATURE</strong></th>\n<th data-end=\"374\" data-start=\"326\"><strong data-end=\"349\" data-start=\"328\">KOBRA 3 MAX COMBO</strong></th>\n<th data-end=\"418\" data-start=\"374\"><strong data-end=\"391\" data-start=\"376\">KOBRA 2 MAX</strong></th>\n<th data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"418\"><strong data-end=\"437\" data-start=\"420\">KOBRA 3 COMBO</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-end=\"3611\" data-start=\"637\">\n<tr data-end=\"81