imary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987857-801857893.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"c040cbb2-8cce-4de6-96c7-18b37777f442","sku":"bambu-lab-a1-combo-3d-printer-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"48999","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"20000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:38.414Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"f588ff14-11ea-450f-ab4c-554110466369","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:38.414Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png"}],"salePrice":48999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":48999,"description":"<p><span>Experience seamless multi-color 3D printing with the Bambu Lab A1. Featuring full-auto calibration and active flow rate compensation, this printer ensures precision and reliability in every print. The innovative 1-clip quick swap nozzle and active motor noise cancelling technology enhance user convenience and print quality. With a spacious 256256256 mm³ build volume and compatibility with various filaments, including PLA, PETG, and TPU, the A1 delivers versatility and performance. Additionally, the A1 Combo version includes the AMS lite add-ons for enhanced functionality.</span></p>\n<p><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/Frame_1123861007_4.png?v=1739821842\"></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>Multi-Color Printing</strong><br>The all-new AMS lite is elegant and reliable, making multi-color 3D printing accessible to everyone.</span></p>\n<p><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/Frame_1123861052_2.png?v=1739821896\"></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>Compensation</strong><br>The A1 revolutionizes flow control in 3D printing. It utilizes a high-resolution, high-frequency eddy current sensor to measure the pressure in the nozzle. Our algorithm actively compensates the flow rate according to the readings to extrude with accuracy.</span></p>\n<p><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/Frame_1123861207_3.png?v=1739821957\"></span></p>\n<h4>Features:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Full-auto Calibration</li>\n<li>Multi-Color Printing (Combo Version)</li>\n<li>Active Flow Rate Compensation</li>\n<li>1-Clip Quick Swap Nozzle</li>\n<li>Active Motor Noise Cancelling</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h4>Package Includes:</h4>\n<p>1 x Bambu Lab A1</p>\n<p>1 x Spool Holder</p>\n<p>1 x Purge Wiper</p>\n<p>1 x Build Plate</p>\n<p>2 x PTFE Tube</p>\n<p>1 x Bambu Filament Samples</p>\n<p>1 x Stainless Steel Nozzle (pre-installed)</p>\n<p>1 x Accessory Box</p>\n<p>1 x AMS lite Stand</p>\n<p>1 x AMS lite Body</p>\n<p>4 x AMS lite Rotary Spool Holder</p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987703-965173219.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987705-34763505.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987857-801857893.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987703-965173219.jpg","shortDescription":"<p><span>Experience seamless multi-color 3D printing with the Bambu Lab A1. Featuring full-auto calibration and active flow rate compensation, this printer ensures precision and reliability in every print. The innovative 1-clip quick swap nozzle and active motor noise cancelling technology enhance user convenience and print quality. With a spacious 256256256 mm³ build volume and compatibility with various filaments, including PLA, PETG, and TPU, the A1 delivers versatility and performance. Additionally, the A1 Combo version includes the AMS lite add-ons for enhanced functionality.</span></p>\n<p><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/Frame_1123861007_4.png?v=1739821842\"></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>Multi-Color Printing</strong><br>The all-new AMS lite is elegant and reliable, making multi-color 3D printing accessible to everyone.</span></p>\n<p><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/Frame_1123861052_2.png?v=1739821896\"></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>Compensation</strong><br>The A1 revolutionizes flow control in 3D printing. It utilizes a high-resolution, high-frequency eddy current sensor to measure the pressure in the nozzle. Our algorithm actively compensates the flow rate according to the readings to extrude with accuracy.</span></p>\n<p><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/Frame_1123861207_3.png?v=1739821957\"></span></p>\n<h4>Features:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Full-auto Calibration</li>\n<li>Multi-Color Printing (Combo Version)</li>\n<li>Active Flow Rate Compensation</li>\n<li>1-Clip Quick Swap Nozzle</li>\n<li>Active Motor Noise Cancelling</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h4>Package Includes:</h4>\n<p>1 x Bambu Lab A1</p>\n<p>1 x Spool Holder</p>\n<p>1 x Purge Wiper</p>\n<p>1 x Build Plate</p>\n<p>2 x PTFE Tube</p>\n<p>1 x Bambu Filament Samples</p>\n<p>1 x Stainless Steel Nozzle (pre-installed)</p>\n<p>1 x Accessory Box</p>\n<p>1 x AMS lite Stand</p>\n<p>1 x AMS lite Body</p>\n<p>4 x AMS lite Rotary Spool Holder</p>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png"]},{"id":"ea68196d-460f-463c-bcd9-9f61310a80b8","mrp":77499,"sku":"bambu-lab-p1s-3d","name":"Bambu Lab P1S Combo","slug":"bambu-lab-p1s-3d","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":4,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988844-871253653.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988916-800230610.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988854-397205766.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988884-298445697.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443991103-929814997.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"9a8c7d86-90c5-46db-8f9d-10fc1351bc5f","sku":"bambu-lab-p1s-3d-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"77499","stock":4,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988844-871253653.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"20000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:40.283Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"ea68196d-460f-463c-bcd9-9f61310a80b8","salePrice":"69999","updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:40.283Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988844-871253653.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988844-871253653.jpg"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988844-871253653.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988844-871253653.jpg"}],"salePrice":69999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988844-871253653.jpg","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":69999,"description":"<p><span>Experience effortless 3D printing with the Bambu Lab P1S. This printer sets up in just 15 minutes, boasting a well-polished design and software for seamless operation. Its enclosed body supports high-temperature filament printing, while the AMS enables up to 16-color printing. With up to 20,000 mm/s² acceleration, enjoy rapid printing without compromising quality. Plus, monitor your prints remotely with the built-in camera and Bambu Studio integration </span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/Group_47489_76f7309f-4767-4dac-8a0d-24996ee9f3dc.png?v=1739388901\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/P1S-Multi-color.png?v=1740340302\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/2_7915f07e-1841-4389-8038-455c3cb52fe8.jpg?v=1740340330\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/P1S-feature-mob-1.png?v=1739389000\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<h4>Features:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Works right out of the box, set up in 15 minutes.</li>\n<li>Well-polished hardware and software.</li>\n<li>Enclosed body for high-temperature filament printing.</li>\n<li>Up to 16-color printing with AMS.</li>\n<li>Up to 20000 mm/s² acceleration, prints a benchy in 18min.</li>\n<li>Build-in camera for remote monitoring and timelapse.</li>\n<li>Hot End: All-Metal.</li>\n<li>Nozzle: Stainless Steel.</li>\n<li>Max Hot End Temperature: 300.</li>\n<li>Build Plate Surface Compatibility: Bambu Textured PEI Plate, Bambu Cool Plate, Bambu Engineering Plate, Bambu High-Temperature Plate</li>\n<li>Max Build Plate Temperature: 100.</li>\n<li>Max Speed of Tool Head: 500 mm/s.</li>\n<li>Max Acceleration of Tool Head: 20 m/s².</li>\n<li>Filament Run Out Sensor: Yes</li>\n<li>Electrical Requirements: 100-240 VAC, 50/60 Hz, 1000 W @220 V, 350W@110V.</li>\n</ol>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988844-871253653.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988844-871253653.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988916-800230610.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988854-397205766.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988884-298445697.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443991103-929814997.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988844-871253653.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988916-800230610.jpg","shortDescription":"<p><span>Experience effortless 3D printing with the Bambu Lab P1S. This printer sets up in just 15 minutes, boasting a well-polished design and software for seamless operation. Its enclosed body supports high-temperature filament printing, while the AMS enables up to 16-color printing. With up to 20,000 mm/s² acceleration, enjoy rapid printing without compromising quality. Plus, monitor your prints remotely with the built-in camera and Bambu Studio integration </span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/Group_47489_76f7309f-4767-4dac-8a0d-24996ee9f3dc.png?v=1739388901\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/P1S-Multi-color.png?v=1740340302\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/2_7915f07e-1841-4389-8038-455c3cb52fe8.jpg?v=1740340330\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/P1S-feature-mob-1.png?v=1739389000\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<h4>Features:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Works right out of the box, set up in 15 minutes.</li>\n<li>Well-polished hardware and software.</li>\n<li>Enclosed body for high-temperature filament printing.</li>\n<li>Up to 16-color printing with AMS.</li>\n<li>Up to 20000 mm/s² acceleration, prints a benchy in 18min.</li>\n<li>Build-in camera for remote monitoring and timelapse.</li>\n<li>Hot End: All-Metal.</li>\n<li>Nozzle: Stainless Steel.</li>\n<li>Max Hot End Temperature: 300.</li>\n<li>Build Plate Surface Compatibility: Bambu Textured PEI Plate, Bambu Cool Plate, Bambu Engineering Plate, Bambu High-Temperature Plate</li>\n<li>Max Build Plate Temperature: 100.</li>\n<li>Max Speed of Tool Head: 500 mm/s.</li>\n<li>Max Acceleration of Tool Head: 20 m/s².</li>\n<li>Filament Run Out Sensor: Yes</li>\n<li>Electrical Requirements: 100-240 VAC, 50/60 Hz, 1000 W @220 V, 350W@110V.</li>\n</ol>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443988844-871253653.jpg"]},{"id":"80b3b3a0-5116-428f-952a-75bd30b12ca0","mrp":18499,"sku":"elegoo-mercury-plus-3-0-wash-and-cure-station","name":"ELEGOO Mercury Plus 3.0 Wash and Cure Station","slug":"elegoo-mercury-plus-3-0-wash-and-cure-station","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":0,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444001329-708737445.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444002247-700046565.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444001740-193231238.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444001234-623577015.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444003305-190352976.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444003687-219715107.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444005089-902966637.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"b31daec4-02b6-4767-a33c-b567bf5263a9","sku":"elegoo-mercury-plus-3-0-wash-and-cure-station-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"18499","stock":0,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapi