 curing station</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Operation</strong>: Intuitive touch panel with customizable wash and cure times (up to 30 minutes) for convenient use and optimal results.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Anti-UV Protection Cover</strong>: Blocks 99.9% of UV rays for eye protection, with a micro-switch that stops the curing process when the cover is removed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Ideal Compatibility</strong>: Compatible with most LCD/DLP/SLA 3D printers, designed for<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Resin Curing Machine</strong><span> </span>compatibility, and works with models like the Jupiter series (plate removal may be required).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Choose the ELEGOO Mercury Plus 3.0 Wash and Cure Station?</strong></p>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 3.0 Wash and Cure Station</strong><span> </span>is perfect for creators looking for a<span> </span><strong>resin 3D printer post-processing solution</strong><span> </span>that can handle large or multiple prints, providing excellent results in<span> </span><strong>fast and efficient curing</strong>. Whether you’re using it for<span> </span><strong>prototyping</strong>,<span> </span><strong>artistic prints</strong>, or<span> </span><strong>functional parts</strong>, this<span> </span><strong>high-capacity wash and cure station</strong><span> </span>guarantees your models get the attention they deserve.</p>\n<h3>What’s Included in the Box:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Mercury 3.0 Plus Wash and Cure Station</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Cleaning Bucket</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Curing Turntable</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Cleaning Basket</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Adjustable Brackets (2 pieces)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>User Manual</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Tools</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Power Adapter</strong></li>\n</ul>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444001329-708737445.png"]},{"id":"5819a9d4-51e8-4838-b5b4-287e14b68234"