-edge technology and user-centric design, ideal for both professionals and enthusiasts seeking high-performance desktop 3D printing capabilities. Its compact yet robust frame ensures stability during intricate print jobs, complemented by precise stepper motors that deliver exceptional detail and accuracy. Equipped with a user-friendly interface—either through a touchscreen or intuitive control panel—the A1 simplifies setup, calibration, and operation. It boasts a generous build volume, accommodating a variety of filament materials including PLA, ABS, and PETG, thereby catering to diverse project needs</span></p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Full-auto Calibration</li>\n<li>Multi-Color Printing (Combo Version)</li>\n<li>Active Flow Rate Compensation</li>\n<li>1-Clip Quick Swap Nozzle</li>\n<li>Chamber Monitoring Camera Low Frame Rate Camera (Up to 1080P) Timelapse Supported</li>\n<li>Active Motor Noise Cancelling</li>\n<li>256*256*256 mm³ Build Volume<br><br>\n</li>\n</ol>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443989633-896152937.png"]},{"id":"0465ab12-81f8-42d9-97ef-5204c3f1c565","mrp":37549,"sku":"anycubic-kobra-2-plus-3d-printer","name":"Anycubic Kobra 2 Plus 3D Printer","slug":"anycubic-kobra-2-plus-3d-printer","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":10,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443990700-483212281.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443991260-253118218.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443991154-186155297.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443990737-645008