b0da","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:58:47.663Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992605-756736056.png","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992605-756736056.png"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992605-756736056.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992605-756736056.png"}],"salePrice":24900,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992605-756736056.png","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":24900,"description":"<h2>\n<br>Features </h2>\n<ol class=\"\">\n<li>【10X Boost in Speed】Compared to mainstream FDM 3D printers, the printing speed is increased by 10 times. The maximum printing speed up to 500mm/s. Recommended print speed is 300mm/s.</li>\n<li> 【SMART APP CONTROL】 After upgrading the printer firmware to version 3.0.5 or above, the Anycubic APP offers support for various features, including online model library search, real-time video supervision and status monitoring, online slicing and printing, time-lapse recording, as well as remote control and management.</li>\n<li> 【Brand New Structure】By utilizing an optimized direct extruder and a movement structure in the extrusion system and cooling system, it can effectively and precisely deliver the filament, quickly melt and cool to form, and run smoothly to reduce layer lines.</li>\n<li> 【Smooth and Detailed】One-click vibration compensation, by detecting the resonance frequency of the X/Y axis with an internally built accelerometer G-sensor, smart adjustments are made to motion control, effectively eliminating resonance vertical lines and bracket lines.</li>\n<li> 【LeviQ 2.0 Auto Leveling Smart Z-Offse】By designing a unique module, it can intelligently compensate for Z-axis offset, while also supporting custom Z-axis compensation values, meeting the needs of different users and usage environments.</li>\n<li> 【High Power Powerful Computing】Equipped with a high-performance Cortex-A7 1.2Ghz processor, providing abundant computing power for faster calculation and command execution, which results in 10x faster printing.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857100-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857069-2320.jpg?v=1736367481\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857020-2320.jpg?v=1736367482\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857056-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857080-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857045-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857100-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722856981-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857030-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857007-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\"></p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992605-756736056.png","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992605-756736056.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992293-393875364.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992374-531222559.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443991973-173440726.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443995757-696104154.png"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992605-756736056.png"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992293-393875364.png","shortDescription":"<h2>\n<br>Features </h2>\n<ol class=\"\">\n<li>【10X Boost in Speed】Compared to mainstream FDM 3D printers, the printing speed is increased by 10 times. The maximum printing speed up to 500mm/s. Recommended print speed is 300mm/s.</li>\n<li> 【SMART APP CONTROL】 After upgrading the printer firmware to version 3.0.5 or above, the Anycubic APP offers support for various features, including online model library search, real-time video supervision and status monitoring, online slicing and printing, time-lapse recording, as well as remote control and management.</li>\n<li> 【Brand New Structure】By utilizing an optimized direct extruder and a movement structure in the extrusion system and cooling system, it can effectively and precisely deliver the filament, quickly melt and cool to form, and run smoothly to reduce layer lines.</li>\n<li> 【Smooth and Detailed】One-click vibration compensation, by detecting the resonance frequency of the X/Y axis with an internally built accelerometer G-sensor, smart adjustments are made to motion control, effectively eliminating resonance vertical lines and bracket lines.</li>\n<li> 【LeviQ 2.0 Auto Leveling Smart Z-Offse】By designing a unique module, it can intelligently compensate for Z-axis offset, while also supporting custom Z-axis compensation values, meeting the needs of different users and usage environments.</li>\n<li> 【High Power Powerful Computing】Equipped with a high-performance Cortex-A7 1.2Ghz processor, providing abundant computing power for faster calculation and command execution, which results in 10x faster printing.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857100-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857069-2320.jpg?v=1736367481\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857020-2320.jpg?v=1736367482\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857056-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857080-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857045-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857100-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722856981-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857030-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/1722857007-2320.jpg?v=1736367483\"></p>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443992605-756736056.png"]},{"id":"c7b9781e-d5e9-47ee-8793-3595a059a3c5","mrp":49999,"sku":"elegoo-mars-4-dlp-resin-3d-printer","name":"ELEGOO Mars 4 DLP 3D Printer","slug":"elegoo-mars-4-dlp-resin-3d-printer","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":0,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443993311-619