 real-time for hassle-free results. Smart sensors monitor resin levels and screen protection, while Wi-Fi cluster printing boosts productivity by controlling multiple printers from one device. With automatic leveling and self-check features, this 3D printer offers a true plug-and-play experience for users of all levels. making it an ideal choice for users seeking a<span> </span><strong>high-resolution LCD 3D printer</strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>150mm/h speed</strong><span> </span>for fast printing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>7-inch 9K Mono LCD resolution</strong><span> </span>with<span> </span><strong>18μm precision</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>92% light uniformity</strong><span> </span>for consistency.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Self-check</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>auto-leveling</strong><span> </span>simplify setup.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>AI camera</strong><span> </span>for real-time monitoring.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mechanical sensor</strong><span> </span>prevents damage.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Time-lapse capture</strong><span> </span>for easy sharing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Overheat protection</strong><span> </span>at 80°C.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power-loss resume</strong><span> </span>functionality.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Quick-release plate</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>dual spout tank</strong>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>9K High-Precision Mono LCD</strong>: Experience stunningly accurate details with a<span> </span><strong>7-inch mono LCD</strong><span> </span>featuring 9K resolution and 18μm XY resolution. This makes it one of the<span> </span><strong>best LCD 3D printers</strong><span> </span>for high-quality prints</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Blazing Fast Printing</strong>: Achieve speeds of up to 150mm/h with tilt release technology, ensuring fast and reliable prints without sacrificing quality. This capability makes it a top choice for<span> </span><strong>fast LCD 3D printing for prototyping</strong>.</li>\