ces and fine details, making it suitable for intricate designs and complex geometries.</li>\n<li>Whether you are working with PLA, ABS, PETG, or other common filaments, the Neptune 4 Brass Nozzle delivers consistent results.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Advantages</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>The Neptune 4 Brass Nozzle offers several advantages over standard nozzles.</li>\n<li>Its brass construction provides superior thermal performance, allowing for faster heating and more stable extrusion temperatures.</li>\n<li>This results in reduced stringing, better layer adhesion, and overall improved print quality.</li>\n<li>Furthermore, its robust build ensures longevity, reducing the frequency of replacements and maintenance costs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Usage Tips</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>For optimal performance, it is recommended to regularly clean the Neptune 4 Brass Nozzle to prevent clogs and ensure smooth filament flow.</li>\n<li>Additionally, adjusting the print settings to match the filament type and desired print quality can further enhance the results.</li>\n<li>By following these guidelines, users can maximize the lifespan and effectiveness of their Neptune 4 Brass Nozzle.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Package Include</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>1 piece of neptune brass nozzle 0.4/0.6/0.8mm.</li>\n</ul>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444005535-762275725.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444005535-762275725.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444005631-171578875.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444005513-12151272.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444005450-990696507.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444005