nd maintenance costs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Usage Tips</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>For optimal performance, it is recommended to regularly clean the Neptune 4 Brass Nozzle to prevent clogs and ensure smooth filament flow.</li>\n<li>Additionally, adjusting the print settings to match the filament type and desired print quality can further enhance the results.</li>\n<li>By following these guidelines, users can maximize the lifespan and effectiveness of their Neptune 4 Brass Nozzle.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Package Include</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>1 piece of neptune brass nozzle 0.4/0.6/0.8mm.</li>\n</ul>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444005535-762275725.jpg"]},{"id":"097c0f69-5c43-4f0c-a5e1-7abccef4ead2","mrp":3500,"sku":"hotend-kit-for-neptune-4-max","name":"Hotend Kit for Neptune 4 Max / 4 Plus","slug":"hotend-kit-for-neptune-4-max","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":23,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006946-452622805.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006924-700502633.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"70fb4e10-cec3-4d0a-ae2a-d89ab21ecb41","sku":"hotend-kit-for-neptune-4-max-0.4 MM","name":"0.4 MM","price":"3500","stock":23,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006946-452622805.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"200","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:59:15.070Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"097c0f69-5c43-4f0c-a5e1-7abccef4ead2","salePrice":"1499","updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:59:15.070Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"SIZE":"0.4 MM"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006946-452622805.png","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006946-452622805.png"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006946-452622805.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006946-452622805.png"}],"salePrice":1499,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006946-452622805.png","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"55a711ea-3f62-443b-9b00-dc8d361e5cac","dealerPrice":1499,"description":"<h2 class=\"productView-title\">Description</h2>\n<div data-content-region=\"product_below_description_title\"><br></div>\n<div data-content-region=\"product_below_description_title--global\"><br></div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>High-Performance Assembled Extruder Hotend Kit for Neptune 4 Plus / 4 Max </strong>:<span> </span><strong>Boost Your 3D Printing Precision and Versatility with Reliable Performance</strong></p>\n<p>This Assembled Extruder Hotend Kit for Neptune 4 and Neptune 4 Pro 3D printers is designed for precision and reliability, making it an essential addition for both professionals and hobbyists. With a robust combination of components—including a 0.4mm brass nozzle, PTFE tube, copper-titanium throat pipe, and an advanced aluminum heating block—this comprehensive kit ensures smooth, high-temperature printing up to 300℃. Its effective heat dissipation and seamless connection design provide stability during printing, allowing for consistent, high-quality output across a wide range of filament types, including PLA, ABS, PETG, TPU, and even high-temperature materials like nylon.</p>\n<p>Built for effortless installation, this extruder hotend kit integrates seamlessly with your Neptune 4 Plus or Neptune 4 Max, thanks to its modular interface and easy assembly. Upgrade your printing capabilities and open doors to more creative projects with enhanced accuracy and versatility.</p>\n<div><strong>Features:</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<strong>Comprehensive Kit</strong>: Includes essential components like a 0.4mm brass nozzle, PTFE tube, copper-titanium throat pipe, and aluminum heating block.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<strong>Efficient Heat Dissipation</strong>: Features an advanced, widened aluminum heat silk that effectively dissipates heat, preventing overheating and ensuring consistent results.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<strong>Precise Temperature Control</strong>: Allows high-temperature printing up to 300℃, enabling compatibility with a variety of filaments.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<strong>Seamless Connection</strong>: Designed for a secure, leak-free fit that prevents filament oozing, providing a smoother printing experience.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<strong>Easy Installation</strong>: Quick and straightforward setup with screws and a modular interface, designed specifically for Neptune 4 Plus and Neptune 4 Max.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<strong>Wide Compatibility</strong>: Suitable for PLA, ABS, PETG, TPU, and high-temperature filaments like nylon, expanding your creative possibilities.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006946-452622805.png","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006946-452622805.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006924-700502633.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006946-452622805.png"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006924-700502633.jpg","shortDescription":"<h2 class=\"productView-title\">Description</h2>\n<div data-content-region=\"product_below_description_title\"><br></div>\n<div data-content-region=\"product_below_description_title--global\"><br></div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>High-Performance Assembled Extruder Hotend Kit for Neptune 4 Plus / 4 Max </strong>:<span> </span><strong>Boost Your 3D Printing Precision and Versatility with Reliable Performance</strong></p>\n<p>This Assembled Extruder Hotend Kit for Neptune 4 and Neptune 4 Pro 3D printers is designed for precision and reliability, making it an essential addition for both professionals and hobbyists. With a robust combination of components—including a 0.4mm brass nozzle, PTFE tube, copper-titanium throat pipe, and an advanced aluminum heating block—this comprehensive kit ensures smooth, high-temperature printing up to 300℃. Its effective heat dissipation and seamless connection design provide stability during printing, allowing for consistent, high-quality output across a wide range of filament types, including PLA, ABS, PETG, TPU, and even high-temperature materials like nylon.</p>\n<p>Built for effortless installation, this extruder hotend kit integrates seamlessly with your Neptune 4 Plus or Neptune 4 Max, thanks to its modular interface and easy assembly. Upgrade your printing capabilities and open doors to more creative projects with enhanced accuracy and versatility.</p>\n<div><strong>Features:</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<strong>Comprehensive Kit</strong>: Includes essential components like a 0.4mm brass nozzle, PTFE tube, copper-titanium throat pipe, and aluminum heating block.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<strong>Efficient Heat Dissipation</strong>: Features an advanced, widened aluminum heat silk that effectively dissipates heat, preventing overheating and ensuring consistent results.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<strong>Precise Temperature Control</strong>: Allows high-temperature printing up to 300℃, enabling compatibility with a variety of filaments.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<strong>Seamless Connection</strong>: Designed for a secure, leak-free fit that prevents filament oozing, providing a smoother printing experience.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<strong>Easy Installation</strong>: Quick and straightforward setup with screws and a modular interface, designed specifically for Neptune 4 Plus and Neptune 4 Max.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<strong>Wide Compatibility</strong>: Suitable for PLA, ABS, PETG, TPU, and high-temperature filaments like nylon, expanding your creative possibilities.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444006946-452622805.png"]},{"id":"9c78b1ca-3460-4d0b-8aa7-d8ce584aa003","mrp":5950,"sku":"pla-filament-1-75mm-bundle-pack","name":"PLA Pro Filament 1.75mm Bundle Pack","slug":"pla-filament-1-75mm-bundle-pack","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":200,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444009319-788195334.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444009268-167881988.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444008189-303818871.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"1405ae3a-7f36-498d-961d-f899df78e668","sku":"pla-filament-1-75mm-bundle-pack-Pack of 2","name":"Pack of 2","price":"1220","stock":92,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444009319-788195334.png","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"2500","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:59:16.858Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"9c78b1ca-3460-4d0b-8aa7-d8ce584aa003","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:59:16.858Z","v