rPrice":64999,"description":"<h1><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>Jupiter SE<span> </span></strong>Experience the limitless potential of 3D printing with the<span> </span><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong>. This affordable marvel for large format resin 3D printing boasts a<span> </span><strong>12.8-inch 6K</strong><span> </span>monochrome<span> </span><strong>LCD 3D Printer</strong>, ensuring precision with a<span> </span><strong>51-micron XY</strong><span> </span>resolution. With innovative features catering to professionals and enthusiasts, the<span> </span><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong><span> </span>redefines resin 3D printing standards.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Spacious Build Volume:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The<span> </span><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong><span> </span>boasts a generous build volume of 277.848 x 156.264 x 300 mm³, allowing you to print<span> </span><strong>Large size models</strong><span> </span>or multiple parts in a single batch. This makes it ideal for ambitious projects, professional use, or commercial applications.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Automated Resin Management System:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>One of the standout features is its<span> </span><strong>automatic resin feeding and recycling device</strong>, ensuring a continuous resin supply during the printing process. This system also collects and recycles unused resin, reducing waste and saving costs.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>COB + Refractive Light Source:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The printer adopts a<span> </span><strong>COB+refractive light source</strong>, a technology that reduces light dispersion and provides uniform exposure. This results in sharper<span> </span><strong>details</strong>, smoother prints, and accurate dimensions.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Efficient Cooling System:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The efficient cooling system, with cooling fans and heat-conducting copper tubes on both sides of the COB light source, ensures proper heat dissipation. This maintains a stable temperature during printing, ultimately extending the service life of the printer.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Hassle-free Slicing:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The<span> </span><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong><span> </span>is compatible with Tango and ChituBox for easy slicing according to your 3D printing needs.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Additional Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The printer has a<span> </span><strong>lighter build</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>print components</strong>, contributing to enhanced efficiency.</li>\n<li>An<span> </span><strong>electronic auto feeding system</strong><span> </span>for resin ensures a seamless printing experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Faster resin emptying</strong><span> </span>and an<span> </span><strong>improved cooling system</strong><span> </span>contribute to a smoother workflow.</li>\n<li>Versatility for printing<span> </span><strong>miniatures</strong>,<span> </span><strong>large objects</strong>, and intricate<span> </span><strong>sculptures</strong>.</li>\n<li>Offers a<span> </span><strong>stand</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>filament version</strong><span> </span>for<span> </span><strong>diverse printing options</strong>.</li>\n</ul>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018274-267063235.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018274-267063235.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018141-794821639.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018120-270038949.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018115-650033162.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444020070-107218689.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444020138-828429901.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444020207-839607480.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444020690-433931386.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444021745-964840701.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444022127-518512705.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444022278-965048564.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018274-267063235.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018141-794821639.jpg","shortDescription":"<h1><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>Jupiter SE<span> </span></strong>Experience the limitless potential of 3D printing with the<span> </span><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong>. This affordable marvel for large format resin 3D printing boasts a<span> </span><strong>12.8-inch 6K</strong><span> </span>monochrome<span> </span><strong>LCD 3D Printer</strong>, ensuring precision with a<span> </span><strong>51-micron XY</strong><span> </span>resolution. With innovative features catering to professionals and enthusiasts, the<span> </span><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong><span> </span>redefines resin 3D printing standards.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Spacious Build Volume:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The<span> </span><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong><span> </span>boasts a generous build volume of 277.848 x 156.264 x 300 mm³, allowing you to print<span> </span><strong>Large size models</strong><span> </span>or multiple parts in a single batch. This makes it ideal for ambitious projects, professional use, or commercial applications.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Automated Resin Management System:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>One of the standout features is its<span> </span><strong>automatic resin feeding and recycling device</strong>, ensuring a continuous resin supply during the printing process. This system also collects and recycles unused resin, reducing waste and saving costs.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>COB + Refractive Light Source:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The printer adopts a<span> </span><strong>COB+refractive light source</strong>, a technology that reduces light dispersion and provides uniform exposure. This results in sharper<span> </span><strong>details</strong>, smoother prints, and accurate dimensions.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Efficient Cooling System:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The efficient cooling system, with cooling fans and heat-conducting copper tubes on both sides of the COB light source, ensures proper heat dissipation. This maintains a stable temperature during printing, ultimately extending the service life of the printer.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Hassle-free Slicing:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The<span> </span><strong>Elegoo Jupiter SE</strong><span> </span>is compatible with Tango and ChituBox for easy slicing according to your 3D printing needs.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Additional Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The printer has a<span> </span><strong>lighter build</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>print components</strong>, contributing to enhanced efficiency.</li>\n<li>An<span> </span><strong>electronic auto feeding system</strong><span> </span>for resin ensures a seamless printing experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Faster resin emptying</strong><span> </span>and an<span> </span><strong>improved cooling system</strong><span> </span>contribute to a smoother workflow.</li>\n<li>Versatility for printing<span> </span><strong>miniatures</strong>,<span> </span><strong>large objects</strong>, and intricate<span> </span><strong>sculptures</strong>.</li>\n<li>Offers a<span> </span><strong>stand</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>filament version</strong><span> </span>for<span> </span><strong>diverse printing options</strong>.</li>\n</ul>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018274-267063235.jpg"]},{"id":"2e75b1d8-7acc-4916-b0e7-50956dc2c2f0","mrp":21499,"sku":"bambu-lab-a1-mini","name":"Bambu Lab A1 Mini 3D Printer","slug":"bambu-lab-a1-mini","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":2,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018366-345115012.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018350-567517533.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"227046ee-5438-45b6-bec7-f41d0451431e","sku":"bambu-lab-a1-mini-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"21499","stock":2,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018366-345115012.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"10000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:59:43.853Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"2e75b1d8-7acc-4916-b0e7-50956dc2c2f0","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:59:43.853Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018366-345115012.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018366-345115012.jpg"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018366-345115012.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018366-345115012.jpg"}],"salePrice":21499,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444018366-345115012.jpg","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":21499,"description":"<p><span>The Bambu Lab A1 Mini 3D Printer is a compact and versatile desktop device designed to deliver high-quality 3D printing capabilities in a small footprint. Featuring a sleek and modern design, it combines advanced technology with user-friendly features suitable for both beginners and experienced users alike. The A1 Mini boasts precise printing capabilities, powered by reliable stepper motors and a stable frame structure, ensuring accurate and detailed prints consistently. Despite its small size, it offers a respectable build volume that allows for creating various prototypes, models, and functional parts with ease. Equipped with a user-friendly interface, possibly a touchscreen or intuitive controls, the printer simplifies setup, operation, and monitoring of print jobs. It supports multiple filament types such as PLA, ABS, and PETG, accommodating a wide range of project requirements. </span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<h4><strong>Features:</strong></h4>\n<ol class=\"tpl-bannner-ul\">\n<li>Supports Multi-Color Printing</li>\n<li>Plug-N-Play</li>\n<li>Active Flow Rate Compensation</li>\n<li>Full Auto Calibration</li>\n<li>Active Motor Noise Cancelling</li>\n<li>High Speed Precision</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/Screenshot-2024-06-29-144324.jpg?v=1740339402\"></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/Screenshot-2024-06-29-144449_9fdd97bb-665e-4571-aadf-7c39239bcf49.jpg?v=1740339451\"></p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/a