>\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-background-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none background-image\"><img data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/3d551a21-4d9e-4600-8688-b13502394055.__CR0,0,1464,600_PT0_SX1464_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/3d551a21-4d9e-4600-8688-b13502394055.__CR0,0,1464,600_PT0_SX1464_V1___.jpg\" alt=\"K1 Max\" width=\"544\" height=\"223\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"a-section a-text-center\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-cel-widget=\"aplus-premium-module-2-fullbackground-text\" data-csa-c-id=\"2phmae-ce7v-ryydw9-crs4gn\" class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-text aplus-premium\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-background-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none background-image\"><img data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/1caa6603-9504-4fbd-a884-655ebf59edc4.__CR0,0,1464,600_PT0_SX1464_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/1caa6603-9504-4fbd-a884-655ebf59edc4.__CR0,0,1464,600_PT0_SX1464_V1___.jpg\" alt=\"K1 Max 3D Printer\" width=\"547\" height=\"224\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"a-section a-text-center\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-cel-widget=\"aplus-premium-module-3-four-column-images\" data-csa-c-id=\"dkyia5-ywmfnr-hvkjdm-46bn2y\" class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-3-four-column-images aplus-premium\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-3 aplus-container-1\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-four-column\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-column\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none {'column-image'}\"><img data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/f26ac997-c7ad-4481-840a-743f6c039c7f.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/f26ac997-c7ad-4481-840a-743f6c039c7f.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" alt=\"K1 Max 3D Printer\" width=\"551\" height=\"414\"></div>\n<h2 class=\"a-section a-spacing-none column-heading\"><strong>AI LiDAR Take Care First Layer</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none column-description\">\n<h3 class=\"aplus-p3\">The 1 μm resolution K1 MAX LiDAR will scan the first layer on its own. It will pause printing and tell you immediately if something goes wrong.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-column\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none {'column-image'}\"><img data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/738eee5e-94a5-48a7-956a-3f0e1f2eb6b8.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/738eee5e-94a5-48a7-956a-3f0e1f2eb6b8.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" alt=\"K1 Max 3D Printer\" width=\"547\" height=\"410\"></div>\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none column-heading\">\n<h2 class=\"aplus-h3 a-text-bold\">AI Camera Keeps a Keen Watch</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none column-description\">\n<h3 class=\"aplus-p3\">K1 Max uses an AI camera to watch over spaghetti failure, foreign objects, debris, etc.supports real-time monitoring, creates time-lapses for sharing.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-column\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none {'column-image'}\"><img data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/af42b3a4-801d-4c6e-a14e-377b7b32b93a.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/af42b3a4-801d-4c6e-a14e-377b7b32b93a.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" alt=\"K1 Max 3D Printer\" width=\"540\" height=\"405\"></div>\n<h2 class=\"a-section a-spacing-none column-heading\">Auto-leveling &amp; Self-test</h2>\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none column-description\">\n<h3 class=\"aplus-p3\">Give a tap, and K1 MAX will self-test the extruder, heatbed, camera, fan, Auto-leveling. Any abnormality detected will prompt on the display.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-column\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none {'column-image'}\"><img data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/8c5d1b66-713a-4e0f-beec-9ee65bcc2460.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/8c5d1b66-713a-4e0f-beec-9ee65bcc2460.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" alt=\"K1 Max 3D Printer\" width=\"543\" height=\"407\"></div>\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none column-heading\">\n<h2 class=\"aplus-h3 a-text-bold\">Smart Creality OS System</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none column-description\">\n<h3 class=\"aplus-p3\">K1 MAX features a straightforward UI,</h3>\n<h3 class=\"aplus-p3\">and syncs data and commands with PC, phone, Cloud, and add-on modules.</h3>\n<h3 class=\"aplus-p3\">Dual-core 1.2GHz CPU,8G ROM stores.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-cel-widget=\"aplus-premium-module-13-carousel\" data-csa-c-id=\"w8vxq0-rg1qrx-y3flqv-f5xqxw\" class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-13-carousel aplus-premium\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-13\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none aplus-carousel-container\">\n<div class=\"a-begin a-carousel-container a-carousel-display-single a-carousel-transition-slideCircular a-carousel-initialized\" data-a-transition-strategy=\"slideCircular\" data-a-display-strategy=\"single\" data-a-carousel-options='{\"peek_percentage\":0,\"minimum_gutter_width\":0,\"show_partial_next\":false,\"name\":\"premium-aplus-13-carousel-3\"}' id=\"premium-aplus-13-carousel-3-id\">\n<div class=\"a-row a-carousel-controls a-carousel-row a-carousel-has-buttons a-carousel-overlay-buttons a-carousel-rounded-buttons\">\n<div class=\"a-carousel-row-inner\">\n<h3 class=\"a-carousel-col a-carousel-left\"><br></h3>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444022087-229727807.jpg"]},{"id":"2bbe2a34-b86d-41dd-b76a-d0e079ea6cc7","mrp":55399,"sku":"bambu-lab-p1s","name":"Bambu Lab P1S 3D Printer","slug":"bambu-lab-p1s","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024079-166077924.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024102-309205972.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024101-832158205.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"cb22e15e-264a-4d95-94f5-71a2a59c5188","sku":"bambu-lab-p1s-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"55399","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024079-166077924.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"10000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:59:52.684Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"2bbe2a34-b86d-41dd-b76a-d0e079ea6cc7","salePrice":"52499","updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:59:52.684Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024079-166077924.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024079-166077924.jpg"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024079-166077924.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024079-166077924.jpg"}],"salePrice":52499,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024079-166077924.jpg","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":52499,"description":"<div id=\"aplus_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget pd_rd_w-7MEJe pd_rd_r-VN7C19XHZ6TDWMHN53FP pd_rd_wg-HtiFP\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"aplus\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"aplus_feature_div\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-id=\"x40xpf-xkc9uw-1vokbx-3ov2li\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus_feature_div\">\n<div id=\"aplus\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-large bucket\">\n<p><span>Experience hassle-free 3D printing with the Bambu Lab P1S. Setup is a breeze, taking just 15 minutes, and its well-polished hardware and software ensure smooth operation. The enclosed body supports high-temperature filament printing, while the AMS enables stunning 16-color prints. With up to 20,000 mm/s² acceleration, enjoy rapid printing without sacrificing quality. Plus, monitor your prints remotely with the built-in camera and enjoy seamless multi-color capability with the AMS combo.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h1>Product Description</h1>\n<div class=\"aplus-v2 desktop celwidget\" data-csa-c-id=\"pl0vjl-llb554-2u3nzr-f4j1ni\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus\">\n<div class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-11 aplus-standard\" data-csa-c-id=\"w7lmcu-ru8vjm-cqvlh7-7io6h5\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-11\">\n<div class=\"aplus-module-wrapper apm-spacing apm-floatnone apm-fixed-width\">\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule aplus-module-content\">\n<div class=\"apm-hero-image\"><img height=\"172\" width=\"556\" alt=\"BambuLab P1S Combo\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/366059c6-8a4f-4f62-9b93-dfa615ce2e60.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/366059c6-8a4f-4f62-9b93-dfa615ce2e60.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-2 aplus-standard\" data-csa-c-id=\"bww848-ruwo8c-tv2dvb-jn0i37\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-2\">\n<div class=\"aplus-module-wrapper apm-floatnone apm-fixed-width\">\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule apm-spacing\">\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule-imageleft\"><img height=\"556\" width=\"556\" alt=\"BambuLab P1S 3D Printer\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/30712396-a78c-4cfc-9d7c-200d14062c96.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/30712396-a78c-4cfc-9d7c-200d14062c96.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule-textright\">\n<h2 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><strong>All-around performance right out of the box</strong></h2>\n<h3>It just works right out of the box. You don't have to mess with it, just simply hit print, and the printer will handle all the calibrations (Auto-Bed Leveling, Vibration compensation) for you. Enjoy trouble-free printing every time with your P1S.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-3 aplus-standard\" data-csa-c-id=\"hi4yzo-jd0bk9-yrx4vk-3sfv6f\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-3\">\n<div class=\"aplus-module-wrapper apm-floatnone apm-fixed-width\">\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule apm-spacing\">\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule-imageright\"><img height=\"555\" width=\"555\" alt=\"BambuLab P1S 3D Printer\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/491f4cc8-46bb-4f00-9684-ee24c085b363.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/491f4cc8-46bb-4f00-9684-ee24c085b363.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule-textleft\">\n<h2 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><strong>Multi-color capability</strong></h2>\n<h3>Get the AMS combo to unleash Multi-color printing capability. (up to 16-color if you stack up 4 AMS units). Purchase<span> </span><span class=\"a-text-bold\">additional AMS units</span><span> </span>for more colors.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><img height=\"554\" width=\"554\" src=\"https://store.3ding.in/cdn/shop/files/bambulab-p1s-3d-printer-6666-64bf6eba01f3f_1024x1024@2x.webp?v=1690267737\" alt=\"Bambulab P1S 3D Printer – 3Ding\"></div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<h4>Features:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Set up your Bambu Lab P1S in just 15 minutes, hassle-free.</li>\n<li>Enjoy smooth operation with meticulously designed hardware and software.</li>\n<li>Supports high-temperature filament printing.</li>\n<li>Enables stunning 16-color prints for vibrant and intricate designs.</li>\n<li>20,000 mm/s² acceleration.</li>\n<li>Rapid printing without compromising quality.</li>\n<li>Seamlessly print with up to 16 colors using the AMS combo, enhancing your creativity.</li>\n<li>Monitor your prints remotely for added convenience.</li>\n<li>Max Build Plate Temperature: 100°C</li>\n<li>Max Speed of Tool Head: 500 mm/s</li>\n<li>Max Acceleration of Tool Head: 20 m/s</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"ask-btf_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget pd_rd_w-8v6yT pd_rd_r-VN7C19XHZ6TDWMHN53FP pd_rd_wg-HtiFP\" data-feature-name=\"ask-btf\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"ask-btf\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"ask-btf_feature_div\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-id=\"5ovak6-fbajs3-i5s0jp-n8zxvu\" data-cel-widget=\"ask-btf_feature_div\">\n<div id=\"cf-ask-cel\" class=\"a-section celwidget\" data-csa-c-id=\"otv15j-375a82-5h86e-18vmjl\" data-cel-widget=\"cf-ask-cel\">\n<div id=\"Ask\"><br></div>\n<div data-url=\"/ask/askBrowseAjaxLoad/asin/B0CQ4GJGXD\" class=\"a-section askBTFLazyLoad\">\n<div class=\"celwidget\" data-csa-c-id=\"wd9eh1-f1wdou-2n0cyg-v3x74v\" data-cel-widget=\"ask-browse-ajax-load\">\n<div id=\"ask-btf-container\" class=\"celwidget\" data-csa-c-id=\"9krebv-uxqao5-q3kwu-p6sh3n\" data-cel-widget=\"ask-btf-desktop\">\n<div class=\"askInlineWidget\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024079-166077924.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024079-166077924.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024102-309205972.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024101-832158205.webp"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024079-166077924.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024102-309205972.jpg","shortDescription":"<div id=\"aplus_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget pd_rd_w-7MEJe pd_rd_r-VN7C19XHZ6TDWMHN53FP pd_rd_wg-HtiFP\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"aplus\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"aplus_feature_div\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-id=\"x40xpf-xkc9uw-1vokbx-3ov2li\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus_feature_div\">\n<div id=\"aplus\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-large bucket\">\n<p><span>Experience hassle-free 3D printing with the Bambu Lab P1S. Setup is a breeze, taking just 15 minutes, and its well-polished hardware and software ensure smooth operation. The enclosed body supports high-temperature filament printing, while the AMS enables stunning 16-color prints. With up to 20,000 mm/s² acceleration, enjoy rapid printing without sacrificing quality. Plus, monitor your prints remotely with the built-in camera and enjoy seamless multi-color capability with the AMS combo.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h1>Product Description</h1>\n<div class=\"aplus-v2 desktop celwidget\" data-csa-c-id=\"pl0vjl-llb554-2u3nzr-f4j1ni\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus\">\n<div class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-11 aplus-standard\" data-csa-c-id=\"w7lmcu-ru8vjm-cqvlh7-7io6h5\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-11\">\n<div class=\"aplus-module-wrapper apm-spacing apm-floatnone apm-fixed-width\">\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule aplus-module-content\">\n<div class=\"apm-hero-image\"><img height=\"172\" width=\"556\" alt=\"BambuLab P1S Combo\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/366059c6-8a4f-4f62-9b93-dfa615ce2e60.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/366059c6-8a4f-4f62-9b93-dfa615ce2e60.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-2 aplus-standard\" data-csa-c-id=\"bww848-ruwo8c-tv2dvb-jn0i37\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-2\">\n<div class=\"aplus-module-wrapper apm-floatnone apm-fixed-width\">\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule apm-spacing\">\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule-imageleft\"><img height=\"556\" width=\"556\" alt=\"BambuLab P1S 3D Printer\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/30712396-a78c-4cfc-9d7c-200d14062c96.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/30712396-a78c-4cfc-9d7c-200d14062c96.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule-textright\">\n<h2 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><strong>All-around performance right out of the box</strong></h2>\n<h3>It just works right out of the box. You don't have to mess with it, just simply hit print, and the printer will handle all the calibrations (Auto-Bed Leveling, Vibration compensation) for you. Enjoy trouble-free printing every time with your P1S.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-3 aplus-standard\" data-csa-c-id=\"hi4yzo-jd0bk9-yrx4vk-3sfv6f\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-3\">\n<div class=\"aplus-module-wrapper apm-floatnone apm-fixed-width\">\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule apm-spacing\">\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule-imageright\"><img height=\"555\" width=\"555\" alt=\"BambuLab P1S 3D Printer\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/491f4cc8-46bb-4f00-9684-ee24c085b363.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/491f4cc8-46bb-4f00-9684-ee24c085b363.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"></div>\n<div class=\"apm-sidemodule-textleft\">\n<h2 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><strong>Multi-color capability</strong></h2>\n<h3>Get the AMS combo to unleash Multi-color printing capability. (up to 16-color if you stack up 4 AMS units). Purchase<span> </span><span class=\"a-text-bold\">additional AMS units</span><span> </span>for more colors.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><img height=\"554\" width=\"554\" src=\"https://store.3ding.in/cdn/shop/files/bambulab-p1s-3d-printer-6666-64bf6eba01f3f_1024x1024@2x.webp?v=1690267737\" alt=\"Bambulab P1S 3D Printer – 3Ding\"></div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<h4>Features:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Set up your Bambu Lab P1S in just 15 minutes, hassle-free.</li>\n<li>Enjoy smooth operation with meticulously designed hardware and software.</li>\n<li>Supports high-temperature filament printing.</li>\n<li>Enables stunning 16-color prints for vibrant and intricate designs.</li>\n<li>20,000 mm/s² acceleration.</li>\n<li>Rapid printing without compromising quality.</li>\n<li>Seamlessly print with up to 16 colors using the AMS combo, enhancing your creativity.</li>\n<li>Monitor your prints remotely for added convenience.</li>\n<li>Max Build Plate Temperature: 100°C</li>\n<li>Max Speed of Tool Head: 500 mm/s</li>\n<li>Max Acceleration of Tool Head: 20 m/s</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"ask-btf_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget pd_rd_w-8v6yT pd_rd_r-VN7C19XHZ6TDWMHN53FP pd_rd_wg-HtiFP\" data-feature-name=\"ask-btf\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"ask-btf\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"ask-btf_feature_div\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-id=\"5ovak6-fbajs3-i5s0jp-n8zxvu\" data-cel-widget=\"ask-btf_feature_div\">\n<div id=\"cf-ask-cel\" class=\"a-section celwidget\" data-csa-c-id=\"otv15j-375a82-5h86e-18vmjl\" data-cel-widget=\"cf-ask-cel\">\n<div id=\"Ask\"><br></div>\n<div data-url=\"/ask/askBrowseAjaxLoad/asin/B0CQ4GJGXD\" class=\"a-section askBTFLazyLoad\">\n<div class=\"celwidget\" data-csa-c-id=\"wd9eh1-f1wdou-2n0cyg-v3x74v\" data-cel-widget=\"ask-browse-ajax-load\">\n<div id=\"ask-btf-container\" class=\"celwidget\" data-csa-c-id=\"9krebv-uxqao5-q3kwu-p6sh3n\" data-cel-widget=\"ask-btf-desktop\">\n<div class=\"askInlineWidget\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024079-166077924.jpg"]},{"id":"34ea565d-81c8-4d3b-b488-734fdbff6056","mrp":29999,"sku":"elegoo-neptune-4-pro-fdm-3d-printer","name":"ELEGOO Neptune 4 Pro","slug":"elegoo-neptune-4-pro-fdm-3d-printer","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","stock":10,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444024496-307098507.jpg","isP