erature of the block. A nozzle is screwed into the bottom of the block, which is responsible for extruding the melted filament through its small opening.</p>\n<p>To ensure efficient printing, the heating block must be capable of reaching and maintaining high temperatures for extended periods. The CR-10 heating block is designed to work with a variety of different filaments, including PLA, ABS, PETG, and TPU, and is often compatible with a range of different nozzle sizes to accommodate different printing requirements.</p>\n<p>It's important to note that heating blocks can wear out over time due to high-temperature cycling, so it's important to regularly inspect and replace the heating block to ensure optimal performance and printing quality.</p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055171-654232076.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055171-654232076.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055173-179197753.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055632-418067461.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055626-596465261.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055171-654232076.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055173-179197753.jpg","shortDescription":"<p>The CR-10 heating block is an essential component of a 3D printer that is responsible for heating the filament to its melting point before extrusion. The heating block is typically made of high-quality aluminum alloy to ensure efficient heat transfer and maintain a stable temperature during the printing process.</p>\n<p>The CR-10 heating block typically consists of a hollow cavity designed to hold a heating element, such as a cartridge heater or a thermistor, which is used to monitor the temperature of the block. A nozzle is screwed into the bottom of the block, which is responsible for extruding the melted filament through its small opening.</p>\n<p>To ensure efficient printing, the heating block must be capable of reaching and maintaining high temperatures for extended periods. The CR-10 heating block is designed to work with a variety of different filaments, including PLA, ABS, PETG, and TPU, and is often compatible with a range of different nozzle sizes to accommodate different printing requirements.</p>\n<p>It's important to note that heating blocks can wear out over time due to high-temperature cycling, so it's important to regularly inspect and replace the heating block to ensure optimal performance and printing quality.</p>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444055171-654232076.jpg"]},{"id":"4f781729-ca7c-4858-8645-54701f54087e","mrp":399,"sku":"cr10-extrusion-kit","name":"CR10 Extrusion kit","slug":"cr10-extrusion-kit","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","stock":89,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444057156-937369756.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444056863-89350424.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"3067a211-8e39-4873-84ca-3ac61a18561c","sku":"cr10-extrusion-kit-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"399","stock":89,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444057156-937369756.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"100","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T07:01:32.846Z","