f7d15f2.png?v=1773211559\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">PLA 1.75 mm Filament,  || 750gm / 1 Kg 3D printer</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">PLA filament for 3D printer || 1.75 mm diameter</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Best Quality, 100% Guarantee, Best Printing PLA Filament</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Brand new</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Original and high quality</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Best in price</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">100% technical support before/after support</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/8.png?v=1773211557\" alt=\"\" width=\"203\" height=\"203\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/4_092178a6-4141-4ca1-9ced-b5078ecda079.png?v=1773211558\" alt=\"\" width=\"203\" height=\"203\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/6_bb54f26f-619e-47a9-b919-c11ba3103f6f.png?v=1773211557\" alt=\"\" width=\"203\" height=\"203\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/3_39aec912-e071-4ebb-95a9-042e0903d7fd.png?v=1773211557\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></p>\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">High Quality</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Harmless to human body</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">No air bubble</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Provide Stable printing</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Bright in color</p>\n<p><strong>PLA Filament Properties</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">High Strength, Good toughness</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">No unpleasant smell while heating</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Less warping or shrinking issues</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Nontoxic</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">High print speed and resolution</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>\n<p><strong>Product Specifications</strong></p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<table width=\"382\">\n<colgroup> <col style=\"width: 337px;\"> <col style=\"width: 217px;\"> </colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Diameter</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">1.75 mm</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">HeatBed Temperature</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">45 – 60 oC</p