/ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"shopify-section-template--18231269687458__image_with_text_hQ68qL\" class=\"shopify-section section\">\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div class=\"image-with-text__media-item image-with-text__media-item--medium image-with-text__media-item--top grid__item\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=1500\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"//store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=165 165w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=360 360w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=535 535w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=700 700w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=875 875w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=1070 1070w, //store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_13.jpg?v=1753270995&amp;width=1500 1500w\" width=\"483\" height=\"290\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1440px) 1100px, (min-width: 750px) calc(100vw * 0.67), 100vw\"></div>\n<div class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\">\n<div id=\"ImageWithText--template--18231269687458__image_with_text_hQ68qL\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--radius image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient\">\n<h2 class=\"image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_hQ68qL-heading_WEbtTr appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__heading h3 color-foreground image-with-text__heading--bold break done\">250*250*260mm, Expansive Printing Space</h2>\n<div class=\"image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_hQ68qL-text_etNbbN appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__text text-sm rte body color-foreground done\">\n<p>The Kobra 3 Combo features printing sizes up to 250 x 250 x 260mm, with a maximum printing volume of 4.29 gal (16.25L), increased by a whopping 34% compared to previous 3D printers.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\" class=\"shopify-section yg-image-text\">\n<div class=\"section-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT-padding color- gradient isolate\">\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div class=\"yg-heading\">\n<div class=\"yg-section-title h3\">Start. Print. Relax. Ready for All-Skill Levels</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yg-section-content\">\n<div class=\"yg-section-image hide-mobile\">\n<div class=\"block-image-container\" data-block-id=\"item_7VTpAw\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details-en_1.jpg?v=1753271116\" alt=\"ANYCUBIC-STORE\" width=\"483\" height=\"290\" class=\"hide-mobile yg-image\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yg-question-box grid grid--1-col collapsible-content__grid\">\n<div class=\"grid__item\">\n<details id=\"Details-item_7VTpAw-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\" data-accordion-id=\"item_7VTpAw\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por\" id=\"Summary-item_7VTpAw-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_7VTpAw-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">Resonance Compensation &amp; Flow Correction</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id=\"Details-item_L9apEF-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\" data-accordion-id=\"item_L9apEF\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por\" id=\"Summary-item_L9apEF-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_L9apEF-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">LeviQ3.0 Auto-Leveling &amp; Z-axis Offset</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id=\"Details-item_VcAUqw-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\" data-accordion-id=\"item_VcAUqw\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por\" id=\"Summary-item_VcAUqw-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_VcAUqw-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">AI Monitoring② &amp; Auto Resume Prints</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id=\"Details-item_EhVtKC-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\" data-accordion-id=\"item_EhVtKC\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por\" id=\"Summary-item_EhVtKC-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_EhVtKC-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_wEUqPT\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">Adjust Belts Conveniently</span></summary>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" class=\"shopify-section yg-image-text\">\n<div class=\"section-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3-padding color- gradient isolate\">\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div class=\"yg-heading\">\n<div class=\"yg-section-title h3\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yg-section-content\">\n<div class=\"yg-section-image hide-mobile\">\n<div class=\"block-image-container\" data-block-id=\"item_7CPcbP\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/kobra-3-combo-details_9.jpg?v=1753271298\" alt=\"ANYCUBIC-STORE\" width=\"483\" height=\"290\" class=\"hide-mobile yg-image\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yg-question-box grid grid--1-col collapsible-content__grid\">\n<div class=\"grid__item\">\n<details id=\"Details-item_7CPcbP-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" data-accordion-id=\"item_7CPcbP\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por\" id=\"Summary-item_7CPcbP-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_7CPcbP-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">Easy installation with only two ports connected</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id=\"Details-item_4Npq3Q-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" data-accordion-id=\"item_4Npq3Q\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por\" id=\"Summary-item_4Npq3Q-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_4Npq3Q-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">The 4.3-inch touchscreen features a customizable tilt of 30° to 60°</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id=\"Details-item_7dnawm-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" data-accordion-id=\"item_7dnawm\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por\" id=\"Summary-item_7dnawm-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_7dnawm-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">SG15 Bearings and Dual-axis Core and Dual-Z-axis</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id=\"Details-item_YKF4Vk-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" data-accordion-id=\"item_YKF4Vk\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por\" id=\"Summary-item_YKF4Vk-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_YKF4Vk-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">300℃ Quick-release Hotend</span></summary>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--18231269687458__yg_download_grid_rchDq9\" class=\"shopify-section section\">\n<div class=\"section-template--18231269687458__yg_download_grid_rchDq9-padding color-background-1 gradient isolate\">\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"flex  center justify-center  w100 align-center title__gap por\">\n<h2 class=\"title__heading h3 font-heading-extra-bold margin0 lh1 title__heading--before-line\">The Anycubic Software Ecosystem</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<div class=\"item__image__text\">\n<div class=\"iamge-container\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/image_153.png?v=1750055680\" alt=\"ANYCUBIC-STORE\" width=\"483\" height=\"272\" class=\"yg-image\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div class=\"item__content\">\n<div class=\"text-container\">\n<h3 class=\"item__title h6\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 16.38px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span>\n</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<div id=\"k-hub\"></div>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443900222-299591522.png"]},{"id":"ef4c5c46-4ebb-405c-a7fe-d8f6aa7b9b08","mrp":259999,"sku":"bambu-lab-x1e-combo-3d-printer","name":"Bambu Lab X1E Combo 3D Printer","slug":"bambu-lab-x1e-combo-3d-printer","brand":"ac20995a-cd2b-4183-a53c-4f4ef658a9e5","stock":0,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909209-746728232.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909202-88896264.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"db1c38ea-755a-452d-a8cf-7be20d5f412c","sku":"bambu-lab-x1e-combo-3d-printer-X1E Combo","name":"X1E Combo","price":"259999","stock":0,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909209-746728232.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"20000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:56:14.148Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"ef4c5c46-4ebb-405c-a7fe-d8f6aa7b9b08","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:56:14.148Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"model":"X1E Combo"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909209-746728232.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909209-746728232.jpg"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909209-746728232.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909209-746728232.jpg"}],"salePrice":259999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909209-746728232.jpg","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":259999,"description":"<h4>Features:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Offers stable Ethernet and WPA2-Enterprise Wi-Fi authentication for robust network communication.</li>\n<li>Operates independently without reliance on cloud services, allowing for full functionality within local networks.</li>\n<li>Utilizes G3 pre-filter, H12 HEPA filter, and activated carbon filter to effectively filter particulates and VOCs.</li>\n<li>Regulates chamber temperature up to 60°C to reduce warping and improve layer bonding.</li>\n<li>Allows for printing with high-performance materials like PPA-CF/GF and PPS with better dimensional stability and mechanical performance.</li>\n<li>Incorporates carbon-fiber rods for a rigid structure, enabling high-speed printing with minimal vibrations.<br>Vibration and Extrusion Compensation: Automatically compensates for XY-axis vibrations and extrusion issues for smooth print quality.</li>\n<li>Detects print failures and pauses printing automatically to prevent wastage and downtime.</li>\n<li>Supports auto filament reload and multi-material printing for improved surface quality and seamless color transition</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The X1E 3D printer represents a cutting-edge solution with enhanced connectivity options, including stable Ethernet and WPA2-Enterprise Wi-Fi authentication, ensuring robust network communication even in complex environments. Operating independently from cloud services, it offers heavy-duty air filtration, active heating, and controlled chamber temperature for optimal print quality. With advanced features like AI failure detection and intelligent filament management, the X1E promises seamless, high-quality 3D printing experiences.</p>\n<p><span><strong> </strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-1ctl6fc\">\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"right  white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Enhanced And More Connection Options</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Stable Ethernet Connection, WPA2-Enterprise Authentication Wi-Fi Connection</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">The X1E offers the option to connect to your devices through its newly added Ethernet port, ensuring robust network communication in complex environments. Ethernet connectivity can also be used in crowded wireless signal environments. Additionally, the X1E provides WPA2-Enterprise Wi-Fi Authentication (EAP-PEAP/EAP-TLS/EAP-TTLS) and individual physical kill switches for both Wi-Fi and Ethernet, meeting stringent network security requirements.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-1igvxx3\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section2-bg-sm-a9a4e42cc981f.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section2-bg-sm-a9a4e42cc981f.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section2-bg-a9a4e42cc981f.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section2-bg-a9a4e42cc981f.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Off-Cloud Operation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Fully Functional With LAN Only Mode</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">The X1E can operate independently without a connection to Bambu Cloud Service, fully functional within your local network. Customers can remotely control the X1E through LAN communication without requiring an Internet connection. For additional customization details, please contact your regional reseller.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-km5jbx\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section3-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section3-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section3-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section3-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"center  white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Heavy Duty Air Filtration</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Effectively Filter Particulates And VOCs Generated by 3D Printing</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">We combined a G3 pre-filter, an H12 HEPA filter, and a high-quality coconut shell activated carbon filter to provide optimal air filtration. Enhanced filtration can effectively reduce excessive odors and particulates when printing in less ventilated environments.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-14xnr7j\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section4-bg-sm-21bf209be99c8.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section4-bg-sm-21bf209be99c8.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section4-bg-21bf209be99c8.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section4-bg-21bf209be99c8.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Active Heating And Controlled Chamber Temp</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Reduce Warping, Improve Layer Bonding</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">The X1E can actively heat and regulate the chamber temperature. Accurately controlled chamber temperature (up to 60°C or 140°F) improves print quality, especially for filaments prone to warping such as ABS and PC.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-17v1knm\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section5-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section5-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section5-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section5-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"right  white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">320 °C (608 °F) Nozzle Temp</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">More Heat For Higher Temperature Materials</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">Higher nozzle temperature make possible to print higher performance materials such as PPA-CF/GF, PPS and PPS-CF. These new materials have better dimensional stability, heat resistance and mechanical performance.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-1fzbe9n\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section6-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section6-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section6-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section6-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Robust High Speed CoreXY</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Super Fast And Rigid Structure For Continuous High Speed Printing</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">The superior carbon-fiber rods in the CoreXY motion structure enable the X1E to achieve a toolhead acceleration of 20,000 mm/s² by reducing the weight of moving parts. This faster acceleration allows the X1E to maintain its maximum travel speed of 500 mm/s for longer periods, significantly reducing overall print time.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-3din2r\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section7-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section7-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section7-bg-84c8728d6d304.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section7-bg-84c8728d6d304.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"right  white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Vibration And Extrusion Compensation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Stable &amp; Quality Prints Even At Higher Speeds</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">X1E can actively compensate for XY-axis vibrations and extrusion issues to ensure exceptionally smooth print quality. All measurements are fully automatic, eliminating the need for manual adjustments.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-irhmoc\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section8-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section8-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section8-bg-84c8728d6d304.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section8-bg-84c8728d6d304.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">AI Failure Detection</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Reduce Filament Wastage And Machine Downtime</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">The X1E's AI algorithm can detect first-layer imperfections and spaghetti failures with the assistance of Lidar and computer vision. It then automatically pauses the print to prevent catastrophic failures.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-zpiz4p\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section9-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section9-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section9-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section9-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"right  white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Intelligent Filament Management</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Supports Auto Filament Reload and Enables Multi-Material Printing with Support Material for Improved Surface Quality</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">X1E can parallel connect 4 Bambu AMS systems to print with up to 16 spools of filaments, good for printing dedicated support materials for seamless surface and printing multi-color. The AMS system also supports automatic filament reload to make sure you use all the filament on your spool before switching to a new one.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"portal-css-igw06u\">\n<div class=\"portal-css-1pi5k70\">\n<div class=\"en-IN portal-css-1owat0\">\n<div class=\"portal-css-1ful18u\"><picture><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/compare-x1e-116dd4b722f47.png\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/compare-x1e-116dd4b722f47.png\"></picture></div>\n<div class=\"portal-css-1ful18u\"><picture><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/compare-x1c-116dd4b722f47.png\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/compare-x1c-116dd4b722f47.png\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"portal-css-nprfx\">\n<div class=\"portal-css-54kfoh\">\n<div class=\"flexContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem tab\">X1E</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem tab\">X1C</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTitleContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Wi-Fi</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Wi-Fi</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTextContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Frequency Range: 2400 MHz - 2483.5 MHz</p>\n<p><br>WPA2-Enterprise: <br><span>EAP-PEAP</span><br><span>EAP-TLS</span><br><span>EAP-TTLS</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Frequency Range: 2400 MHz - 2483.5 MHz</p>\n<p><br>WPA2-Enterprise: <br>No</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareDescContent\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTitleContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Ethernet</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Ethernet</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTextContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Socket:<span> </span><span>RJ45</span><br>Speed:<span> </span><span>100 Mbps / Full Duplex</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Socket: /<br>Speed: /</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareDescContent\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTitleContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Supported Filaments</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Supported Filaments</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTextContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>PLA, PETG, TPU, PVA, BVOH: Optimal<br>ABS, ASA, PC, PA, PET:<span> </span><span>Superior</span><br>Carbon/Glass Fiber Reinforced PLA, PETG, PA, PET, PC, ABS, ASA:<span> </span><span>Superior</span><br>PPA-CF/GF, PPS, PPS-CF/GF:<span> </span><span>Ideal</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>PLA, PETG, TPU, PVA, BVOH: Optimal<br>ABS, ASA, PC, PA, PET: Ideal<br>Carbon/Glass Fiber Reinforced PLA, PETG, PA, PET, PC, ABS, ASA: Ideal<br>PPA-CF/GF, PPS, PPS-CF/GF: Compatible</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareDescContent\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTitleContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Heating</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Heating</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTextContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Active Chamber Heating:<span> </span><span>Yes</span><br>Maximum Chamber Control Temperature:<span> </span><span>60℃</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Active Chamber Heating: No<br>Maximum Chamber Control Temperature: /</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareDescContent\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTitleContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Air Purification</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Air Purification</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTextContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Pre-filter grade:<span> </span><span>G3</span><br>HEPA filter grade:<span> </span><span>H12</span><br>Activated Carbon Filter type:<span> </span><span>Coconut Shell Granulated</span><br>VOC Filtration:<span> </span><span>Optimal</span><br>Particulate Matter Filtration:<span> </span><span>Yes</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Pre-filter grade: None<br>HEPA filter grade: None<br>Activated Carbon Filter type: Coal Based Pellets<br>VOC Filtration: Capable<br>Particulate Matter Filtration: No</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareDescContent\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTitleContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Network Control</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Network Control</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTextContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Ethernet:<span> </span><span>Yes</span><br>Wireless Network: Wi-Fi<br>Network Kill Switch:<span> </span><span>Wi-Fi &amp; Ethernet</span><br>Removable Network Module:<span> </span><span>Yes</span><br>802.1X Network Access Control:<span> </span><span>Yes</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Ethernet: No<br>Wireless Network: Wi-Fi<br>Network Kill Switch: No<br>Removable Network Module: No<br>802.1X Network Access Control: No</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTitleContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Toolhead</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTextContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Hot End: All-Metal<br>Nozzle: Hardened Steel<br>Max Hot End Temperature: 300℃</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTitleContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Speed</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTextContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Max Speed of Toolhead: 500 mm/s<br>Max Acceleration of Toolhead: 20000 mm/s<sup>2</sup></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareDescContent\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTitleContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Sensors</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTextContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Bambu Micro Lidar: Yes<br>Chamber Monitoring Camera: 1920*1080 Included</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Bambu Micro Lidar: Yes<br>Chamber Monitoring Camera: 1920*1080 Included</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareDescContent\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTitleContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Physical Dimensions</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTextContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Dimensions: 389*389*457 mm³<br>Net Weight: 16 kg</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Dimensions: 389*389*457 mm³<br>Net Weight: 14.13 kg</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareDescContent\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\"> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span><strong> </strong></span></p>\n<p> <br></p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909209-746728232.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909209-746728232.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909202-88896264.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909209-746728232.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443909202-88896264.jpg","shortDescription":"<h4>Features:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Offers stable Ethernet and WPA2-Enterprise Wi-Fi authentication for robust network communication.</li>\n<li>Operates independently without reliance on cloud services, allowing for full functionality within local networks.</li>\n<li>Utilizes G3 pre-filter, H12 HEPA filter, and activated carbon filter to effectively filter particulates and VOCs.</li>\n<li>Regulates chamber temperature up to 60°C to reduce warping and improve layer bonding.</li>\n<li>Allows for printing with high-performance materials like PPA-CF/GF and PPS with better dimensional stability and mechanical performance.</li>\n<li>Incorporates carbon-fiber rods for a rigid structure, enabling high-speed printing with minimal vibrations.<br>Vibration and Extrusion Compensation: Automatically compensates for XY-axis vibrations and extrusion issues for smooth print quality.</li>\n<li>Detects print failures and pauses printing automatically to prevent wastage and downtime.</li>\n<li>Supports auto filament reload and multi-material printing for improved surface quality and seamless color transition</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The X1E 3D printer represents a cutting-edge solution with enhanced connectivity options, including stable Ethernet and WPA2-Enterprise Wi-Fi authentication, ensuring robust network communication even in complex environments. Operating independently from cloud services, it offers heavy-duty air filtration, active heating, and controlled chamber temperature for optimal print quality. With advanced features like AI failure detection and intelligent filament management, the X1E promises seamless, high-quality 3D printing experiences.</p>\n<p><span><strong> </strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-1ctl6fc\">\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"right  white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Enhanced And More Connection Options</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Stable Ethernet Connection, WPA2-Enterprise Authentication Wi-Fi Connection</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">The X1E offers the option to connect to your devices through its newly added Ethernet port, ensuring robust network communication in complex environments. Ethernet connectivity can also be used in crowded wireless signal environments. Additionally, the X1E provides WPA2-Enterprise Wi-Fi Authentication (EAP-PEAP/EAP-TLS/EAP-TTLS) and individual physical kill switches for both Wi-Fi and Ethernet, meeting stringent network security requirements.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-1igvxx3\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section2-bg-sm-a9a4e42cc981f.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section2-bg-sm-a9a4e42cc981f.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section2-bg-a9a4e42cc981f.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section2-bg-a9a4e42cc981f.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Off-Cloud Operation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Fully Functional With LAN Only Mode</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">The X1E can operate independently without a connection to Bambu Cloud Service, fully functional within your local network. Customers can remotely control the X1E through LAN communication without requiring an Internet connection. For additional customization details, please contact your regional reseller.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-km5jbx\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section3-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section3-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section3-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section3-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"center  white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Heavy Duty Air Filtration</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Effectively Filter Particulates And VOCs Generated by 3D Printing</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">We combined a G3 pre-filter, an H12 HEPA filter, and a high-quality coconut shell activated carbon filter to provide optimal air filtration. Enhanced filtration can effectively reduce excessive odors and particulates when printing in less ventilated environments.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-14xnr7j\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section4-bg-sm-21bf209be99c8.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section4-bg-sm-21bf209be99c8.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section4-bg-21bf209be99c8.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section4-bg-21bf209be99c8.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Active Heating And Controlled Chamber Temp</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Reduce Warping, Improve Layer Bonding</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">The X1E can actively heat and regulate the chamber temperature. Accurately controlled chamber temperature (up to 60°C or 140°F) improves print quality, especially for filaments prone to warping such as ABS and PC.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-17v1knm\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section5-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section5-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section5-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section5-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"right  white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">320 °C (608 °F) Nozzle Temp</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">More Heat For Higher Temperature Materials</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">Higher nozzle temperature make possible to print higher performance materials such as PPA-CF/GF, PPS and PPS-CF. These new materials have better dimensional stability, heat resistance and mechanical performance.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-1fzbe9n\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section6-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section6-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section6-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section6-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Robust High Speed CoreXY</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Super Fast And Rigid Structure For Continuous High Speed Printing</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">The superior carbon-fiber rods in the CoreXY motion structure enable the X1E to achieve a toolhead acceleration of 20,000 mm/s² by reducing the weight of moving parts. This faster acceleration allows the X1E to maintain its maximum travel speed of 500 mm/s for longer periods, significantly reducing overall print time.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-3din2r\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section7-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section7-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section7-bg-84c8728d6d304.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section7-bg-84c8728d6d304.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"right  white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Vibration And Extrusion Compensation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Stable &amp; Quality Prints Even At Higher Speeds</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">X1E can actively compensate for XY-axis vibrations and extrusion issues to ensure exceptionally smooth print quality. All measurements are fully automatic, eliminating the need for manual adjustments.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-irhmoc\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section8-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section8-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section8-bg-84c8728d6d304.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section8-bg-84c8728d6d304.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">AI Failure Detection</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Reduce Filament Wastage And Machine Downtime</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">The X1E's AI algorithm can detect first-layer imperfections and spaghetti failures with the assistance of Lidar and computer vision. It then automatically pauses the print to prevent catastrophic failures.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section  portal-css-zpiz4p\">\n<div class=\"imgContent portal-css-13qtnp8\">\n<div class=\"content\"><picture><source data-srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section9-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section9-bg-sm-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section9-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/section9-bg-208dd7e589a74.jpg\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"maxWidth\">\n<div class=\"right  white portal-css-l2soqq\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 class=\"title en-IN\">Intelligent Filament Management</h2>\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitle\">Supports Auto Filament Reload and Enables Multi-Material Printing with Support Material for Improved Surface Quality</h2>\n<h3 class=\"desc\">X1E can parallel connect 4 Bambu AMS systems to print with up to 16 spools of filaments, good for printing dedicated support materials for seamless surface and printing multi-color. The AMS system also supports automatic filament reload to make sure you use all the filament on your spool before switching to a new one.</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"portal-css-igw06u\">\n<div class=\"portal-css-1pi5k70\">\n<div class=\"en-IN portal-css-1owat0\">\n<div class=\"portal-css-1ful18u\"><picture><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/compare-x1e-116dd4b722f47.png\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/compare-x1e-116dd4b722f47.png\"></picture></div>\n<div class=\"portal-css-1ful18u\"><picture><img class=\"lazyloaded\" data-src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/compare-x1c-116dd4b722f47.png\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://portal.bblmw.com/x1e/section/compare-x1c-116dd4b722f47.png\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"portal-css-nprfx\">\n<div class=\"portal-css-54kfoh\">\n<div class=\"flexContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem tab\">X1E</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem tab\">X1C</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTitleContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Wi-Fi</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareTitle\">Wi-Fi</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexContent compareTextContent portal-css-18hinb6\">\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Frequency Range: 2400 MHz - 2483.5 MHz</p>\n<p><br>WPA2-Enterprise: <br><span>EAP-PEAP</span><br><span>EAP-TLS</span><br><span>EAP-TTLS</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flexItem compareText\">\n<p>Frequency Range: 2400 MHz - 2483.5 MHz</p>\n<p><br>WPA2-Enterprise: <b