lament clogging. With its durable and efficient design, the MK8 Throat Tube enhances the overall performance and reliability of 3D printers, allowing for consistent and precise filament extrusion.</span>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444059567-450429199.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444059567-450429199.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444059528-697999433.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444059575-647138642.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444059752-797311438.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444059567-450429199.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444059528-697999433.jpg","shortDescription":"<span>The MK8 Throat Tube is an essential component used in 3D printers to facilitate filament feeding and extrusion. It acts as a conduit, connecting the hot end assembly to the extruder mechanism. The throat tube is specifically designed to handle high temperatures and ensure smooth filament flow during the printing process. It features a precise inner diameter and a heat-resistant construction that minimizes friction and prevents filament clogging. With its durable and efficient design, the MK8 Throat Tube enhances the overall performance and reliability of 3D printers, allowing for consistent and precise filament extrusion.</span>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444059567-450429199.jpg"]},{"id":"f8d7ee4d-ea78-404f-b591-cf55bf97c8f6","mrp":1399,"sku":"brilliant-diamond-peo-pey-for-bambu-lab-a1-x1-x1c-p