axy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp"}],"salePrice":38999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":38999,"description":"<p><span>the </span><strong>Flashforge AD5X High-Speed Multi-Color 3D Printer</strong><span> is here to revolutionize your 3D printing experience. Whether you’re a hobbyist, business owner, designer, educator, or manufacturer, this powerful, compact, and vibrant full-color 3D printer brings efficiency and precision to your workflow.<br><img src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/imgi_139_AD5X-To_give_you_more_fil_2x_75d94329-12b1-433f-b903-c02c3e1a4771.jpeg\" alt=\"imgi 139 AD5X To give you more fil 2x 75d94329 12b1 433f b903 c02c3e1a4771\" width=\"467\" height=\"199\"><br></span></p>\n<h3>Vibrant, True Multi-Color Printing</h3>\n<p>Equipped with an advanced Smart Multi-Color Printing Module (IFS), the<span> </span><strong>Flashforge AD5X</strong><span> </span>allows seamless 4-color filament switching. No more manual spools or setup delays—the system automatically switches filaments and even resumes prints with a 99% success rate after power outages. Say goodbye to color bleeding and hello to clean, crisp transitions.</p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/imgi_141_20250605-112432.jpeg\" alt=\"imgi 141 20250605 112432\" width=\"472\" height=\"201\"><br></span></p>\n<h3>Blazing Fast Speeds with Precision</h3>\n<p>With a maximum speed of<span> </span><strong>600mm/s</strong><span> </span>and a max acceleration of<span> </span><strong>20000mm/s²</strong>, the Flashforge AD5X delivers print jobs up to<span> </span><strong>41.5% faster</strong><span> </span>than conventional printers. Thanks to the stable<span> </span><strong>CoreXY structure</strong><span> </span>and motion control, every model—from multi-colored dinosaurs to intricate prototypes—comes out sharper, smoother, and more consistent.<br></p>\n<h3>Supports Multiple Filaments</h3>\n<p>This 3D printer offers wide<span> </span><strong>filament compatibility</strong>, including PLA, PLA Pro, Silk PLA, Matte PLA, PETG, PETG Pro, ASA, and supports open third-party brands. Whether you’re prototyping, designing, or printing production parts, the AD5X handles it effortlessly.<br></p>\n<h3>What’s in the Box:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Flashforge AD5X 3D Printer </li>\n<li>Power Cable</li>\n<li>4 Random Color Filaments (Optional Bundle)</li>\n<li>Display Screen, Filament Holder, IFS Module</li>\n<li>Tools Kit, Quick Start Guide<br><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span></span><br></p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882546-518826943.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882564-865115105.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882537-140988536.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443884415-252976852.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443884620-844044991.webp"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882546-518826943.webp","shortDescription":"<p><span>the </span><strong>Flashforge AD5X High-Speed Multi-Color 3D Printer</strong><span> is here to revolutionize your 3D printing experience. Whether you’re a hobbyist, business owner, designer, educator, or manufacturer, this powerful, compact, and vibrant full-color 3D printer brings efficiency and precision to your workflow.<br><img src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/imgi_139_AD5X-To_give_you_more_fil_2x_75d94329-12b1-433f-b903-c02c3e1a4771.jpeg\" alt=\"imgi 139 AD5X To give you more fil 2x 75d94329 12b1 433f b903 c02c3e1a4771\" width=\"467\" height=\"199\"><br></span></p>\n<h3>Vibrant, True Multi-Color Printing</h3>\n<p>Equipped with an advanced Smart Multi-Color Printing Module (IFS), the<span> </span><strong>Flashforge AD5X</strong><span> </span>allows seamless 4-color filament switching. No more manual spools or setup delays—the system automatically switches filaments and even resumes prints with a 99% success rate after power outages. Say goodbye to color bleeding and hello to clean, crisp transitions.</p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/imgi_141_20250605-112432.jpeg\" alt=\"imgi 141 20250605 112432\" width=\"472\" height=\"201\"><br></span></p>\n<h3>Blazing Fast Speeds with Precision</h3>\n<p>With a maximum speed of<span> </span><strong>600mm/s</strong><span> </span>and a max acceleration of<span> </span><strong>20000mm/s²</strong>, the Flashforge AD5X delivers print jobs up to<span> </span><strong>41.5% faster</strong><span> </span>than conventional printers. Thanks to the stable<span> </span><strong>CoreXY structure</strong><span> </span>and motion control, every model—from multi-colored dinosaurs to intricate prototypes—comes out sharper, smoother, and more consistent.<br></p>\n<h3>Supports Multiple Filaments</h3>\n<p>This 3D printer offers wide<span> </span><strong>filament compatibility</strong>, including PLA, PLA Pro, Silk PLA, Matte PLA, PETG, PETG Pro, ASA, and supports open third-party brands. Whether you’re prototyping, designing, or printing production parts, the AD5X handles it effortlessly.<br></p>\n<h3>What’s in the Box:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Flashforge AD5X 3D Printer </li>\n<li>Power Cable</li>\n<li>4 Random Color Filaments (Optional Bundle)</li>\n<li>Display Screen, Filament Holder, IFS Module</li>\n<li>Tools Kit, Quick Start Guide<br><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span></span><br></p>","variantSecondaryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp"]},{"id":"851c4475-3824-464c-b0fd-72fe9076f901","mrp":1399,"sku":"pla-wood","name":"PLA Wood","slug":"pla-wood","brand":"e8665147-633e-4b6d-b462-cbfdc6114665","stock":0,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883712-832922876.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883640-133123355.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"8dae0c2e-8014-4014-becd-e1afab4e8bdd","sku":"pla-wood-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"1399","stock":0,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883712-832922876.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"1000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:07.467Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"851c4475-3824-464c-b0fd-72fe9076f901","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:07.467Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883712-832922876.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883712-832922876.jpg"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883712-832922876.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883712-832922876.jpg"}],"salePrice":1399,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883712-832922876.jpg","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"17eab5d8-a0b0-45bb-9b7f-7319e05d671c","dealerPrice":1399,"description":"<p data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"409\">PLA Wood Filament combines the ease of printing of standard PLA with the natural appearance of wood. Infused with wood fibers, it produces prints with a realistic wood-like texture, finish, and appearance, making it ideal for decorative items, prototypes, models, crafts, and home décor projects.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12jh0uk\" data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"428\">Key Features:</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"719\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1fq2szq\" data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"471\">Natural wood-like appearance and texture</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11hrkmx\" data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"508\">Easy to print with minimal warping</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1x0kq8k\" data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"549\">Environment-friendly PLA base material</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jknd8a\" data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"603\">Smooth surface finish with excellent layer adhesion</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"icsnkb\" data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"679\">Can be sanded, painted, stained, or varnished for a realistic wooden look</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1vkvccj\" data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"719\">Suitable for most FDM/FFF 3D printers</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ke4z4i\" data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"740\">Specifications:</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"925\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1k8dmz8\" data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"768\">Material: Wood-filled PLA</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gwv751\" data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"799\">Diameter: 1.75 mm (±0.03 mm)</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lkstbo\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"837\">Printing Temperature: 190°C – 220°C</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1oq5ta0\" data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"867\">Bed Temperature: 0°C – 60°C</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1w459io\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"886\">Net Weight: 1 kg</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"b6vbiv\" data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"925\">Recommended Nozzle: 0.4 mm or larger</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5ms9th\" data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"944\">Applications:</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1069\">\n<li data-section-id=\"xhz5t0\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"964\">Decorative models</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19n40g8\" data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"991\">Architectural prototypes</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"e4hhxu\" data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1010\">Home décor items</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1fstdpz\" data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1032\">Artistic sculptures</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"vkr8jn\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1050\">Toys and crafts</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"7z672e\" data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1069\">Customized gifts</li>\n</ul>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883712-832922876.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883712-832922876.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883640-133123355.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883712-832922876.jpg"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443883640-133123355.jpg","shortDescription":"<p data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"409\">PLA Wood Filament combines the ease of printing of standard PLA with the natural appearance of wood. Infused with wood fibers, it produces prints with a realistic wood-like texture, finish, and appearance, making it ideal for decorative items, prototypes, models, crafts, and home décor projects.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12jh0uk\" data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"428\">Key Features:</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"719\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1fq2szq\" data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"471\">Natural wood-like appearance and texture</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11hrkmx\" data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"508\">Easy to print with minimal warping</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1x0kq8k\" data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"549\">Environment-friendly PLA base material</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jknd8a\" data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"603\">Smooth surface finish with excellent layer adhesion</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"icsnkb\" data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"679\">Can be sanded, painted, stained, or varnished for a realistic wooden look</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1vkvccj\" data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"719\">Suitable for most FDM/FFF 3D printers</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ke4z4i\" data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"740\">Specifications:</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"925\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1k8dmz8\" data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"768\">Material: Wood-filled PLA</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gwv751\" data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"799\">Diameter: 1.75 mm (±0.03 mm)</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lkstbo\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"837\">Printing Temperature: 190°C – 220°C</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1oq5ta0\" data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"867\">Bed Temperature: 0°C – 60°C</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1w459io\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"886\">Net Weight: 1 kg</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"b6vbiv\" data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"925\">Recommended Nozzle: 0.4 mm or larger</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5ms9th\" data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"944\">Applications:</h3>\n<u