span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>• Designed for professional and industrial-grade applications<br></p>\n<div class=\"accordion-title\" data-bs-target=\"#specification\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"specification\" role=\"button\">\n<span>Specifications</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</div>\n<div id=\"specification\" class=\"collapse show\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-material\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>Print Size (L × W × H) (mm) :</b><span> </span>- 256 × 256 × 260 (Main Nozzle) / 235.5 × 256 × 256 (Dual Nozzle)</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Supports :</b><span> </span>- PLA, PETG, ABS, ASA, TPU, PA, PC, PVA, PET, Carbon/Glass Fiber Composites</li>\n<li>\n<b>Supported Nozzle Size :</b><span> </span>- 0.2mm, 0.4mm, 0.6mm, 0.8mm</li>\n<li>\n<b>Hotend Temperature (°C) :</b><span> </span>- 300</li>\n<li>\n<b>Connectivity :</b><span> </span>- Wi-Fi (Dual-Band), USB</li>\n<li>\n<b>Machine Size (mm) :</b><span> </span>- 392 × 406 × 478</li>\n<li>\n<b>Input Voltage (V) :</b><span> </span>- 100–120 / 200–240 AC, 50/60 Hz</li>\n<li>\n<b>Power Supply Requirements :</b><span> </span>- 1000 W (max @ 220V)</li>\n<li>\n<b>No. of Extruders :</b><span> </span>- 2 (Main</li>\n<li>\n<b>Extruder Type :</b><span> </span>- Dual Direct Drive (No Bowden auxiliary)</li>\n<li>\n<b>Chassis :</b><span> </span>- Plastic and Steel</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Diameter (mm) :</b><span> </span>- 1.75</li>\n<li>\n<b>Heatbed Temperature (°C) :</b><span> </span>- 120 (max)</li>\n<li>\n<b>Screen Type :</b><span> </span>- 5-inch Touchscreen</li>\n<li>\n<b>Net Weight (kg) :</b><span> </span>- 16.25</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><br><br></p>\n<h5 class=\"product-info-name fw-medium\">Bambu Lab X2D Combo 3D Printer</h5>\n<div class=\"product-info-rate\">\n<div class=\"list-star\">\n<i class=\"icon icon-star\"></i><i class=\"icon icon-star\"></i><i class=\"icon icon-star\"></i><i class=\"icon icon-star\"></i><i class=\"icon icon-star\"><span></span></i><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h6 class=\"text-main fw-small\">Product Features</h6>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>The X2D Combo pairs the next-generation X2D printer with the AMS 2 Pro, enabling seamless multi-color and multi-material printing straight out of the box. With active chamber heating, dual-nozzle<br><br></p>\n<div class=\"accordion-title\" data-bs-target=\"#feature\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"feature\" role=\"button\">\n<span>Features</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</div>\n<div id=\"feature\" class=\"collapse show\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-desc\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>• 500 mm/s print speed with up to 20,000 mm/s² acceleration for fast, high-quality output</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>• Dual-nozzle hybrid toolhead — Direct Drive main + Bowden auxiliary — for clean supports and efficient color switching</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>• AMS 2 Pro included — supports up to 16 colors per unit with active filament drying; expandable to 25 colors across multiple units</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>• PMSM servo extruder (DynaSense) — 20,000 torque samples per second for real-time clog, tangle, and air-print detection</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>• Active chamber heating up to 65°C with adaptive airflow and closed-loop fan control</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>• Vision Encoder for 50-micron motion accuracy — precision that holds over thousands of hours</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>• AI Dynamic Flow Calibration — builds a real-time, nonlinear model of the full extrusion system for consistent surface quality</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>• Dual cameras — 1080p liveview + 1200p toolhead camera — for remote monitoring and AI failure detection</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>• Three-layer filtration (G3, H12 HEPA, granulated carbon) removes VOCs and particulates</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>• 5-inch 1280×720 touchscreen with Bambu Studio, Bambu Handy app, and third-party slicer compatibility<br><br>\n<div class=\"accordion-title\" data-bs-target=\"#specification\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"specification\" role=\"button\">\n<span>Specifications</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</div>\n<div id=\"specification\" class=\"collapse show\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-material\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>Print Size (L × W × H) (mm) :</b><span> </span>- 256 × 256 × 260 (Main Nozzle) / 235.5 × 256 × 256 (Dual Nozzle)</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Supports :</b><span> </span>- PLA, PETG, ABS, ASA, TPU, PA, PC, PVA, PET, Carbon/Glass Fiber Composites</li>\n<li>\n<b>Supported Nozzle Size :</b><span> </span>- 0.2mm, 0.4mm, 0.6mm, 0.8mm</li>\n<li>\n<b>Hotend Temperature (°C) :</b><span> </span>- 300</li>\n<li>\n<b>Connectivity :</b><span> </span>- Wi-Fi (Dual-Band), USB</li>\n<li>\n<b>Machine Size (mm) :</b><span> </span>- 392 × 406 × 478</li>\n<li>\n<b>Input Voltage (V) :</b><span> </span>- 100–120 / 200–240 AC, 50/60 Hz</li>\n<li>\n<b>Power Supply Requirements :</b><span> </span>- 1000 W (max @ 220V)</li>\n<li>\n<b>No. of Extruders :</b><span> </span>- 2 (Main</li>\n<li>\n<b>Extruder Type :</b><span> </span>- Dual Direct Drive (No Bowden auxiliary)</li>\n<li>\n<b>Chassis :</b><span> </span>- Plastic and Steel</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Diameter (mm) :</b><span> </span>- 1.75</li>\n<li>\n<b>Heatbed Temperature (°C) :</b><span> </spa