/1784443882537-140988536.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443884415-252976852.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443884620-844044991.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"rating":4.5,"variants":[{"id":"48f35522-13b6-49e1-a7bb-bcc9f0c087a4","sku":"flashforge-ad5x-high-speed-multi-color-3d-printer-Default Title","name":"Default Title","price":"38999","stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"weight":"20000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:04.509Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"0737ad1a-2756-415c-a74e-f8aa02cb70ac","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:55:04.509Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"Title":"Default Title"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp"}],"salePrice":38999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp","isFeatured":false,"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":38999,"description":"<p><span>the </span><strong>Flashforge AD5X High-Speed Multi-Color 3D Printer</strong><span> is here to revolutionize your 3D printing experience. Whether you’re a hobbyist, business owner, designer, educator, or manufacturer, this powerful, compact, and vibrant full-color 3D printer brings efficiency and precision to your workflow.<br><img src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/imgi_139_AD5X-To_give_you_more_fil_2x_75d94329-12b1-433f-b903-c02c3e1a4771.jpeg\" alt=\"imgi 139 AD5X To give you more fil 2x 75d94329 12b1 433f b903 c02c3e1a4771\" width=\"467\" height=\"199\"><br></span></p>\n<h3>Vibrant, True Multi-Color Printing</h3>\n<p>Equipped with an advanced Smart Multi-Color Printing Module (IFS), the<span> </span><strong>Flashforge AD5X</strong><span> </span>allows seamless 4-color filament switching. No more manual spools or setup delays—the system automatically switches filaments and even resumes prints with a 99% success rate after power outages. Say goodbye to color bleeding and hello to clean, crisp transitions.</p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/imgi_141_20250605-112432.jpeg\" alt=\"imgi 141 20250605 112432\" width=\"472\" height=\"201\"><br></span></p>\n<h3>Blazing Fast Speeds with Precision</h3>\n<p>With a maximum speed of<span> </span><strong>600mm/s</strong><span> </span>and a max acceleration of<span> </span><strong>20000mm/s²</strong>, the Flashforge AD5X delivers print jobs up to<span> </span><strong>41.5% faster</strong><span> </span>than conventional printers. Thanks to the stable<span> </span><strong>CoreXY structure</strong><span> </span>and motion control, every model—from multi-colored dinosaurs to intricate prototypes—comes out sharper, smoother, and more consistent.<br></p>\n<h3>Supports Multiple Filaments</h3>\n<p>This 3D printer offers wide<span> </span><strong>filament compatibility</strong>, including PLA, PLA Pro, Silk PLA, Matte PLA, PETG, PETG Pro, ASA, and supports open third-party brands. Whether you’re prototyping, designing, or printing production parts, the AD5X handles it effortlessly.<br></p>\n<h3>What’s in the Box:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Flashforge AD5X 3D Printer </li>\n<li>Power Cable</li>\n<li>4 Random Color Filaments (Optional Bundle)</li>\n<li>Display Screen, Filament Holder, IFS Module</li>\n<li>Tools Kit, Quick Start Guide<br><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span></span><br></p>","isExclusive":false,"reviewCount":12,"codAvailable":true,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882546-518826943.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882564-865115105.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882537-140988536.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443884415-252976852.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443884620-844044991.webp"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882607-961758457.webp"],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882546-518826943.webp","shortDescription":"<p><span>the </span><strong>Flashforge AD5X High-Speed Multi-Color 3D Printer</strong><span> is here to revolutionize your 3D printing experience. Whether you’re a hobbyist, business owner, designer, educator, or manufacturer, this powerful, compact, and vibrant full-color 3D printer brings efficiency and precision to your workflow.<br><img src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/imgi_139_AD5X-To_give_you_more_fil_2x_75d94329-12b1-433f-b903-c02c3e1a4771.jpeg\" alt=\"imgi 139 AD5X To give you more fil 2x 75d94329 12b1 433f b903 c02c3e1a4771\" width=\"467\" height=\"199