odels.</p>\n<p>The fan is primarily used to cool the printer's hot end and prevent it from overheating during printing. It is also useful for cooling down the printer's printed parts as they are being created, which can help improve the overall quality of the finished product.</p>\n<p>The fan's compact size and low noise level make it ideal for use in smaller 3D printing environments, where space may be limited and noise can be a concern. It is typically mounted directly onto the printer's hot end or extruder, and can be controlled through the printer's software or a separate fan controller.</p>\n<p>Overall, the 24V 40mm x 10mm Cooling Fan for 3D printer is a crucial component in ensuring the proper functioning and longevity of 3D printers, and is an essential tool for any 3D printing enthusiast or professional.</p>","shortDescription":"<p>The  Cooling Fan for 3D printer is a small, compact fan designed to help regulate the temperature of 3D printers. It operates on a 24-volt power supply and measures 40mm x 40mm x 10mm in size, making it a good fit for smaller 3D printer models.</p>\n<p>The fan is primarily used to cool the printer's hot end and prevent it from overheating during printing. It is also useful for cooling down the printer's printed parts as they are being created, which can help improve the overall quality of the finished product.</p>\n<p>The fan's compact size and low noise level make it ideal for use in smaller 3D printing environments, where space may be limited and noise can be a concern. It is typically mounted directly onto the printer's hot end or extruder, and can be controlled through the printer's software or a separate fan controller.</p>\n<p>Overall, the 24V 40mm x 10mm Cooling Fan for 3D printer is a crucial component in ensuring the proper functioning and longevity of 3D printers, and is an essential tool for any 3D printing enthusiast or professional.</p>","mrp":200,"salePrice":200,"dealerPrice":200,"stock":101,"images":[{"url":"https:/