=\"Summary-item_4Npq3Q-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_4Npq3Q-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">The 4.3-inch touchscreen features a customizable tilt of 30° to 60°</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id=\"Details-item_7dnawm-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" data-accordion-id=\"item_7dnawm\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por\" id=\"Summary-item_7dnawm-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_7dnawm-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">SG15 Bearings and Dual-axis Core and Dual-Z-axis</span></summary>\n</details>\n<details id=\"Details-item_YKF4Vk-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" data-accordion-id=\"item_YKF4Vk\">\n<summary class=\"summary-accordion summary-accordion--has-hover flex justify-space-between align-center por\" id=\"Summary-item_YKF4Vk-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"CollapsibleAccordion-item_YKF4Vk-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_9K8tk3\"><span class=\"accordion__title font-heading-bold margin0\">300℃ Quick-release Hotend</span></summary>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--18231269687458__yg_download_grid_rchDq9\" class=\"shopify-section section\">\n<div class=\"section-template--18231269687458__yg_download_grid_rchDq9-padding color-background-1 gradient isolate\">\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"flex  center justify-center  w100 align-center title__gap por\">\n<h2 class=\"title__heading h3 font-heading-extra-bold margin0 lh1 title__heading--before-line\">The Anycubic Software Ecosystem</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<div class=\"item__image__text\">\n<div class=\"iamge-container\"><img src=\"https://store.anycubic.com/cdn/shop/files/image_153.png?v=1750055680\" alt=\"ANYCUBIC-STORE\" width=\"483\" height=\"272\" class=\"yg-image\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div class=\"item__content\">\n<div class=\"text-container\">\n<h3 class=\"item__title h6\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 16.38px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span>\n</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<div id=\"k-hub\"></div>","shortDescription":"<h6 class=\"text-main fw-small\">Product Features</h6>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>The Anycubic Kobra 3 3D Printer Combo is a cutting-edge, user-friendly machine that combines precision, speed, and versatility, making it ideal for both beginners and advanced users.</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>It boasts a spacious build volume for creating larger models or multiple prints simultaneously, and a direct drive extruder for accurate filament feeding, particularly useful for flexible filaments.</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>The high-precision auto-leveling system ensures a consistently level print bed, enhancing overall print quality. Additionally, the printer features a flexible magnetic build plate, making print removal easy and reducing the risk of damage.</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>Whats in the Box:</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>• Anycubic Kobra 3 Combo 3D Printer</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>• Power Supply and Cables</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>• Tool Kit</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>• User Manual</p>\n<p class=\"desc text-sm text-main text-line-clamp-2 text-align-last-end\"><span class=\"text-primary\">•</span><span> </span>• Does not include Filaments<br><br></p>\n<main id=\"MainContent\" class=\"content-for-layout focus-none\" role=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div id=\"shopify-section-template--18231269687458__image_with_text_te4wGb\" class=\"shopify-section section\">\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div class=\"image-with-text__text-item grid__item\">\n<div id=\"ImageWithText--template--18231269687458__image_with_text_te4wGb\" class=\"image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--radius image-with-text__content--top image-with-text__content--desktop-left image-with-text__content--mobile-left image-with-text__content--adapt gradient\">\n<h2 class=\"image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_te4wGb-heading_M7nQrt appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__heading h3 color-foreground image-with-text__heading--bold break done\">Smart Multi-Color Printing</h2>\n<div class=\"image-with-text__template--18231269687458__image_with_text_te4wGb-text_WPNTKD appear-animate-item-in-list image-with-text__text text-sm rte body color-foreground done\">\n<ul>\n<li>Unleash 4-Color Printing</li>\n<li>Print up to 8*① Stunning Colors.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj\" class=\"shopify-section yg-image-text\">\n<div class=\"section-template--18231269687458__yg_image_text_cMfCtj-p