=\"603\" data-end=\"687\"><strong data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"638\">High Precision &amp; Smooth Finish:</strong> Produces detailed, sharp, and accurate prints.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"791\">\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"791\"><strong data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"712\">ABS-Like Strength:</strong> Strong mechanical properties with excellent toughness and impact resistance.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"864\">\n<p data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"864\"><strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"812\">Low Shrinkage:</strong> Ensures dimensional accuracy and minimal warping.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"947\">\n<p data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"947\"><strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"883\">Fast Curing:</strong> Optimized for efficient printing with shorter exposure times.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1034\">\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1034\"><strong data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"973\">Wide Compatibility:</strong> Works seamlessly with most LCD/DLP 3D printers (405nm UV).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1060\"><strong data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1058\">Applications:</strong></h4>\n<ul data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1229\">\n<li data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1102\">\n<p data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1102\">Engineering and functional prototypes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1140\">\n<p data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1140\">Miniatures, models, and figurines</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1191\">\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1191\">Durable parts requiring strength and precision</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1229\">\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1229\">Educational and research projects</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1250\"><strong data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1248\">Caution:</strong></h4>\n<ul data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1425\">\n<li data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1277\">\n<p data-s