with high-precision positioning lead screws, it effectively minimizes layer lines and aliasing to achieve a higher level of precision</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【Speedy and Convenient】 The Photon Mono M7 reaches a maximum speed of 60mm/h thanks to intelligent release 2.0. A 200% speed increase comparing to the previous M3 Max printer. In addition, the flip-open cover design upports one-hand opening and hovering angles anywhere greater than 45°that can save time and space</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【Resin Management Features】 Dynamic temperature control resin vat will adjust the temperature of the resin material to maintain the optimal print temperature at all times for print success. And resin auto-fill feature allows for automatic filling and one-key recycling of remaining resin. Release film uses integrated design for easier replacement</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>【User-Friendly Improvements】After printing is completed, the model can be suspended above the platform with a small angle, allowing the resin to flow back into the resin vat. And a bigger resin vat with 1300ml volume for large models<br><br>\n<div role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"specification\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#specification\" class=\"accordion-title\">\n<span>Specifications</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"collapse show\" id=\"specification\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-material\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>Build volume :</b><span> </span>298mm*164mm*300mm</li>\n<li>\n<b>Printing volume :</b><span> </span>14.7L</li>\n<li>\n<b>Build platform :</b><span> </span>Laser engraving aluminum alloy</li>\n<li>\n<b>Operating screen :</b><span> </span>4.3</li>\n<li>\n<b>Printer Gross Weight :</b><span> </span>28.8 kg</li>\n<li><b>Printer Diamension 76.5x52x49 cm :</b></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br><img height=\"451\" width=\"451\" alt=\"Anycubic Photon Mono M7 Max 3D Printer\" src=\"https://www.3idea.in/assets/images/products/1740562911-5-711Wt+8auWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg.jpg\"><br><img src=\"https://www.3idea.in/assets/images/products/1740562911-4-719UDPCoP2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg.jpg\" width=\"453\" height=\"453\"><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","mrp":89999,"salePrice":89999,"dealerPrice":89999,"stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443880999-284585613.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443880910-120033344.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443880880-441143887.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443880876-758770625.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443882901-465841455.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0}],"variants":[],"isFeatured":false,"isExclusive":false,"codAvailable":false,"rating":0,"reviewCount":0,"categoryId":null,"categoryIds":[],"categories":[],"primaryCategory":null,"weightInGrams":0,"weightUnit":"g","reviews":[],"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443880999-284585613.png","secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443880910-120033344.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443880999-284585613.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443880910-120033344.jpg","ht