ge multiple printers with Wi-Fi cluster printing.</li>\n<li>Laser-Engraved Build Plate: Strong adhesion and easy model removal.</li>\n<li>PFA Release Film: Superior non-stick performance for easy print removal.</li>\n<li>Tempered Glass LCD Protector: Scratch and damage-resistant.</li>\n<li>OTA Firmware Upgrades: Always stay updated with the latest features.</li>\n<li>Multi-Language Support: Includes 12 languages.</li>\n<li>Mars Mate Air Purifier Compatibility: 95% purification efficiency for resin odor control.</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Package Includes :</h4>\n<p>1 x Saturn 4 Ultra 16k 3D Printer</p>\n<p>1 x Build Plate</p>\n<p>1 x Resin Tank</p>\n<p>1 x Funnel</p>\n<p>1 x Resin Tray</p>\n<p>1 x USB Flash Disk</p>\n<p>1 x Gloves</p>\n<p>1 x Mask</p>\n<p>1 x Backup Screws</p>\n<p>1 x Scraper</p>\n<p>1 x Adapter</p>\n<p>1 x Tool Kit</p>\n<p>1 x User Manual<br><br><br></p>\n<img src=\"https://us.elegoo.com/cdn/shop/files/saturn-4-ultra-16k-left-side.jpg?v=1765878501&amp;width=345\"><br><br><img src=\"https://us.elegoo.com/cdn/shop/files/16k-lcd-screen.jpg?v=1765878501&amp;width=345\"><br><br><img src=\"https://us.elegoo.com/cdn/shop/files/smart-tank-heating.jpg?v=1765878501&amp;width=345\"><br><br><img src=\"https://us.elegoo.com/cdn/shop/files/ai-camera.jpg?v=1765878501&amp;width=345\"><br><br><img src=\"https://us.elegoo.com/cdn/shop/files/scene.jpg?v=1765878501&amp;width=345\"><br><br> </li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>","shortDescription":"<ol>\n<li> \n<h4>Features :</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>16K Ultra-High Resolution: 15120 × 6230 resolution (14 × 19 μm XY) for fine details.</li>\n<li>Large Build Volume: 211.68 × 118.37 × 220 mm for larger prints.</li>\n<li>Smart Tank Heating: Maintains resin at 30°C for improved adhesion.</li>\n<li>AI Camera: Real-time monitoring with empty plate and warp detection.</li>\n<li>Auto Leveling: Easy setup with automatic bed leveling.</li>\n<li>Tilt Release Technology: Quick model peeling at 150 mm/h.</li>\n<li>Residue &amp; Resin Shortage Alarms: Minimizes waste and interruptions.</li>\n<li>Power Loss Recovery: Resumes printing after power outages.</li>\n<li>Wi-Fi Connectivity: Manage multiple printers with Wi-Fi cluster printing.</li>\n<li>Laser-Engraved Build Plate: Strong adhesion and easy model removal.</li>\n<li>PFA Release Film: Superior non-stick performance for easy print removal.</li>\n<li>Tempered Glass LCD Protector: Scratch and damage-resistant.</li>\n<li>OTA Firmware Upgrades: Always stay updated with the latest features.</li>\n<li>Multi-Language Support: Includes 12 languages.</li>\n<li>Mars Mate Air Purifier Compatibility: 95% purification efficiency for resin odor control.</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Package Includes :</h4>\n<p>1 x Saturn 4 Ultra 16k 3D Printer</p>\n<p>1 x Build Plate</p>\n<p>1 x Resin Tank</p>\n<p>1 x Funnel</p>\n<p>1 x Resin Tray</p>\n<p>1 x USB Flash Disk</p>\n<p>1 x Gloves</p>\n<p>1 x Mask</p>\n<p>1 x Backup Screws</p>\n<p>1 x Scraper</p>\n<p>1 x Adapter</p>\n<p>1 x Tool Kit</p>\n<p>1 x User Manual<br><br><br></p>\n<img src=\"https://us.elegoo.com/cdn/shop/files/saturn-4-ultra-16k-left-side.jpg?v=1765878501&amp;width=345\"><br><br><img src=\"https://us.elegoo.com/cdn/shop/files/16k-lcd-screen.jpg?v=1765878501&amp;width=345\"><br><br><img src=\"https://us.elegoo.com/cdn/shop/files/smart-tank-heating.jpg?v=1765878501&amp;width=345\"><br><br><img src=\"https://us.elegoo.com/cdn/shop/files/ai-camera.jpg?v=1765878501&amp;width=345\"><br><br><img src=\"https://us.elegoo.com/cdn/shop/files/scene.jpg?v=1765878501&amp;width=345\"><br><br> </li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>","mrp":61500,"salePrice":61500,"dealerPrice":61500,"stock":5,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443896336-77801338.webp","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443896345-589884147.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/aj