\"elementor-element elementor-element-0fc3017 elementor-widget elementor-widget-video\" data-id=\"0fc3017\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings='{\"video_type\":\"hosted\",\"controls\":\"yes\"}' data-widget_type=\"video.default\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ecbc771 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ecbc771\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d9e9a0f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d9e9a0f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4><span class=\"text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Electro-Magnetic Air Vent</span></h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Automated venting facilitates dehumidification during drying and ensures airtight sealing for weeks of high-quality printing.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a51a58 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"3a51a58\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42a98a2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"42a98a2\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce9c494 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ce9c494\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4>Auto-rotate Drying</h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">During the drying process, the filament spools rotate automatically to ensure more even drying </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a48d473 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"a48d473\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5052820 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5052820\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5af033e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5af033e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4><span class=\"text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">RFID Sync</span></h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">AMS 2 Pro uses RFID to auto-match drying settings for Bambu official filaments, no manual input needed.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05599d9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"05599d9\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c98ca6d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c98ca6d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Speed Up! Faster Multi-material Printing!</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf83587 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"bf83587\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c899b84 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c899b84\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f61e89e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"f61e89e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-440b61e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"440b61e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Evolved, Polished Design Detail </h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ad5dbe e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"2ad5dbe\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-08a4b8f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"08a4b8f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b7c57b3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b7c57b3\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb6d573 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bb6d573\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4><span class=\"text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Tool-Free Filament Tubes Access</span></h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Removing snapped filament from the first-gen AMS requires extracting all spools and disassembling the shell with two screws, taking 3-5 minutes. In contrast, the AMS 2 Pro offers direct, tool-free access to filament tubes from the top.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5694515 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"5694515\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a5eb20a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a5eb20a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c285c26 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c285c26\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4185de2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4185de2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4><span class=\"text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Ceramic Inlet</span></h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Ceramic filament inlets with Vickers hardness of 1200 significantly enhances durability.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf4560f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"bf4560f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c19d143 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c19d143\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Compatible With All Bambu Lab Printers</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b1fc84 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"7b1fc84\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79b87b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"79b87b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h5>The AMS 2 Pro will be compatible with all Bambu Lab products.</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47aa477 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"47aa477\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6276c12 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6276c12\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9475f6e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"9475f6e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bc9290d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bc9290d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What’s in the Box</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-946148f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"946148f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd74a24 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cd74a24\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eda2500 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"eda2500\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-caption\">Bambu AMS 2 Pro</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a8cfa4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3a8cfa4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">Desiccant</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b8e1ac elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1b8e1ac\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">PTFE Tube (185mm*2+225mm*2+900mm*1)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f642e0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0f642e0\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-362c9b3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"362c9b3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">\n<h4>Bambu Bus Cable-6Pin</h4>\n<div class=\"widget-accordion wd-product-descriptions\">\n<h2 role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"feature\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#feature\" class=\"accordion-title\">\n<span>Features</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"collapse show\" id=\"feature\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-desc\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>X1 Series and P1 Series are compatible with AMS 2 Pro.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>The AMS 2 Pro is compatible with X1/P1 series printers for multi-material printing.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>Up to 24-color/Multi-material Printing</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>AMS 2 Pro compatibility with A1/A1 mini printers will be added through an OTA update in Q3 2025.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"widget-accordion wd-product-descriptions\">\n<h2 role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"description\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#description\" class=\"accordion-title\">\n<span>Descriptions</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"collapse show\" id=\"description\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-material\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul class=\"item\">\n<li>Active Air Vent 65°C Filament Drying Air-tight Filament Storage Up to 24-color/Multi-material Printing Brushless Servo Feeding Motor RFID Filament Sync AMS 2 Pro compatibility with A1/A1 mini printers will be added through an OTA update in Q3 2025.</li>\n<li>The AMS 2 Pro is compatible with X1/P1 series printers for multi-material printing.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"widget-accordion wd-product-descriptions\">\n<h2 role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"specification\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#specification\" class=\"accordion-title\">\n<span>Specifications</span><span class=\"icon icon-arrow-down\"></span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"collapse show\" id=\"specification\">\n<div class=\"accordion-body widget-material\">\n<div class=\"item\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<b>Dimensions :</b><span> </span>372*280*226 mm³</li>\n<li>\n<b>Net Weight :</b><span> </span>2.5 kg</li>\n<li>\n<b>Housing Material :</b><span> </span>ABS/PC</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Supported :</b><span> </span>PLA, PETG, Support for PLA/PETG, ABS*, ASA*, PET*, PA*, PC*, PVA*, BVOH *, PP, POM*, HIPS*, Bambu PLA-CF*/ PAHT-CF*/ PETG-CF*, and TPU for AMS*</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Not Supported :</b><span> </span>TPE, generic TPU, PVA (damp), BVOH (damp),Bambu PET-CF/TPU 95A, and other filament that contains carbon fiber or glass fiber</li>\n<li>\n<b>Filament Diameter :</b><span> </span>1.75 mm</li>\n<li>\n<b>Spool Dimension :</b><span> </span>Width</li>\n<li>\n<b>RFID Identification :</b><span> </span>Supported</li>\n<li>\n<b>Highest Temperature :</b><span> </span>65 °C</li>\n<li>\n<b>Active Moisture Discharge :</b><span> </span>Supported</li>\n<li>\n<b>Sealed :</b><span> </span>Storage Supported</li>\n<li>\n<b>Temperature &amp; Humidity Detection :</b><span> </span>Supported. Real-time temperature and humidity can be displayed on the screen, Bambu Studio, and Bambu Handy.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Input :</b><span> </span>24 V 4 A</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br></figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","shortDescription":"<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-433b737 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"433b737\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2536d73 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2536d73\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Bambu Lab AMS 2 Pro</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec490fc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"ec490fc\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f2a0d3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4f2a0d3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Dry Filament Quickly and Intelligently</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-58fcdcc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"58fcdcc\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f834c8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3f834c8\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0fc3017 elementor-widget elementor-widget-video\" data-id=\"0fc3017\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings='{\"video_type\":\"hosted\",\"controls\":\"yes\"}' data-widget_type=\"video.default\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ecbc771 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ecbc771\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d9e9a0f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d9e9a0f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4><span class=\"text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Electro-Magnetic Air Vent</span></h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Automated venting facilitates dehumidification during drying and ensures airtight sealing for weeks of high-quality printing.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a51a58 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"3a51a58\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42a98a2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"42a98a2\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce9c494 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ce9c494\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4>Auto-rotate Drying</h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">During the drying process, the filament spools rotate automatically to ensure more even drying </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a48d473 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"a48d473\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5052820 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5052820\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5af033e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5af033e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4><span class=\"text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">RFID Sync</span></h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">AMS 2 Pro uses RFID to auto-match drying settings for Bambu official filaments, no manual input needed.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05599d9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"05599d9\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c98ca6d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c98ca6d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Speed Up! Faster Multi-material Printing!</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf83587 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"bf83587\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c899b84 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c899b84\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f61e89e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"f61e89e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-440b61e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"440b61e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Evolved, Polished Design Detail </h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ad5dbe e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"2ad5dbe\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-08a4b8f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"08a4b8f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b7c57b3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b7c57b3\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb6d573 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bb6d573\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<h4><span class=\"text-base xl:text-lg 2xl:text-2xl mb-2 xl:mb-3 2xl:mb-4 text-[#00CD0A] leading-[1.2] xl:leading-[1.2] 2xl:leading-[1.2] !text-[20px] xl:!text-[30px] 2xl:!text-[30px] font-bold max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Tool-Free Filament Tubes Access</span></h4>\n<p class=\"text-[#F5F5F5] mb-4 xl:mb-6 2xl:mb-8 !leading-[1.2] font-medium text-[14px] xl:text-[24px] 2xl:text-[24px] max-w-[452px] md:max-w-[unset]\">Removing snapped filament from the first-gen AMS requires extracting all spools and disassembling the shell with two screws, taking 3-5 minutes. In contrast, the AMS 2 Pro offers direct, tool-free access to filament tubes from the top.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5694515 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent e-lazyloaded\" data-id=\"5694515\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a5eb20a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a5eb20a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c285c26 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c285c26\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4185de2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4185de2\" data-el