liability, and creative capability for both hobby and professional users.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"566\">\n<h2 data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"589\"><strong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"589\">✨ Key Features</strong></h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"635\"><strong data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"635\">Multi-Color, Multi-Material Printing</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"832\">\n<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"690\">\n<p data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"690\">Supports <strong data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"674\">up to 4 filament inputs</strong> in one print.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"751\">\n<p data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"751\">Enables smooth transitions between colors and materials.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"832\">\n<p data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"832\">Ideal for models with gradients, patterns, or multi-material functional parts.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"871\"><strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"871\">Active Filament Drying System</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"1096\">\n<li data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"944\">\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"944\">Built-in heating maintains optimal filament dryness during printing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1033\">\n<p data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"1033\">Prevents moisture-related issues such as stringing, bubbles, and weak layer bonding.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1096\">\n<p data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1096\">Ensures consistent print quality even in humid environments.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1131\"><strong data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1131\">Smart Filament Management</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1333\">\n<li data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1193\">\n<p data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1193\">Automatic filament <strong data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1190\">loading, unloading, and switching</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1249\">\n<p data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1249\">Intelligent routing minimizes tangles and misfeeds.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1333\">\n<p data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1333\">Filament runout detection prevents failed prints by pausing and prompting reload.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1373\"><strong data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1373\">High Precision Color Switching</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1540\">\n<li data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1418\">\n<p data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1418\">Fast, clean switching between filaments.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1475\">\n<p data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1475\">Reduces purging waste and improves print efficiency.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1540\">\n<p data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1540\">Ensures accurate color placement and crisp visual transitions.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1584\"><strong data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1584\">Seamless Integration with Kobra S1</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1799\">\n<li data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1648\">\n<p data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1648\">Plug-and-play installation with optimized firmware support.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1734\">\n<p data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1734\">Works flawlessly with the Kobra S1 motion system for stable, high-speed printing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1799\">\n<p data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1799\">Compact, efficient design that fits easily into any workspace.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1804\">\n<h2 data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1838\"><strong data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1838\">🧵 Material Compatibility</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1898\">The ACE Pro supports a wide variety of materials such as:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"2059\">\n<li data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\