a-start=\"854\" data-end=\"876\">Large Build Volume</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"993\">\n<li data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"927\">\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"927\">Spacious <strong data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"910\">250 × 250 × 260 mm</strong> printing area.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"993\">\n<p data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"993\">Ideal for large models, batch production, or multi-part prints.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1028\"><strong data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1028\">Intelligent Auto-Leveling</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1163\">\n<li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1091\">\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1091\">Equipped with <strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1081\">LeviQ 3.0 automatic bed leveling</strong> system.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1163\">\n<p data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1163\">Delivers accurate first layers and reduces manual calibration effort.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1196\"><strong data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1196\">User-Friendly Operation</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1302\">\n<li data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1245\">\n<p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1245\">Features a <strong data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1242\">modern touchscreen interface</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1302\">\n<p data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1302\">Simple navigation for beginners and experienced users.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1330\"><strong data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1330\">Smart Connectivity</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1421\">\n<li data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1421\">\n<p data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1421\">Supports <strong data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1393\">Wi-Fi printing, mobile monitoring, USB printing</strong>, and cloud-based workflows.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1426\">\n<h2 data-