 Cartridge and NTC Thermistor Set (Compatible with Kobra 2 Series)</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"646\">This heater cartridge and NTC thermistor set is a high-quality replacement component designed for stable and accurate temperature control in 3D printer hotend systems. Built for durability and precision, it ensures efficient heating performance and reliable temperature sensing, making it ideal for consistent extrusion and high-quality prints.</p>\n<p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"667\"><strong data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"665\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"1292\">\n<li data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"775\">\n<p data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"775\"><strong data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"688\">Compatibility:</strong> Designed for Kobra 2 Series 3D printers (including Neo, Pro, Plus, and Max variants)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"796\">\n<p data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"796\"><strong data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"790\">Voltage:</strong> 24V</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"815\">\n<p data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"815\"><strong data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"809\">Power:</strong> 60W</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"914\">\n<p data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"914\"><strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"848\">Heater Cartridge Material:</strong> Stainless steel element with fiberglass and silicone insulation</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"1007\">\n<p data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1007\"><strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"937\">Thermistor Type:</strong> 100K NTC (3950) precision sensor for accurate temperature detection</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1092\">\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1092\"><strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1029\">Connector Type:</strong> Pre-crimped plug connector for quick and secure installation</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1164\">\n<p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1164\"><strong data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1116\">Cable Insulation:</strong> High-temperature PTFE and fiberglass sleeving</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1203\">\n<p data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1203\"><strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1189\">Temperature Range:</strong> Up to 300°C</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1292\">\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1292\"><strong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1219\">Function:</strong> Provides rapid and uniform heating along with precise thermal feedback</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1311\"><strong data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1309\">Advantages:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1611\">\n<li data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1367\">\n<p data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1367\">Consistent temperature control for stable extrusion</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1420\">\n<p data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1420\">Fast heat-up time with efficient energy transfer</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1482\">\n<p data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1482\">Durable, long-lasting materials for extended service life</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1547\">\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1547\">Easy plug-and-play replacement for the Kobra 2 hotend system</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1611\">\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1611\">Ideal for maintenance, part replacement, or hotend upgrades</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","shortDescription":"<h3 data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"298\"><strong data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"298\">Heater Cartridge and NTC Thermistor Set (Compatible with Kobra 2 Series)</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"646\">This heater cartridge and NTC thermistor set is a high-quality replacement component designed for stable and accurate temperature control in 3D printer hotend systems. Built for durability and precision, it ensures efficient heating performance and reliable temperature sensing, making it ideal for consistent extrusion and high-quality prints.</p>\n<p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"667\"><strong data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"665\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"1292\">\n<li data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"775\">\n<p data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"775\"><strong data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"688\">Compatibility:</strong> Designed for Kobra 2 Series 3D printers (including Neo, Pro, Plus, and Max variants)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"796\">\n<p data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"796\"><strong data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"790\">Voltage:</strong> 24V</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"815\">\n<p data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"815\"><strong data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"809\">Power:</strong> 60W</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"914\">\n<p data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"914\"><strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"848\">Heater Cartridge Material:</strong> Stainless steel element with fiberglass and silicone insulation</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"1007\">\n<p data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"1007\"><strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"937\">Thermistor Type:</strong> 100K NTC (3950) precision sensor for accurate temperature detection</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1092\">\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1092\"><strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1029\">Connector Type:</strong> Pre-crimped plug connector for quick and secure installation</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1164\">\n<p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1164\"><strong data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1116\">Cable Insulation:</strong> High-temperature PTFE and fiberglass sleeving</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1203\">\n<p data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1203\"><strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1189\">Temperature Range:</strong> Up to 300°C</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1292\">\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1292\"><strong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1219\">Function:</strong> Provides rapid and uniform heating along with precise thermal feedback</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1311\"><strong data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1309\">Advantages:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1611\">\n<li data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1367\">\n<p data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1367\">Consistent temperature control for stable extrusion</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1420\">\n<p data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1420\">Fast heat-up time with efficient energy transfer</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1482\">\n<p data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1482\">Durable, long-lasting materials for extended service life</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1547\">\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1547\">Easy plug-and-play replacement for the Kobra 2 hotend system</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1611\">\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1611\">Ideal for maintenance, part replacement, or hotend upgrades</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","mrp":300,"salePrice":300,"dealerPrice":300,"stock":1,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443932483-205180634.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443932440-742333080.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0}],"variants":[{"id":"594754a8-8237-48c1-aa8a-f1c6312e532b","productId":"360e042f-0b16-42fc-9b9a-116761c6c27f","sku":"heater-cartridge-and-ntc-thermsitor-for-kobra-2-series-Heater","price":"300","salePrice":null,"stock":1,"weight":"100","isDefault":false,"isActive":true,"variantSlug":null,"name":"Heater","variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443932483-205180634.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0}],"optionValues":{"Type":"Heater"},"deletedAt":null,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:57:04.568Z","up