k to maintain stable temperatures and protect against filament burn</p>\n<p data-end=\"1047\" data-start=\"913\"><strong data-end=\"935\" data-start=\"913\">Full Assembly Kit:</strong> Includes all essential parts such as heat sink, heat break, nozzle, PTFE tube, thermistor, and heater cartridge<strong data-end=\"1076\" data-start=\"1050\">Pre-wired Connections:</strong> Easy plug-and-play design with pre-soldered cables and connectors (260°C rated thermistor/heater)</p>\n<p data-end=\"1264\" data-start=\"1177\"><strong data-end=\"1188\" data-start=\"1177\">Nozzle:</strong> Standard brass or hardened steel nozzle included (depending on kit variant)</p>\n<hr data-end=\"1269\" data-start=\"1266\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1330\" data-start=\"1271\">📦 <strong data-end=\"1330\" data-start=\"1278\">Package Includes (as shown in Accessories List):</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"1355\" data-start=\"1334\">1× Aluminum Heat Sink</p>\n<p data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1358\">1× Heater Block (aluminum)</p>\n<p data-end=\"1409\" data-start=\"1387\">1× Silicone Sock Cover</p>\n<p data-end=\"1427\" data-start=\"1412\">1× Brass Nozzle</p>\n<p data-end=\"1442\" data-start=\"1430\">1× PTFE Tube</p>\n<p data-end=\"1458\" data-start=\"1445\">1× Heat Break</p>\n<p data-end=\"1494\" data-start=\"1461\">1× Heater Cartridge (with wiring)</p>\n<p data-end=\"1524\" data-start=\"1497\">1× Thermistor (with wiring)</p>\n<p data-end=\"1558\" data-start=\"1527\">Screws and necessary connectors</p>\n<hr data-end=\"1563\" data-start=\"1560\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1588\" data-start=\"1565\">🧵 <strong data-end=\"1588\" data-start=\"1572\">Application:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"1811\" data-start=\"1590\">Ideal for printing with <strong data-end=\"1637\" data-start=\"1614\">PLA, ABS, PETG, TPU</strong>, and other common filaments. If upgraded with an all-metal throat and high-temp thermistor, it can handle <strong data-end=\"1772\" data-start=\"1744\">temperatures up to 260°C</strong>, suitable for more advanc