nergy intensity of 30,000 µW/cm² within a close range (1–3 cm). This design dramatically improves detail curing on complex areas such as figure skirts and top-facing surfaces, ensuring fine details are preserved and fully cured.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2456\">Uniform 360-Degree Curing Performance</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2681\">The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2492\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>utilizes a newly optimized LED lens array that increases overall curing uniformity by 20%. This results in even exposure and consistent quality across all model surfaces, from base to top.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2712\">Quiet, Sealed Operation</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2922\">A fully enclosed design combined with refined software control reduces operating noise significantly. This makes the unit suitable for home, office, and studio environments where quiet operation is a priority.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2957\">Simple, One-Touch Operation</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"3224\">Users can switch between<span> </span><strong data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3012\">cleaning and curing modes</strong><span> </span>with a single button. Time settings are adjustable from 1 to 30 minutes, allowing full customization based on model size and complexity. The gooseneck UV mode can also be toggled independently for added control.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3277\">Why Choose the Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus?</h2>\n<p data-start=\"3279\" data-end=\"3600\">The<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3314\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>is a feature-rich, compact, and powerful solution for those seeking professional-grade<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3402\" data-end=\"3438\">resin 3D printer post-processing</strong>. It excels in both<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3458\" data-end=\"3484\">cleaning and UV curing</strong>, offering enhanced efficiency, improved safety, and superior results for hobbyists, engineers, and designers alike.</p>\n<p data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3918\">Its increased capacity, IPA-saving features, and powerful UV system make it one of the most advanced<span> </span><strong data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3740\">3D printer wash and cure stations</strong><span> </span>on the market today. Whether you’re printing detailed miniatures, prototypes, or production parts, this system ensures your prints are cleaned and cured with precision and care.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4451\">Enhance your<span> </span><strong data-start=\"4233\" data-end=\"4273\">3D printing post-processing workflow</strong>, the<span> </span><strong data-start=\"4279\" data-end=\"4310\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong><span> </span>delivers professional performance in a compact, efficient package. It is now available from leading 3D printing suppliers and online stores.</p>\n<p data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4619\">Invest in quality, reliability, and convenience with the<span> </span><strong data-start=\"4510\" data-end=\"4541\">Anycubic Wash &amp; Cure 3 Plus</strong>—the ultimate<span> </span><strong data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4597\">resin 3D printer wash and cure station</strong><span> </span>for serious creators.</p>","mrp":19999,"salePrice":19999,"dealerPrice":19999,"stock":4,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983340-5978298.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443983411-914329068.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0}],"variants":[],"isFeatured":false,"isExclusive":false,"codAvailable":true,"rating":0,"reviewCount":0,"categoryId":null,"categoryIds":[],"categories":[],"primaryCategory":null,"weightInGrams":0,"weightUnit":"g","reviews":[],"primaryImage