m\">Volcano nozzles are super fast printing nozzles for use with the Volcano block and packs to print large layer heights and at extremely high flow rates. V6 Brass Volcano Nozzle has extra long heated melt zones for ultimate filament melt speeds<br><br></span>\n<h4><strong>Specifications and Features:</strong></h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Input: 1.75mm</li>\n<li>output: 0.40mm</li>\n<li>Weight: 3g</li>\n<li>Material: Brass Alloy</li>\n<li>Compatible with V6</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ul>","shortDescription":"<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">V6 Brass Volcano Nozzlesare High-performance brass nozzles for your Volcano HotEnd</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">. From super-fine to super-fat layering, you'll be making stronger, faster and bigger prints in no time with the Volcano HotEnd PowerUp! These nozzles are immediately compatible with the Lulzbot Moarstruder, but many RepRap 3D printers including the Prusa i3 can be upgraded with a Volcano</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\">\n<span class=\"a-list-item\">Volcano nozzles are super fast printing nozzles for use with the Volcano block and packs to print large layer heights and at extremely high flow rates. V6 Brass Volcano Nozzle has extra long heated melt zones for ultimate filament melt speeds<br><br></span>\n<h4><strong>Specifications and Features:</strong></h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Input: 1.75mm</li>\n<li>output: 0.40mm</li>\n<li>Weight: 3g</li>\n<li>Material: Brass Alloy</li>\n<li>Compatible with V6</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ul>","mrp":45,"salePrice":45,"dealerPrice":45,"stock":262,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444003391-215987933.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444003404-153463849.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},