ment=\"1\">Thermistors with cable for 3D Printer</h1>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span>Thermistors with cable for 3D printers are temperature-sensitive resistors that are used to measure the temperature of the hot end and heated bed in a 3D printer. They are made of semiconductor materials that have a high negative temperature coefficient, meaning their resistance decreases as the temperature increases. The thermistor is usually encased in a small glass or plastic bead and connected to a cable that runs to the printer's control board, which uses the temperature readings to control the heating elements. These thermistors are an essential component of 3D printers, as accurate temperature control is crucial to producing high-quality prints.</span></p>","shortDescription":"<h1 class=\"product-name\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Thermistors with cable for 3D Printer</h1>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span>Thermistors with cable for 3D printers are temperature-sensitive resistors that are used to measure the temperature of the hot end and heated bed in a 3D printer. They are made of semiconductor materials that have a high negative temperature coefficient, meaning their resistance decreases as the temperature increases. The thermistor is usually encased in a small glass or plastic bead and connected to a cable that runs to the printer's control board, which uses the temperature readings to control the heating elements. These thermistors are an essential component of 3D printers, as accurate temperature control is crucial to producing high-quality prints.</span></p>","mrp":99,"salePrice":99,"dealerPrice":99,"stock":188,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444045635-777630806.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444045735-829356922.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://sto