TPU, and other common filaments. Produces a beautiful matte finish on the bottom of your prints.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1177\" data-start=\"1022\"><strong data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"1022\">Flexible Spring Steel Core</strong>: Made from high-strength spring steel, it resists warping and can be flexed to easily release finished prints without tools.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1316\" data-start=\"1181\"><strong data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1181\">Magnetic Base Compatibility</strong>: Works with the magnetic base system of Bambu Lab printers for quick swapping and reliable positioning.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1503\" data-start=\"1320\"><strong data-end=\"1346\" data-start=\"1320\">PEO Coating Technology</strong>: The Plasma Electrolytic Oxidation (PEO) treatment enhances surface durability and wear resistance while providing reliable adhesion without glue or sprays.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1625\" data-start=\"1507\"><strong data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1507\">High-Temperature Resistance</strong>: Maintains performance even at extended high temperatures during long printing cycles.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"1630\" data-start=\"1627\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1661\" data-start=\"1632\">🔹 <strong data-end=\"1661\" data-start=\"1639\">Compatible Models:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"1692\" data-start=\"1664\"><strong data-end=\"1690\" data-start=\"1664\">Bambu Lab A1 / A1 Mini</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1695\"><strong data-end=\"1729\" data-start=\"1695\">Bambu Lab X1 / X1 Carbon (X1C)</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"1762\" data-start=\"1734\"><strong data-end=\"1762\" data-start=\"1734\">Bambu Lab P1 / P1P / P1S</strong></p>\n<hr data-end=\"1767\" data-start=\"1764\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1802\" data-start=\"1769\">💡 <strong data-end=\"1802\" data-start=\"1776\">Why Choose This Plate?</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"2033\" data-start=\"1803\">This is the ideal all-in-one solution for makers who switch between materials frequently. Enjoy strong bed adhesion, improved surface quality, and seamless print removal—whether you’re printing technical parts or artistic designs.</p>","shortDescription":"<h3 data-end=\"233\" data-start=\"137\"><strong data-end=\"233\" data-start=\"141\">Brilliant Diamond PEO + Textured PEI Build Plate for Bambu Lab A1 / X1 / X1C / P1P / P1S</strong></h3>\n<p data-end=\"305\" data-start=\"235\"><strong data-end=\"305\" data-start=\"235\">Dual-sided Excellence | Premium Build Surface | Flexible &amp; Durable</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"627\" data-start=\"307\">Upgrade your Bambu Lab 3D printer with this premium dual-sided build plate, featuring an advanced <strong data-end=\"438\" data-start=\"405\">Brilliant Diamond PEO surface</strong> on one side and a <strong data-end=\"481\" data-start=\"457\">Textured PEI coating</strong> on the other. Engineered for high performance and ease of use, this spring steel plate ensures perfect first layers and effortless print removal.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"632\" data-start=\"629\">\n<h3 data-end=\"658\" data-start=\"634\">🔹 <strong data-end=\"658\" data-start=\"641\">Key Features:</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"662\"><strong data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"662\">Double-Sided Functionality:</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"698\"><strong data-end=\"728\" data-start=\"698\">Brilliant Diamond PEO Side</strong>: Provides superior adhesion for high-temperature materials like ABS, PC, Nylon, and more. Ideal for strong first layers and reduced warping.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1018\" data-start=\"874\"><strong data-end=\"895\" data-start=\"874\">Textured PEI Side</strong>: Excellent for PLA, PETG, TPU, and other common filaments. Produces a beautiful matte finish on the bottom of your prints.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1177\" data-start=\"1022\"><strong data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"1022\">Flexible Spring Steel Core</strong>: Made from high-strength spring steel, it resists warping and can be flexed to easily release finished prints without tools.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1316\" data-start=