tart=\"620\" data-end=\"750\">\n<p data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"750\">🌀 <strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"643\">Easy to Print:</strong> Excellent layer adhesion, minimal warping, and smooth extrusion – ideal for beginners and professionals.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"847\">\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"847\">♻️ <strong data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"777\">Eco-Friendly PLA:</strong> Made from biodegradable, plant-based materials, safe and non-toxic.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"963\">\n<p data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"963\">🎨 <strong data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"870\">Vivid Colors:</strong> Available in multiple glow shades (green, blue, etc.) with a bright luminous finish.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1053\">\n<p data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1053\">🔧 <strong data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"987\">Compatibility:</strong> Works with most FDM/FFF 3D printers using 1.75mm filament size.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1088\"><strong data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1086\">Recommended Print Settings:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1224\">\n<li data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1126\">\n<p data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1126\">Nozzle Temperature: <strong data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1124\">190–220°C</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1192\">\n<p data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1192\">Bed Temperature: <strong data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1157\">50–60°C</strong> (or unheated bed with tape/glue)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1224\">\n<p data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1224\">Print Speed: <strong data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1222\">40–60 mm/s</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1394\"><strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1243\">Applications:</strong><br data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1246\">✔ Halloween decorations &amp; cosplay props<br data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1288\">✔ Glow-in-the-dark toys &amp; figurines<br data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1326\">✔ Safety markers &amp; signage<br data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1355\">✔ Unique artistic &amp; decorative print</p>","shortDescription":"<h3 data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"161\"><strong data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"161\">PLA Glow-in-the-Dark Filament – 1.75mm</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"504\">Bring your 3D prints to life with a magical glowing effect! This premium-quality PLA (Polylactic Acid) filament is infused with luminous materials that absorb light and emit a vibrant glow in the dark. Perfect for creating eye-catching models, cosplay props, toys, and decorative pieces, it adds a unique touch to your 3D printing projects.</p>\n<p data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"525\"><strong data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"523\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"1053\">\n<li data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"619\">\n<p data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"619\">🌟 <strong data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"547\">Glow Effect:</strong> Charges under sunlight or UV light and glows brilliantly in the dark.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"750\">\n<p data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"750\">🌀 <strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"643\">Easy to Print:</strong> Excellent layer adhesion, minimal warping, and smooth extrusion – ideal for beginners and professionals.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"847\">\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"847\">♻️ <strong data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"777\">Eco-Friendly PLA:</strong> Made from biodegradable, plant-based materials, safe and non-toxic.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"963\">\n<p data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"963\">🎨 <strong data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"870\">Vivid Colors:</strong> Available in multiple glow shades (green, blue, etc.) with a bright luminous finish.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1053\">\n<p data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1053\">🔧 <strong data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"987\">Compatibility:</strong> Works with most FDM/FFF 3D printers using 1.75mm filament size.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1088\"><strong data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1086\">Recommended Print Settings:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1224\">\n<li data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1126\">\n<p data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1126\">Nozzle Temperature: <strong data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1124\">190–220°C</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1192\">\n<p data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1192\">Bed Temperature: <strong data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1157\">50–60°C</strong> (or unheated bed with tape/glue)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1224\">\n<p data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1224\">Print Speed: <strong data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1222\">40–60 mm/s</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1394\"><strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1243\">Applications:</strong><br data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1246\">✔ Halloween decorations &amp; cosplay props<br data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1288\">✔ Glow-in-the-dark toys &amp; figurines<br data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1326\">✔ Safety markers &amp; signage<br data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1355\">✔ Unique artistic &amp; decorative print</p>","mrp":899,"salePrice":899,"dealerPrice":899,"stock":29,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443934293-820406408.webp","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443934283-743429458.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0}],"variants":[{"id":"d0b24f20-d89b-4696-8e9d-05ebf484626f","productId":"44eef423-2598-47ca-9371-6c94dec0e9e5","sku":"pla-glow-in-dark-colour-filament-clear-blue","price":"899","salePrice":null,"stock":16,"weight":"1000","isDefault":false,"isActive":true,"variantSlug":null,"name":"clear-blue","variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapi