-end=\"255\">colours in a single spool</strong>. Each print can reveal unique gradients, shifts, or mixed tones depending on the angle and design—perfect for artistic projects, decorative models, and eye-catching prototypes.(No Colour Choice)</p>\n<ul data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"1081\">\n<li data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"565\">\n<p data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"565\">🎨 <strong>Multi</strong><strong data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"468\"> Colours in One Spool</strong> – Each roll comes with a random colour combination (not fixed), ensuring every print is unique. (No Colour Choice)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"688\">\n<p data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"688\">⚡ <strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"587\">Easy to Print</strong> – Works smoothly with most FDM 3D printers, offering excellent layer adhesion and minimal warping.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"805\">\n<p data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"805\">🌍 <strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"714\">Eco-Friendly PLA</strong> – Made from high-quality biodegradable PLA for reliable, safe, and sustainable printing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"899\">\n<p data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"899\">📏 <strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"829\">Standard Specs</strong> – 1.75mm diameter, high precision ±0.02mm for consistent extrusion.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1081\">\n<p data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"1081\">⚖️ <strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"920\">Weight Note</strong> – Net weight of each spool is <strong data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"958\">1kg</strong>. For<strong> Multi</strong>-colour spools, the <strong data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1034\">distribution of the colours is not fixed</strong>, but the <strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1078\">total weight always equals 1kg</strong>.<br><br><strong>NOTE - <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Colour can be 2 or max 3 colour in one spool. There is no choice of colours, any mix spools are sent on availability. These are spool made in between colour changing in Filament Line. (No Colour Choice)</span></strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","shortDescription":"<p data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"434\">Experience vibrant and dynamic 3D prints with our <strong>Mix-</strong><strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"203\">Colour PLA Filament</strong>, featuring <strong>Mix </strong><strong data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"255\">colours in a single spool</strong>. Each print can reveal unique gradients, shifts, or mixed tones depending on the angle and design—perfect for artistic projects, decorative models, and eye-catching prototypes.(No Colour Choice)</p>\n<ul data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"1081\">\n<li data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"565\">\n<p data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"565\">🎨 <strong>Multi</strong><strong data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"468\"> Colours in One Spool</strong> – Each roll comes with a random colour combination (not fixed), ensuring every print is unique. (No Colour Choice)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"688\">\n<p data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"688\">⚡ <strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"587\">Easy to Print</strong> – Works smoothly with most FDM 3D printers, offering excellent layer adhesion and minimal warping.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"805\">\n<p data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"805\">🌍 <strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"714\">Eco-Friendly PLA</strong> – Made from high-quality biodegradable PLA for reliable, safe, and sustainable printing.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"899\">\n<p data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"899\">📏 <strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"829\">Standard Specs</strong> – 1.75mm diameter, high precision ±0.02mm for consistent extrusion.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1081\">\n<p data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"1081\">⚖️ <strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"920\">Weight Note</strong> – Net weight of each spool is <strong data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"958\">1kg</strong>. For<strong> Multi</strong>-colour spools, the <strong data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1034\">distribution of the colours is not fixed</strong>, but the <strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1078\">total weight always equals 1kg</strong>.<br><br><strong>NOTE - <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Colour can be 2 or max 3 colour in one spool. There is no choice of colours, any mix spools are sent on availability. These are spool made in between colour changing in Filament Line. (No Colour Choice)</span></strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","mrp":515,"salePrice":515,"dealerPrice":515,"stock":16,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936854-637306588.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936304-188799734.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936608-574900140.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0}],"variants":[{"id":"62a06f05-ac9d-43db-aedf-274f351471bd","productId":"d2ccadd8-1be2-4127-b83b-c4a75056095d","sku":"pla-mix-colour-filament-1kg","price":"515","salePrice":null,"stock":16,"weight":"1000","isDefault":false,"isActive":true,"variantSlug":null,"name":"1kg","variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936854-637306588.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0}],"optionValues":{"Size":"1kg"},"deletedAt":null,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:57:11.688Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-01T06:59:20.977Z","images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936854-637306588.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0}],"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443936854-637306588.png","secondaryImage":"https://storage.g