Mini</p>\n<p data-end=\"1852\" data-start=\"1786\"><strong data-end=\"1799\" data-start=\"1786\">Material:</strong> PEI-coated spring steel with PEO-treated PET surface</p>\n<p data-end=\"1912\" data-start=\"1855\"><strong data-end=\"1864\" data-start=\"1855\">Size:</strong> Precise fit for A1 Mini (180mm x 180mm approx.)</p>\n<p data-end=\"1985\" data-start=\"1915\"><strong data-end=\"1925\" data-start=\"1915\">Sides:</strong> Dual-sided (Carbon Fiber Textured + Geometric PET Textured)</p>\n<p data-end=\"2055\" data-start=\"1988\"><strong data-end=\"2006\" data-start=\"1988\">Magnetic Base:</strong> Not included (requires compatible magnetic base)</p>\n<hr data-end=\"2060\" data-start=\"2057\">\n<h3 data-end=\"2101\" data-start=\"2062\">💡 <strong data-end=\"2101\" data-start=\"2069\">Why Choose This Build Plate?</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"2348\" data-start=\"2102\">Get the best of both worlds with one build sheet. Whether you're printing delicate PLA models or high-temp ABS parts, this plate adapts to your needs—no more switching between plates. Durable, easy to clean, and made for pros and hobbyists alike.</p>","mrp":1399,"salePrice":1399,"dealerPrice":1399,"stock":10,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443954349-295390176.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443954427-959774960.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443954361-340831989.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0}],"variants":[{"id":"eedef909-560f-4e8b-b7d3-8fe4b37c2608","productId":"8ea47f3c-4981-4b84-8c51-69595538da78","sku":"peo-pet-build-plate-for-bambu-lab-a1-mini-3d-printer-Default Title","price":"1399","salePrice":null,"stock":10,"weight":"200","isDefault":false,"isActive":true,"variantSlug":nul