ild Volume<br><br>\n</li>\n</ol>","shortDescription":"<p><span>The Bambu Lab A1 3D Printer embodies a fusion of cutting-edge technology and user-centric design, ideal for both professionals and enthusiasts seeking high-performance desktop 3D printing capabilities. Its compact yet robust frame ensures stability during intricate print jobs, complemented by precise stepper motors that deliver exceptional detail and accuracy. Equipped with a user-friendly interface—either through a touchscreen or intuitive control panel—the A1 simplifies setup, calibration, and operation. It boasts a generous build volume, accommodating a variety of filament materials including PLA, ABS, and PETG, thereby catering to diverse project needs</span></p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Full-auto Calibration</li>\n<li>Multi-Color Printing (Combo Version)</li>\n<li>Active Flow Rate Compensation</li>\n<li>1-Clip Quick Swap Nozzle</li>\n<li>Chamber Monitoring Camera Low Frame Rate Camera (Up to 1080P) Timelapse Supported</li>\n<li>Active Motor Noise Cancelling</li>\n<li>256*256*256 mm³ Build Volume<br><br>\n</li>\n</ol>","mrp":31999,"salePrice":31999,"dealerPrice":31999,"stock":3,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443989633-896152937.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443989613-301649522.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443989603-98231506.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0}],"variants":[{"id":"d136278a-9ca7-40ba-b541-000869a7dcf0","productId":"5819a9d4-51e8-4838-b5b4-287e14b68234","sku":"bambu-lab-a1-Default Title","price":"31999","salePrice":null,"stock":3,"weight":"20000","isDefault":false,"isActive":true,"variantSlug":null,"name":"Default Title","variantImages":[{"url":