s plug-and-play experience with automatic leveling and self-check functions, making it an excellent option for users of any experience level, especially those looking for a<span> </span><strong>3D printer for home use</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Additional Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Intuitive 5-Inch Touch Screen</strong>:<span> </span><strong>Elegoo Mars 5 Ultra 9K LCD 3D Printer</strong><span> </span>navigate effortlessly with the 5-inch capacitive touch screen, offering a simple and user-friendly interface for seamless control over your 3D printing process.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Laser-Engraved Build Plate</strong>: The laser-engraved build plate ensures superior adhesion during printing, preventing detachment and warping while making model removal smooth and damage-free, making it a great option for an<span> </span><strong>3D printer</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tempered Glass LCD Protector</strong>: A 9H tempered glass protector shields the LCD screen from scratches and damage, providing a worry-free printing experience.<br><strong>Tempered Glass LCD Protector</strong>: A 9H tempered glass protector shields the LCD screen from scratches and damage, providing a worry-free printing experience<em>,<span> </span></em>perfect for users searching for the<span> </span><strong>Best LCD 3D Printer</strong>.)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Section-Based Exposure</strong>: Customize exposure times for different sections of your print to fine-tune and optimize results for greater precision and quality,essential for anyone looking for a<span> </span><strong>high-resolution LCD 3D printer</strong>.)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Compatible with Mars Mate Air Purifier</strong>: When paired with the Mars Mate air purifier, resin odors are effectively reduced, with up to 95% purification efficiency for TVOC, ensuring a more comfortable work environment. This feature enhances the usability of the<span> </span><strong>3D printer for home use</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable Metal Frame</strong>: Built with a robust metal frame, the Mars 5 Ultra is designed for long-term durability, maintaining excellent performance through extended use, making it a top choice for anyone considering an<span> </span><strong>elegoo 3D printer in India</strong><span> </span>or a<span> </span><strong>fast LCD 3D printer for prototyping<br><br></strong><strong></strong><strong><br></strong>\n<h2>Note –</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>To achieve the print speed of 5.5s/layer, it is necessary to be in the fast print mode and under the Chitubox’s default parameters (including the default setting of exposure time at 2.5s).</li>\n<li>After replacing the release film, please click the refresh button on the device self-test page to reset the counter manually.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","mrp":31999,"salePrice":31999,"dealerPrice":31999,"stock":9,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443997553-822567081.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443997581-49239302.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443997569-917276751.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443997544-184803566.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443999300-736312697.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443999326-281529819.png","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0}],"variants":[{"id":"dd11200f-8f44-4758-9a38-db10678f8b20","productId":"542954da-f816-4e4a-ad02-1c563ba32550","sku":"elegoo-mars-5-ultra-9k-