lor adds a unique touch to your prints, making them stand out from the rest. With a diameter of 1.75mm and a weight of 1kg, this filament offers a versatile and cost-effective solution for your printing needs. Upgrade your 3D printing experience with this PLA Filament.</p>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">High Print Quality: Low shrinkage, Solve the problem of warping and blistering, improve the print quality. Uniform line diameter, pure color. High quality filament creates delicate artistic work</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Flows Easily: Higher fluidity, ultra-long use time also worry about not blocking the head, stable and worry-free, while the high fluidity can be adapted to faster printing speed</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Stability and Reliability: Toughness performance enhanced, the model is more stable, Great filament for your Creality printer, strength and durability. Neatly lined up, no knots</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Compatible Models： CR-PLA filament is wildly used in FDM 3D printers on the market.Compatible with most popular 3D printers such as MK3, Creality Ender series/CR series, ELEGOO, Anycubic, etc.</span></li>\n</ul>","shortDescription":"<p>This PLA Filament is designed for 3D printing and is made of premium PLA material, ensuring high quality and consistent performance. Its rainbow blaze color adds a unique touch to your prints, making them stand out from the rest. With a diameter of 1.75mm and a weight of 1kg, this filament offers a versatile and cost-effective solution for your printing needs. Upgrade your 3D printing experience with this PLA Filament.</p>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">High Print Quality: Low shrinkage, Solve the problem of warping and blistering, improve the print quality. Uniform line diameter, pure color. High quality filament creates delicate artistic work</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Flows Easily: Higher fluidity, ultra-long use time also worry about not blocking the head, stable and worry-free, while the high fluidity can be adapted to faster printing speed</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Stability and Reliability: Toughness performance enhanced, the model is more stable, Great filament for your Creality printer, strength and durability. Neatly lined up, no knots</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Compatible Models： CR-PLA filament is wildly used in FDM 3D printers on the market.Compatible with most popular 3D printers such as MK3, Creality Ender series/CR series, ELEGOO, Anycubic, etc.</span></li>\n</ul>","mrp":1199,"salePrice":1199,"dealerPrice":1199,"stock":0,"images":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444002252-229296651.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444002414-573333634.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444002473-576739644.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0},{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444002541-6168008.jpg","isPrimary":false,"isSecondary":false,"sortOrder":0}],"variants":[{"id":"e37c23c2-2179-45e9-9c18-23564504a464","productId":"6f397aa5-fa9f-45ca-889f-3fe914c12e76","sku":"silk-pla-filament-Default Title","price":"1199","salePrice":null,"stock":0,"weight":"1000","isDefault":false,"isActive":true,"variantSlug":null,"name":"Default Title","variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.fireba