Centauri Carbon</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"561\">The <strong data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"279\">Assembled Extruder Hotend Kit</strong> is a complete ready-to-install hotend assembly made specifically for Elegoo <strong data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"386\">Centauri Carbon / Centauri</strong> series 3D printers. It’s ideal for replacement, maintenance, or performance upgrades to keep your printer running smoothly and reliably. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n<h4 data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"590\">📦 <strong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"590\">What’s Included</strong>\n</h4>\n<ul data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"964\">\n<li data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"671\">\n<p data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"671\">Full hotend assembly with heater block, thermistor, and heatsink pre-assembled</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"799\">\n<p data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"799\">Hardened steel brass nozzle options (e.g., 0.2 mm, 0.4 mm, 0.6 mm, 0.8 mm) for different print detail and flow requirements</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"964\">\n<p data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"964\">Easy-to-mount design that plugs directly into the existing printer hardware<br data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"880\">(Exact contents may vary by SKU/nozzle choice) <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"990\">🔥 <strong data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"990\">Key Features</strong>\n</h4>\n<ul data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1885\">\n<li data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1174\">\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1174\"><strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1027\">Pre-assembled &amp; Plug-and-Play:</strong> Comes fully built — no need for manual fitting or calibration before use. Just swap in and start printing. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1377\">\n<p data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1377\"><strong data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1206\">High Thermal Performance:</strong> Uses a brass-hardened steel nozzle that heats evenly and conducts heat efficiently for stable extrusion and better layer adhesion. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1583\">\n<p data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1583\"><strong data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1405\">Durable Construction:</strong> Compatible with abrasive and high-temperature materials like carbon fiber reinforced filaments thanks to wear-resistant nozzle materials. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1750\">\n<p data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1750\"><strong data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1608\">Efficient Cooling:</strong> Aluminum heatsink promotes rapid heat dissipation for reliable filament flow and temperature control. <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1885\">\n<p data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1885\"><strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1771\">Print Quality:</strong> Helps reduce clogs, oozing, and heat-related artifacts for smoother prints.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","hasVariants":true,"isExclusive":false,"ratingCount":0,"reviewCount":0,"codAvailable":true,"latestReview":null,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443903741-683625887.png","totalReviews":0,"averageRating":0,"galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443903741-683625887.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443903669-118881622.webp","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443903667-509020831.webp"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443903741-683625887.png"],"weightInGrams":0,"isCodAvailable":true,"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.a