ility for consistent extrusion</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"890\">\n<p data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"890\">Protects the hotend from cooling drafts and debris</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"969\">\n<p data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"969\"><strong data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"912\">Durable Design:</strong> Long-lasting, flexible, and easy to install or replace</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1016\">\n<p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1016\"><strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"990\">Pack Contents:</strong> Set of 3 silicone socks</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1035\"><strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1033\">Advantages:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1149\">\n<li data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1074\">\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1074\">Extends hotend and nozzle lifespan</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1108\">\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1108\">Reduces maintenance frequency</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1149\">\n<p data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1149\">Ensures cleaner, more precise prints</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","hasVariants":false,"isExclusive":false,"ratingCount":0,"reviewCount":0,"codAvailable":true,"latestReview":null,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443932166-906333766.jpg","totalReviews":0,"averageRating":0,"galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443932166-906333766.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443932159-16957506.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443932169-389273353.jpg"],"variantImages":[],"weightInGrams":0,"isCodAvailable":true,"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443932159-16957506.jpg","primaryCategory":null,"is_cod_availa