ta-end=\"828\"><strong data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"858\">Heated Bed Temperature:</strong> 90°C – 110°C</p>\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"934\"><strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"888\">Tolerance:</strong> ± 0.02 mm for consistent, clog-free extrusion</p>\n<p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"986\"><strong data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"951\">Roundness:</strong> &gt; 95% for smooth, jam-free feeding</p>\n<p data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1041\"><strong data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1005\">Print Speed:</strong> 30 – 90 mm/s (Recommended: 50 mm/s)</p>\n<p data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1110\"><strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1069\">Recommended Platform:</strong> Glass plate with ABS slurry or PEI sheet</p>\n<p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1127\"><strong data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1127\">Advantages:</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1208\">🔧 <strong data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1159\">High Impact Strength:</strong> Withstands mechanical stress and rough handling.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1286\">🔥 <strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1244\">Excellent Heat Resistance:</strong> Maintains form and strength up to ~100°C.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1370\">💨 <strong data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1318\">Smooth Surface Finish:</strong> Prints with minimal warping and a sleek matte look.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1455\">🛠️ <strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1406\">Post-Processing Friendly:</strong> Easy to sand, machine, and acetone vapor smooth.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1546\">♻️ <strong data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1494\">Durable for Functional Parts:</strong> Ideal for automotive, enclosures, gears, and tools.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1565\"><strong data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1565\">Applications:</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1606\">Mechanical and functional prototypes</p>\n<p data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1642\">Automotive and industrial parts</p>\n<p data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1642\">Durable household items</p>\n<p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1715\">Custom enclosures and wear-resistant parts</p>\n<p data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1877\"><strong data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1740\">Storage Guidelines:</strong><br data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1743\">Store in a cool, dry place. For optimal performance, keep the filament sealed in a moisture-proof bag with desiccants when not in use.</p>","hasVariants":true,"isExclusive":false,"ratingCount":0,"reviewCount":0,"codAvailable":true,"latestReview":null,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443970788-192528383.png","totalReviews":0,"averageRating":0,"galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443970788-192528383.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443970663-561348294.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443971580-213839520.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443970646-473306360.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443977969-8074169.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443975748-382888395.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443976874-115407470.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443976525-192660363.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443980168-699569387.png"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443970788-192528383.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443970663-561348294.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasest