s.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re a hobbyist or a professional, our <strong>Silk multi-color 3D printer filament</strong> ensures precision, quality, and stunning aesthetic appeal.</p>\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Triple-Color Transition for Unique Visual Appeal:</strong> This <strong>Filamont</strong> <strong>Silk tri-color PLA filament</strong> combines Emerald green, purple and yellow into one strand, producing a mesmerizing color shift throughout the printed model. Ideal for both artistic and decorative prints, it’s the best choice for creative designs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Silky Smooth and Glossy Finish:</strong><span> </span>The<span> </span><strong>Filamont Silk Tri Color Gold, Blue, Purple 3D Printer Filament<span> </span></strong>silky texture delivers a polished, professional look straight off the printer, eliminating the need for post-processing or polishing. Its quality as a<span> </span><strong>3D printing filament</strong> ensures a premium finish.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High Dimensional Accuracy and Reliable Printing:</strong> With a 1.75mm diameter 3d printer filament and a tolerance of +/- 0.03mm, this <strong>3D printer filament</strong> ensures consistent, high-precision printing. It’s perfect for intricate designs and maintains accuracy for a range of <strong>3D printing materials</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tangle-Free and Bubble-Free Experience:</strong> Designed with high-quality spools to prevent tangling and bubbles, this <strong>Silk multi-color 3D printer filament</strong> ensures a smooth and hassle-free printing experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Compatible with Most FDM Printers:</strong> The <strong>Filamont Silk Tri Color Gold, Blue, Purple 3D Printer Filament</strong> is compatible with the majority of FDM printers, making it suitable for hobbyists, professionals, and everyone in between.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optimized Printing Parameters:</strong> Best results are achieved with a printing temperature between 190°C and 220°C and a heated bed temperature of 60-70°C. Adjust print speeds between 30-100mm/s for reliable and consistent prints using this <strong>3D printer filament</strong>.</li>\n</ul>","hasVariants":false,"isExclusive":false,"ratingCount":0,"reviewCount":0,"codAvailable":true,"latestReview":null,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443972385-387241541.jpg","totalReviews":0,"averageRating":0,"galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443972385-387241541.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443972400-128567996.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443982730-785739960.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443972386-775130633.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443975755-807517404.png"],"variantImages":[],"weightInGrams":0,"isCodAvailable":true,"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443972400-128567996.jpg","primaryCategory":null,"is_cod_available":true,"shortDescription":"<p>The<span> </span><strong>Filamont Silk Tri Color Gold, Blue, Purple 3D Printer Filament<span> </span></strong>is the perfect solution for anyone looking to achieve a glossy, silky finish with a dynamic color-changing appearance. This high-quality<span> </span><strong>3D printer filament</strong><span> </span>smoothly transitions between three vibrant colors<span> </span><strong>Gold, Blue and Purple<span> </span></strong>making your 3D models truly stand out. Designed for seamless use with most FDM printers, this <strong>3D printing material</strong> is ideal for artistic, decorative, and functional 3D printing projects.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re a hobbyist or a professional, our <strong>Silk multi-color 3D printer filament