 high-temperature hotend</strong><span> </span>supports<span> </span><strong>multi-material printing</strong>, including<span> </span><strong>PLA, ABS, ASA, PETG, and TPU</strong>, allowing users to create durable and visually impressive models effortlessly.<br><img sizes=\"(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px\" srcset=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover.webp 1500w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-300x169.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-1024x576.webp 1024w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-768x432.webp 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-1200x675.webp 1200w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover-150x84.webp 150w\" title=\"Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer – Advanced Multi-Color FDM 3D Printer for Professional-Grade Printing 1\" height=\"844\" width=\"1500\" alt=\"S1C cover\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/S1C_cover.webp\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-24831\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<h3>Key Features of Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D Printer</h3>\n<h4>1. Fully Enclosed CoreXY Motion System for Precision Printing</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1</strong><span> </span>utilizes<span> </span><strong>CoreXY technology</strong>, ensuring<span> </span><strong>motion efficiency</strong><span> </span>and minimal vibrations for<span> </span><strong>precise, high-speed 3D printing</strong>.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<strong>CoreXY motion system</strong><span> </span>for stability and speed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Large build volume</strong><span> </span>of 250 × 250 × 250mm for versatile applications.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>600mm/s printing speed</strong><span> </span>for faster production.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>20,000mm/s² acceleration</strong><span> </span>for ultra-fast movement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Resonance and dynamic flow compensation</strong><span> </span>for smooth, high-quality prints.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2. Multi-Color Printing with Automatic Filament Management</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo</strong><span> </span>supports<span> </span><strong>4-color and 8-color printing</strong>, enabling intricate,<span> </span><strong>multi-tone 3D printing</strong><span> </span>with smooth color transitions.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<strong>Automatic multi-filament system</strong><span> </span>for seamless color changes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Anti-filament entanglement system</strong><span> </span>to prevent disruptions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Auto-filament refill feature</strong><span> </span>for uninterrupted printing.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3. 320°C High-Temperature Hotend for Expanded Filament Compatibility</h4>\n<p>With its<span> </span><strong>320°C high-temperature hotend</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 3D printer</strong><span> </span>supports a variety of materials, making it a<span> </span><strong>versatile 3D printer</strong><span> </span>for different applications.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Compatible with<span> </span><strong>PLA, ABS, ASA, PETG, TPU, and more</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy-to-disassemble hotend</strong><span> </span>for effortless maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Anti-clogging nozzle design</strong><span> </span>for consistent extrusion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Aerospace-grade ceramic composite throat tube</strong><span> </span>for enhanced durability.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>4. Smart Automation and Intelligent Printing Features</h4>\n<p>Equipped with advanced automation, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1</strong><span> </span>enhances<span> </span><strong>print quality</strong><span> </span>and<span> </span><strong>efficiency</strong><span> </span>with intelligent monitoring.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<strong>LeviQ 3.0 auto-leveling</strong><span> </span>for precise first-layer calibration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Z-axis offset adjustment</strong><span> </span>for optimized adhesion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Spaghetti detection</strong><span> </span>to identify failed prints.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Belt-tension monitoring</strong><span> </span>for stable motion control.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power-loss resume function</strong><span> </span>to continue prints after interruptions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5. Ultra-Quiet Operation—Ideal for Home &amp; Office Use</h4>\n<p>Designed for<span> </span><strong>low-noise 3D printing</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1</strong><span> </span>operates at just<span> </span><strong>44dB</strong>, making it a<span> </span><strong>quiet 3D printer</strong><span> </span>suitable for any workspace.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<strong>44dB ultra-quiet mode</strong><span> </span>for disturbance-free printing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optimized cooling system</strong><span> </span>for efficient heat dissipation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>6. Integrated Filament Drying for Superior Print Quality</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic ACE Pro Filament Dryer</strong><span> </span>ensures<span> </span><strong>high-quality 3D prints</strong><span> </span>by keeping filaments dry and free from moisture-related defects.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<strong>2-in-1 printing and drying system</strong><span> </span>for enhanced material performance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Active drying technology</strong><span> </span>to eliminate warping and stringing.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>7. User-Friendly Design for Effortless Setup and Operation</h4>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Kobra S1 Combo 3D printer</strong><span> </span>is designed for ease of use, whether you’re a<span> </span><strong>beginner</strong><span> </span>or an experienced<span> </span><strong>3D printing professional</strong>.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>\n<strong>Quick assembly – start printing in just 15 minutes</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>4.3” adjustable touchscreen</strong><