djustable platform bracket ensures a perfect fit for the liquid level in the bucket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Ideal Compatibility:</strong><span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station<span> </span></strong>Designed to work seamlessly with most LCD, DLP, and SLA 3D printers such as<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO</strong><span> </span>Mars, Mars Pro, Mars C, Photon, Photon S, and more. The<span> </span><strong>ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station</strong><span> </span>provides exceptional support for washing and curing your 3D resin prints, making it an essential accessory for your printing setup.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Special Notes:</strong><span> </span>While the washing function is highly effective for most 3D models, it is not recommended for models printed with water washable resin. For such cases, we recommend using running water for optimal cleaning results.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"selectable-text copyable-text iq0m558w g0rxnol2\" dir=\"ltr\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15411\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity.webp\" alt=\"ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station ideal compatity\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" title=\"ELEGOO Mercury Plus 2 in 1 Washing and Curing Station 2\" srcset=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity.webp 970w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity-300x186.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity-768x475.webp 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/ELEGOO-Mercury-Plus-2-in-1-Washing-and-Curing-Station-ideal-compatity-150x93.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px\"></p>","ratingDistribution":{