></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unparalleled Precision:</strong><span> </span>With a stunning<span> </span><strong>9024×5120 pixel resolution</strong><span> </span>and pixel sizes of<span> </span><strong>17×17μm</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Photon Mono 4 LCD 3D Printer</strong> offers 105% better accuracy than most 3D printers, making it the<span> </span><strong>best Anycubic LCD 3D printer</strong><span> </span>for intricate designs and detailed prints.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fast Printing Speeds:</strong><span> </span>Equipped with reduced exposure times of just<span> </span><strong>1.5 seconds per layer</strong>, this<span> </span><strong>Anycubic resin 3D printer</strong><span> </span>enhances productivity, ensuring faster print times without compromising print quality, perfect for both home and professional setups.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Advanced LighTurbo Matrix Light Source:</strong><span> </span>The<span> </span><strong>LighTurbo Matrix</strong><span> </span>ensures even light distribution, which results in smoother, grid-free surfaces. This feature alone sets the<span> </span><strong>Photon Mono 4</strong><span> </span>apart as one of the best 3D printers for flawless, high-detail prints.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Large Print Volume:</strong><span> </span>Boasting a<span> </span><strong>2.2L print volume</strong><span> </span>with dimensions of<span> </span><strong>153.4mm x 87mm x 165mm</strong>, this versatile printer can handle a wide range of printing needs, making it one of the best 3D printers in India for both small and large projects.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Enhanced Build Platform:</strong><span> </span>The redesigned build platform features laser-engraved patterns for<span> </span><strong>optimal adhesion</strong><span> </span>and easy model removal. This enhancement minimizes the risk of warping and improves the overall success rate of prints.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power-Resumption Function:</strong><span> </span>With a built-in<span> </span><strong>power-resumption feature</strong>, the<span> </span><strong>Photon Mono 4</strong><span> </span>can automatically resume printing from where it left off after a power outage, minimizing material waste and downtime.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Activated Carbon Air Purifier:</strong><span> </span>An optional built-in air purifier equipped with a high-density activated carbon filter reduces odors and improves air quality during the printing process, making this printer an ideal choice for<span> </span><strong>home 3D printing</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Photon Workshop Integration:</strong><span> </span>The  <strong>Anycubic Photon Mono 4 LCD 3D Printer<span> </span></strong>integrates seamlessly with<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Photon Workshop</strong>, providing advanced features like automated support generation, customizable optimizations, and access to the Makeronline model library, offering a complete and efficient workflow for professionals and hobbyists alike.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Compatible with</strong><span> </span><strong>Resin:</strong><span> </span>The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Photon Mono 4</strong><span> </span><strong>LCD 3D Printer<span> </span></strong>is compatible with<span> </span><strong>Filamont resin</strong><span> </span>and other<span> </span><strong>405nm resins</strong>, ensuring top-quality results with low odor and minimal irritation, further cementing its place as the<span> </span><strong>best resin 3D printer</strong><span> </span>for users in India.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Choose the Anycubic Photon Mono 4 LCD 3D Printer in India?</strong></p>\n<p>Looking for the<span> </span><strong>best 3D printer</strong><span> </span>in India? The<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Photon Mono 4</strong><span> </span>is perfect for hobbyists, professionals, and enthusiasts alike, offering a combination of precision, speed, and reliability. Whether you’re a beginner or an expert, this printer provides the best of<span> </span><strong>resin 3D printing technology</strong><span> </span>at an affordable price.</p>\n<p><strong>Buy<span> </span></strong>the<span> </span><strong>Anycubic Photon Mono 4 LCD 3D Printer in India</strong></p>","hasVariants":false,"isExclusive":false,"ratingCount":0,"reviewCount":0,"codAvailable":true,"latestReview":null,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443995073-374620525.png","totalReviews":0,"averageRating":0,"galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443995073-374620525.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443995034-594187140.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443995667-351995132.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443995273-722928702.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443996711-194387537.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443998468-584173559.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443998491-768129953.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443998572-782849264.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443998964-568684720.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444000739-49244674.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444000717-727605197.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444000847-689069870.png"],"variantImages":[],"weightInGrams":0,"isCodAvailable":true,"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443995034-594187140.png","primaryCategory":null,"is_cod_available":true,"sho