tection system keeps your printer safe from any mishaps, allowing you to print with peace of mind.</p>","hasVariants":true,"isExclusive":false,"ratingCount":0,"reviewCount":0,"codAvailable":true,"latestReview":null,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443976761-576025593.jpg","totalReviews":0,"averageRating":0,"galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443976761-576025593.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443976800-533703116.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443976607-126340200.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443976931-91314257.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443976761-576025593.jpg"],"weightInGrams":0,"isCodAvailable":true,"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443976800-533703116.jpg","primaryCategory":null,"is_cod_available":true,"shortDescription":"<p><strong>Bambu Lab X1 Carbon Combo 3D Printer</strong></p>\n<p>Experience the future of desktop FDM 3D printing with the<span> </span><strong>Bambu Lab X1 Carbon Combo 3D Printer</strong>. This<span> </span><strong>multicolour 3d printing</strong><span> </span>state-of-the-art printer combines speed, versatility, and high-quality results to bring your creative projects to life. With its advanced features and innovative design, the X1 Carbon is the perfect<span> </span><strong>Best enclosed FDM 3D printer</strong><span> </span>choice for professionals and enthusiasts alike.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15160\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Bambu-Lab-X1-Carbon-Combo-3D-Printer-scaled.webp\" alt=\"Bambu Lab X1 Carbon Combo 3D P