r-Speed-300x146.webp 300w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Bambu-Lab-X1-Carbon-Combo-3D-Printer-Designed-For-Speed-1024x497.webp 1024w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Bambu-Lab-X1-Carbon-Combo-3D-Printer-Designed-For-Speed-768x373.webp 768w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Bambu-Lab-X1-Carbon-Combo-3D-Printer-Designed-For-Speed-1536x745.webp 1536w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Bambu-Lab-X1-Carbon-Combo-3D-Printer-Designed-For-Speed-2048x994.webp 2048w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Bambu-Lab-X1-Carbon-Combo-3D-Printer-Designed-For-Speed-1200x582.webp 1200w, https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Bambu-Lab-X1-Carbon-Combo-3D-Printer-Designed-For-Speed-150x73.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\"></p>\n<p>One of the standout features of The<span> </span><strong>Bambu Lab X1 Carbon</strong><span> </span>is its<span> </span><strong>multicolour 3d printing</strong><span> </span>capability. With the ability to handle up to 16 different colors, you can bring your designs to life with vibrant and eye-catching prints. Whether you’re working on complex models or artistic creations, the<strong><span> </span>X1 Carbon</strong><span> </span>delivers exceptional results every time making it<span> </span><strong>high precision FDM 3D printer.</strong></p>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"><strong>AI-Powered Evolution</strong></h3>\n<p>The<span> </span><strong>X1 Carbon</strong><span> </span>is designed for speed and performance. With its 7 μm lidar resolution, you can expect high-quality prints with fine details and smooth finishes. Additionally, the printer features dual auto bed leveling, ensuring a perfectly level printing surface for optimal results.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15163\" src=\"https://protomont.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Bambu-Lab-X1-Carbon-Combo-3D-Printer-AI-Powered-Evolution-dual-automated-b