-start=\"583\" data-end=\"599\">Key Features</strong></h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"635\"><strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"635\">• High-Speed CoreXY System</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"852\">\n<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"696\">\n<p data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"696\">Fast print speeds up to 600 mm/s with high acceleration.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"785\">\n<p data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"785\">Precise motion system ensures clean details, sharp edges, and smooth surface finish.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"852\">\n<p data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"852\">Ideal for both rapid prototyping and functional part production.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"886\"><strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"886\">• Fully Enclosed Chamber</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"1100\">\n<li data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"951\">\n<p data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"951\">Enclosure stabilizes temperature for improved print quality.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1028\">\n<p data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1028\">Suitable for materials that require controlled environmental conditions.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1100\">\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1100\">Built-in air filtration helps reduce fumes and odors during printing.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1137\"><strong data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1137\">• Powerful Extrusion System</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1358\">\n<li data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1208\">\n<p data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1208\">High-torque extruder provides strong and consistent filament flow.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1268\">\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1268\">Optimized for standard and engineering-grade materials.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1358\">\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1358\">Intelligent monitoring detects feed resistance, clogs, or filament issues in real time.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1398\"><strong data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1398\">• Smart Flow &amp; Quality Control</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1614\">\n<li data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1482\">\n<p data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1482\">Advanced flow monitoring adjusts extrusion automatically for consistent layers.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1551\">\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1551\">Adaptive part cooling ensures better overhangs and fine details.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1614\">\n<p data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1614\">Maintains chamber stability to minimize warping and defects.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1664\"><strong data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1664\">• Heated Bed with Multi-Material Support</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1927\">\n<li data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1732\">\n<p data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1732\">Heated build plate reaches high temperatures for firm adhesion.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1927\">\n<p data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1779\">Compatible with a wide range of filaments:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1927\">\n<li data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1789\">\n<p data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1789\">PLA</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1799\">\n<p data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1799\">ABS</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1810\">\n<p data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1810\">PETG</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1820\">\n<p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1820\">ASA</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1829\">\n<p data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1829\">PC</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1839\">\n<p data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1839\">TPU</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1851\">\n<p data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1851\">Nylon</p>\n</li>\n<li data-st