76.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443954349-295390176.jpg"}],"avgRating":0,"salePrice":1399,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443954349-295390176.jpg","categories":[],"categoryId":null,"isFeatured":false,"weightUnit":"g","categoryIds":[],"category_id":"38e835e1-457d-462b-a466-c1f4a2ee3a04","dealerPrice":1399,"description":"<h3 data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"110\"><strong data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"114\">PEO PET Double-Sided Build Plate for Bambu Lab A1 mini – Textured &amp; Carbon Fiber Spring Steel Sheet</strong></h3>\n<p data-end=\"535\" data-start=\"219\">Upgrade your Bambu Lab A1 Mini 3D printer with this high-performance <strong data-end=\"324\" data-start=\"288\">PEO PET double-sided build plate</strong>, engineered for superior print adhesion, easy removal, and long-lasting durability. This flexible spring steel sheet features two distinct textures to optimize your printing experience across various materials.</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"562\" data-start=\"537\">🔹 <strong data-end=\"562\" data-start=\"545\">Key Features:</strong>\n</h4>\n<p data-end=\"588\" data-start=\"566\"><strong data-end=\"588\" data-start=\"566\">Dual-Sided Design:</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"593\"><strong data-end=\"624\" data-start=\"593\">Carbon Fiber Textured Side:</strong> Perfect for printing with PLA, PETG, and TPU. Delivers a clean, smooth finish on the print base and strong initial layer adhesion.</p>\n<p data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"760\"><strong data-end=\"797\" data-start=\"760\">3D Geometric Textured (PET) Side:</strong> Specially designed for high-temperature filaments like ABS, ASA, and PC. Its raised geometric surface ensures excellent grip, minimizing warping and improving print stability.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"977\"><strong data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"977\">PEO Coating Technology:</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"1112\" data-start=\"1009\">PEO (Plasma Electrolytic Oxidation) surface treatment enhances adhesion without needing glue or sprays.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1192\" data-start=\"1117\">Offers strong anti-scratch performance and long-lasting release properties.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1224\" data-start=\"1196\"><strong data-end=\"1224\" data-start=\"1196\">Spring Steel Flex Plate:</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"1291\" data-start=\"1229\">Made from premium spring steel for durability and flexibility.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1360\" data-start=\"1296\">Simply flex the plate to pop off prints with no tools or damage.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1402\" data-start=\"1364\"><strong data-end=\"1402\" data-start=\"1364\">Easy Installation &amp; Compatibility:</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1407\">Works seamlessly with the magnetic base of the Bambu Lab A1 Mini 3D printer.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1558\" data-start=\"1488\">Size precision-matched for a perfect fit and hassle-free installation.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1562\"><strong data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1562\">Warp-Resistant &amp; Heat Stable:</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"1648\" data-start=\"1600\">Maintains flatness even under high temperatures.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1702\" data-start=\"1653\">Designed to withstand continuous printing cycles.</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"1739\" data-start=\"1704\">🔹 <strong data-end=\"1739\" data-start=\"1712\">Product Specifications:</strong>\n</h4>\n<p data-end=\"1783\" data-start=\"1742\"><strong data-end=\"1765\" data-start=\"1742\">Compatible Printer:</strong> Bambu Lab A1 Mini</p>\n<p data-end=\"1852\" data-start=\"1786\"><strong data-end=\"1799\" data-start=\"1786\">Material:</strong> PEI-coated spring steel with PEO-treated PET surface</p>\n<p data-end=\"1912\" data-start=\"1855\"><strong data-end=\"1864\" data-start=\"1855\">Size:</strong> Precise fit for A1 Mini (180mm x 180mm approx.)</p>\n<p data-end=\"1985\" data-start=\"1915\"><strong data-end=\"1925\" data-start=\"1915\">Sides:</strong> Dual-sided (Carbon Fiber Textured + Geometric PET Textured)</p>\n<p data-end=\"2055\" data-start=\"1988\"><strong data-end=\"2006\" data-start=\"1988\">Magnetic Base:</strong> Not included (requires compatible magnetic base)</p>\n<hr data-end=\"2060\" data-start=\"2057\">\n<h3 data-end=\"2101\" data-start=\"2062\">💡 <strong data-end=\"2101\" data-start=\"2069\">Why Choose This Build Plate?</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"2348\" data-start=\"2102\">Get the best of both worlds with one build sheet. Whether you're printing delicate PLA models or high-temp ABS parts, this plate adapts to your needs—no more switching between plates. Durable, easy to clean, and made for pros and hobbyists alike.</p>","hasVariants":true,"isExclusive":false,"ratingCount":0,"reviewCount":0,"codAvailable":true,"latestReview":null,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443954349-295390176.jpg","totalReviews":0,"averageRating":0,"galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443954349-295390176.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443954427-959774960.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443954361-340831989.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443954349-295390176.jpg"],"weightInGrams":0,"isCodAvailable":true,"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443954427-959774960.jpg","primaryCategory":null,"is_cod_available":true,"shortDescription":"<h3 data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"110\"><strong data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"114\">PEO PET Double-Sided Build Plate for Bambu Lab A1 mini – Textured &amp; Carbon Fiber Spring Steel Sheet</strong></h3>\n<p data-end=\"535\" data-start=\"219\">Upgrade your Bambu Lab A1 Mini 3D printer with this high-performance <strong data-end=\"324\" data-start=\"288\">PEO PET double-sided build plate</strong>, engineered for superior print adhesion, easy removal, and long-lasting durability. This flexible spring steel sheet features two distinct textures to optimize your printing experience across various materials.</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"562\" data-start=\"537\">🔹 <strong data-end=\"562\" data-start=\"545\">Key Features:</strong>\n</h4>\n<p data-end=\"588\" data-start=\"566\"><strong data-end=\"588\" data-start=\"566\">Dual-Sided Design:</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"593\"><strong data-end=\"624\" data-start=\"593\">Carbon Fiber Textured Side:</strong> Perfect for printing with PLA, PETG, and TPU. Delivers a clean, smooth finish on the print base and strong initial layer adhesion.</p>\n<p data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"760\"><strong data-end=\"797\" data-start=\"760\">3D Geometric Textured (PET) Side:</strong> Specially designed for high-temperature filaments like ABS, ASA, and PC. Its raised geometric surface ensures excellent grip, minimizing warping and improving print stability.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"977\"><strong data-end=\"1004\" data-start=\"977\">PEO Coating Technology:</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"1112\" data-start=\"1009\">PEO (Plasma Electrolytic Oxidation) surface treatment enhances adhesion without needing glue or sprays.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1192\" data-start=\"1117\">Offers strong anti-scratch performance and long-lasting release properties.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1224\" data-start=\"1196\"><strong data-end=\"1224\" data-start=\"1196\">Spring Steel Flex Plate:</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"1291\" data-start=\"1229\">Made from premium spring steel for durability and flexibility.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1360\" data-start=\"1296\">Simply flex the plate to pop off prints with no tools or damage.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1402\" data-start=\"1364\"><strong data-end=\"1402\" data-start=\"1364\">Easy Installation &amp; Compatibility:</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1407\">Works seamlessly with the magnetic base of the Bambu Lab A1 Mini 3D printer.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1558\" data-start=\"1488\">Size precision-matched for a perfect fit and hassle-free installation.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1562\"><strong data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1562\">Warp-Resistant &amp; Heat Stable:</strong></p>\n<p data-end=\"1648\" data-start=\"1600\">Maintains flatness even under high temperatures.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1702\" data-start=\"1653\">Designed to withstand continuous printing cycles.</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"1739\" data-start=\"1704\">🔹 <strong data-end=\"1739\" data-start=\"1712\">Product Specifications:</strong>\n</h4>\n<p data-end=\"1783\" data-start=\"1742\"><strong data-end=\"1765\" data-start=\"1742\">Compatible Printer:</strong> Bambu Lab A1 Mini</p>\n<p data-end=\"1852\" data-start=\"1786\"><strong data-end=\"1799\" data-start=\"1786\">Material:</strong> PEI-coated spring steel with PEO-treated PET surface</p>\n<p data-end=\"1912\" data-start=\"1855\"><strong data-end=\"1864\" data-start=\"1855\">Size:</strong> Precise fit for A1 Mini (180mm x 180mm approx.)</p>\n<p data-end=\"1985\" data-start=\"1915\"><strong data-end=\"1925\" data-start=\"1915\">Sides:</strong> Dual-sided (Carbon Fiber Textured + Geometric PET Textured)</p>\n<p data-end=\"2055\" data-start=\"1988\"><strong data-end=\"2006\" data-start=\"1988\">Magnetic Base:</strong> Not included (requires compatible magnetic base)</p>\n<hr data-end=\"2060\" data-start=\"2057\">\n<h3 data-end=\"2101\" data-start=\"2062\">💡 <strong data-end=\"2101\" data-start=\"2069\">Why Choose This Build Plate?</strong>\n</h3>\n<p data-end=\"2348\" data-start=\"2102\">Get the best of both worlds with one build sheet. Whether you're printing delicate PLA models or high-temp ABS parts, this plate adapts to your needs—no more switching between plates. Durable, easy to clean, and made for pros and hobbyists alike.</p>","ratingDistribu