.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/Frame_1123861052_2.png?v=1739821896\"></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>Compensation</strong><br>The A1 revolutionizes flow control in 3D printing. It utilizes a high-resolution, high-frequency eddy current sensor to measure the pressure in the nozzle. Our algorithm actively compensates the flow rate according to the readings to extrude with accuracy.</span></p>\n<p><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0848/9943/0675/files/Frame_1123861207_3.png?v=1739821957\"></span></p>\n<h4>Features:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Full-auto Calibration</li>\n<li>Multi-Color Printing (Combo Version)</li>\n<li>Active Flow Rate Compensation</li>\n<li>1-Clip Quick Swap Nozzle</li>\n<li>Active Motor Noise Cancelling</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h4>Package Includes:</h4>\n<p>1 x Bambu Lab A1</p>\n<p>1 x Spool Holder</p>\n<p>1 x Purge Wiper</p>\n<p>1 x Build Plate</p>\n<p>2 x PTFE Tube</p>\n<p>1 x Bambu Filament Samples</p>\n<p>1 x Stainless Steel Nozzle (pre-installed)</p>\n<p>1 x Accessory Box</p>\n<p>1 x AMS lite Stand</p>\n<p>1 x AMS lite Body</p>\n<p>4 x AMS lite Rotary Spool Holder</p>","hasVariants":true,"isExclusive":false,"ratingCount":0,"reviewCount":0,"codAvailable":true,"latestReview":null,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png","totalReviews":0,"averageRating":0,"galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987703-965173219.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987705-34763505.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987857-801857893.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443987818-311465226.png"],"weightInGrams":0,"isCodAvai