rformance. Its rainbow blaze color adds a unique touch to your prints, making them stand out from the rest. With a diameter of 1.75mm and a weight of 1kg, this filament offers a versatile and cost-effective solution for your printing needs. Upgrade your 3D printing experience with this PLA Filament.</p>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">High Print Quality: Low shrinkage, Solve the problem of warping and blistering, improve the print quality. Uniform line diameter, pure color. High quality filament creates delicate artistic work</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Flows Easily: Higher fluidity, ultra-long use time also worry about not blocking the head, stable and worry-free, while the high fluidity can be adapted to faster printing speed</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Stability and Reliability: Toughness performance enhanced, the model is more stable, Great filament for your Creality printer, strength and durability. Neatly lined up, no knots</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Compatible Models： CR-PLA filament is wildly used in FDM 3D printers on the market.Compatible with most popular 3D printers such as MK3, Creality Ender series/CR series, ELEGOO, Anycubic, etc.</span></li>\n</ul>","hasVariants":true,"isExclusive":false,"ratingCount":0,"reviewCount":0,"codAvailable":true,"latestReview":null,"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444002252-229296651.jpg","totalReviews":0,"averageRating":0,"galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444002252-229296651.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444002414-573333634.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444002473-576739644.jpg","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444002541-6168008.jpg"],"variantImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444002252-229296651.jpg"],"weightInGrams":0,"isCodAvailable":true,"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444002414-573333634.jpg","primaryCategory":null,"is_cod_available":true,"shortDescription":"<p>This PLA Filament is designed for 3D printing and is made of premium PLA material, ensuring high quality and consistent performance. Its rainbow blaze color adds a unique touch to your prints, making them stand out from the rest. With a diameter of 1.75mm and a weight of 1kg, this filament offers a versatile and cost-effective solution for your printing needs. Upgrade your 3D printing experience with this PLA Filament.</p>\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">High Print Quality: Low shrinkage, Solve the problem of warping and blistering, improve the print quality. Uniform line diameter, pure color. High quality filament creates delicate artistic work</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Flows Easily: Higher fluidity, ultra-long use time also worry about not blocking the head, stable and worry-free, while the high fluidity can be adapted to faster printing speed</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Stability and Reliability: Toughness performance enhanced, the model is more stable, Great filament for your Creality printer, strength and durability. Neatly lined up, no knots</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Compatible Models： CR-PLA filament is wildly used in FDM 3D printers on the market.Compatible with most popular 3D printers such as MK3, Creality Ender series/CR series, ELEGOO, Anycubic, etc.</span></li>\n</ul>","ratingD