],"weight":"25000","isActive":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-19T06:56:46.021Z","deletedAt":null,"isDefault":false,"productId":"c77f15d7-79b7-4eeb-8500-94b018bdfa79","salePrice":null,"updatedAt":"2026-07-19T06:56:46.021Z","variantSlug":null,"optionValues":{"variant":"H2D Combo 40W Laser Version"},"primaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443914354-308677470.jpg","galleryImages":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443914354-308677470.jpg"],"variantImages":[{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443914354-308677470.jpg","isPrimary":false,"sortOrder":0,"isSecondary":false}],"secondaryImage":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443914354-308677470.jpg"}],"avgRating":0,"salePrice":380999,"thumbnail":"https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784443913843-285048106.jpg","categories":[],"categoryId":null,"isFeatured":false,"weightUnit":"g","categoryIds":[],"category_id":"818c760a-e5d6-42fa-a68d-78bf45f3659d","dealerPrice":380999,"description":"<h1 data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"201\"><strong data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"201\">Bambu Lab H2D – Product Description </strong></h1>\n<p data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"563\">The <strong data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"224\">Bambu Lab H2D</strong> is an advanced all-in-one manufacturing workstation designed for creators, engineers, makers and small businesses. Available exclusively on <strong data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"378\">3D Galaxy</strong>, the H2D brings together high-speed 3D printing, laser engraving/cutting, digital cutting/blade work, and pen-plotting capabilities — all in one powerful and compact desktop machine.</p>\n<p data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"748\">With a large build volume, dual-nozzle system, precision motion calibration and multiple toolhead options, the H2D is built for both professional prototyping and creative fabrication.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"753\">\n<h2 data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"776\"><strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"776\">✨ Key Features</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"1296\">\n<li data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"831\">\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"831\">High-speed, high-precision 3D printing performance</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"910\">\n<p data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"910\">Dual-nozzle independent system for multi-material and multi-color printing</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"994\">\n<p data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"994\">Fully enclosed chamber with temperature control for engineering-grade materials</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1062\">\n<p data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1062\">Large build size suitable for big projects and batch production</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1141\">\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1141\">Smart monitoring: nozzle camera, filament detection, real-time diagnostics</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1220\">\n<p data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1220\">Multi-function capability: 3D printing, laser work, blade cutting, drawing</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1296\">\n<p data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1296\">Expandable system with versatile toolheads for different workflow needs</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1301\">\n<h1 data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1340\"><strong data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1340\">Available Variants at 3D Galaxy</strong></h1>\n<hr data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1345\">\n<h2 data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1377\"><strong data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1377\">1️⃣ Bambu Lab H2D Combo</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1593\">The standard H2D Combo includes the full 3D printing setup along with the multi-material system. This variant is ideal for users who require <strong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1559\">high-qualit